y: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">, it provides a comprehensive approach to improve erectile function, enhance sensual performance, and increase overall sensual satisfaction. The tablet form offers convenience and ease of use. By choosing this, men can regain their sensual confidence, improve their intimate relationships, and experience a more satisfying and fulfilling sensual life. However, it is essential to consult with a healthcare professional for proper guidance and to ensure the safe and effective use of this medication.</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1832, 4, 1, 1, '2023-07-12 10:23:43', '2026-06-30 06:46:40', NULL);
