Citrate 100mg</a></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">, an active ingredient renowned for its efficacy in treating ED. This medication is designed to address the challenges faced by individuals experiencing difficulties in achieving or maintaining an erection during sensual activity. The formulation typically contains&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-super-active-24\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Sildenafil 100mg</span></strong></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">, a dosage recognized for its effectiveness in enhancing sensual performance.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Dosage and Administration</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">The recommended dosage of&nbsp