so-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;should not be taken more than once a day, and users are advised to avoid consuming excessive amounts of alcohol alongside the medication. Alcohol can amplify the potential for side effects and may decrease the effectiveness of </span><a href=\"/blog/a-top-notch-remedy-for-ed-with-sildigra-super-active\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Sildenafil</span></strong></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Duration of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">One of the notable features of&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/blog/a-top-notch-remedy-for-ed-with-sildigra-super-active\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Sildigra Super Active</span></strong></a><spa