font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;relaxes blood vessels, improving blood flow to the penile area. Conversely,&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-citrate-tadalafil-23\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Tadalafil</span></strong></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><a href=\"/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-citrate-tadalafil-23\">&nbsp;</a>is a member of the PDE5 inhibitor class as well, but it acts more slowly, allowing for prolonged sustained blood flow.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Action Mechanism:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">As soon as it is ingested,</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-citrate-tadalafil-23\">Sildalist 120</a></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;begins to work by blocking the PDE5 enzyme, which is in charge of the blood vessels in the penile region constricting. This promotes increased blood flow to the genital area by relaxing smooth muscles and dilating blood vesse