variant-position: normal; font-size: 14pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"/blog/unveiling-the-potent-enhancer-of-male-sensual-functioning-with-kamagra-50mg\"><strong><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-size: 14pt;\">Sildenafil 50mg</span></strong></a><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;is the active ingredient. This substance works by blocking PDE-5 (phosphodiesterase), an enzyme that breaks up cyclic guanosine monophosphate (cGMP). cGMP is the chemical messenger that causes smooth muscles in the penile artery to relax, leading to more blood flow into the genital area. Inhibiting PDE5,&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/blog/unveiling-the-potent-enhancer-of-male-sensual-functioning-with-kamagra-50mg\"><strong><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-size: 14pt;\">Kamagra 50mg</span></strong></a><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;delays the breakdown of cGMP. That, in turn, prolongs penile engorgement and allows you to maintain an erection for a longer period.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-size: 14pt;\">Benefits of <a href=\"/blog/unveiling-the-potent-enhancer-of-male-sensual-functioning-with-kamagra-50mg\">Kamagra 50</a></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-indent: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"/blog/unveiling-the-potent-enhancer-of-male-sensual-functioning-with-kamagra-50mg\"><strong><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-size: 14pt;\">Kamagra 50mg</span></strong></a><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;has proved effective in combating <a href=\"/blog/unveiling-the-potent-enhancer-of-male-sensual-functioning-with-kamagra-50mg\"><strong>erectile dysfun