.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Dose</span></strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Use this medication only after consulting with your doctor.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"/blog/a-medicine-to-get-long-lasting-erections-with-silvitra-120mg\">Silvitra 120mg</a>&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">is typically an ideal dose for men experiencing erection problems.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">The dose should be taken only once every 24 hours, about 30 minutes before beginning sensual activity.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">To ensure proper absorption, take the dose on an empty stomach with a full glass of water.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Breaking, crushing, or chewing the tablet may reduce its effectiveness.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Avoid fatty foods and alcohol while taking&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/blog/a-medicine-to-get-long-lasting-erections-with-silvitra-120mg\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Silvitra</span></strong></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><a href=\"/blog/a-medicine-to-get-long-lasting-erections-with-silvitra-120mg\">&nbsp;</a>because they may interfere with pill absorption.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Meals high in fat content, grapefruit products, and alcohol should be avoided when taking&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://rsmmultilinkllp.blogspot.com/2024/01/a-medicine-to-get-long-lasting.html\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Silvitra 120mg</span></strong></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;because they can impair absorption and increase the risk of adverse effects.</span></li>\r\n<