en can suffer from this issue. There are a lot of causes responsible for this sensual condition in males.</p><p><strong>Types of Erectile Disorder or Impotence</strong></p><p>There are two types of <a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/blog/a-safe-private-treatment-for-erection-failure-or-ed-with-aurogra-100mg\"><strong>erectile disorder</strong></a> in men:</p><p><strong>Primary ED:</strong></p><p>This type of <a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/blog/a-safe-private-treatment-for-erection-failure-or-ed-with-aurogra-100mg\"><strong>erectile disorder</strong></a> is caused in men who are not able to gain or even maintain an erection during sensual contact with the lady. This does not allow men to gain satisfaction from the sensual contact.</p><p><strong>Secondary ED:</strong></p><p>This type of <a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/aurogra-100\"><strong>erectile disorder</strong></a> is caused in men who were earlier able to gain erections but now are unable to gain any during the lovemaking activity.</p><p><strong>Physical causes of </strong><a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/aurogra-100\"><strong>erectile disorder</strong></a><strong> or Impotence</strong></p><p>Common causes include:</p><ul><li>Heart disease</li><li>Clogged blood vessels (atherosclerosis)</li><li>High cholesterol</li><li>High blood pressure</li><li>Diabetes</li><li>Obesity</li><li>Metabolic syndrome</li><li>Parkinson\'s disease</li><li>Multiple sclerosis</li><li>Certain prescription medications</li><li>Tobacco use</li><li>Peyronie\'s disease</li><li>Alcoholism and other forms of substance abuse</li><li>Sleep disorders</li><li>Treatments for prostate cancer or enlarged prostate</li><li>Surgeries or injuries that affect the male organ area or spinal cord</li><li>Low testosterone</li></ul><p><strong>Psychological causes of </strong><a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/blog/a-safe-private-treatment-for-erection-failure-or-ed-with-aurogra-100mg\"><strong>erectile disorder</strong></a><strong> or ED</strong></p><ul><li>Depression, anxiety or other mental health conditions</li><li>Stress</li><li>Relationship problems due to stress, poor communication or other concerns</li></ul><p><strong>Symptoms of </strong><a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/blog/a-safe-private-treatment-for-erection-failure-or-ed-with-aurogra-100mg\"><strong>erectile disorder </strong></a><strong>or Impotence</strong></p><ul><li>Not being able to gain an erection</li><li>Unable to maintain an erection</li><li>Low sensual drive</li><li>Low sensual stamina</li></ul><p><strong>Impact of </strong><a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/blog/a-safe-private-treatment-for-erection-failure-or-ed-with-aurogra-100mg\"><strong>erectile disorder</strong></a><strong> on fertility</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/blog/a-safe-private-treatment-for-erection-failure-or-ed-with-aurogra-100mg\"><strong>Erectile disorder</strong></a> does not impact the fertility of men directly but it can make the sensual interaction very difficult. It is essential to find a solution for the underlying cause of erectile disorder if you are experiencing infertility.</p><p><strong>Diagnosis of </strong><a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/blog/a-safe-private-treatment-for-erection-failure-or-ed-with-aurogra-100mg\"><strong>erectile disorder </strong></a><strong>or Impotence</strong></p><p>The problem of <a href=\"https://rsmmultilinkllp.blogspot.com/2024/02/a-safe-private-treatment-for-erection.html\"><strong>erectile disorder</strong></a> can be diagnosed with the help of a healthcare provider. He conducts a variety of medical tests and physical examinations. He might even ask you questions linked to your medical history. He might even perform blood tests to check for any kind of underlying health conditions, a psychological examination. His main purpose is to assess the flow of blood to the male organ.</p><p><strong>Treatment of </strong><a href=\"https://rsmmultilinkllp.blogspot.com/2024/02/a-