nt-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 等线; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt;\">, it helps to improve blood flow to the penis, enabling men to achieve and maintain a firm erection during sensual activity. This medication can lead to increased sensual confidence, improved intimacy, and a more satisfying sensual experience. However, it is crucial to consult with a healthcare professional for proper guidance and to ensure the safe and effective use of this medication.</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1905, 4, 1, 1, '2023-07-14 11:13:34', '2026-06-14 00:46:18', NULL),
