t-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">, offering a dual-action solution to common intimate challenges. Presented by</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/\">RSM Multilink LLP</a></span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">, a great innovative solution for your sensual concerns.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><u><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14pt;\">Dual-Action Wonders:</span></u></strong><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">The</span><a href=\"/product/viewdetail/extra-super-m-force-sildenafil-100-usp-dapoxetine-100mg\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14pt;\"> Extra Super M Force </span></strong></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\"><a href=\"/product/viewdetail/extra-super-m-force-sildenafil-100-usp-dapoxetine-100mg\"><strong>tablet</strong>,</a> an amalgamation of </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"/product/viewdetail/extra-super-m-force-sildenafil-100-usp-dapoxetine-100mg\">Sildenafil</a> </span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">and</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/product/viewdetail/extra-super-m-force-sildenafil-100-usp-dapoxetine-100mg\">Dapoxetine<