ont-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">How Tadagra Strong Works</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"/blog/treat-men-s-sensual-dysfunction-with-a-powerful-solution-tadagra-strong\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Tadagra Strong</span></strong></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;works by increasing blood flow to the genital area, specifically the genital part. It achieves this by inhibiting the action of the PDE5 enzyme, which is responsible for breaking down cGMP. This chemical relaxes smooth muscles and dilates blood vessels, facilitating increased blood flow. By inhibiting PDE5,&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/blog/treat-men-s-sensual-dysfunction-with-a-powerful-solution-tadagra-strong\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Tadagra Strong</span></strong></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;prolongs the action of cGMP, leading to improved blood circulation and, consequently, a firmer and longer-lasting erection.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Benefits of <a href=\"/blog/treat-m