ine\'s rapid action mechanism is only activated by sensual penetration.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">When a person is on medication, they have the opportunity to increase sensual desire with satisfactory results.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">The medication acts directly on the bloodstream of the penile region and is effective in improving men\'s sensual health.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">How does it work?</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">The oral medication promotes satisfying lovemaking by resolving mild to moderate health issues. It is capable of reversing physical and psychological health factors while improving sensual health. It helps to reduce male dissatisfaction by promoting desirable and attractive outcomes. The medicine works well when flawless sensual performance is achieved.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-si