(467, 'Treating Erectile Dysfunction Effectively with Sildigra Super Active', 'treating-erectile-dysfunction-effectively-with-sildigra-super-active', 'images/2at3GgkIdtUqxeoVOMrVkgUvjaTd3maoiNHAZTTI.png', 'Sildigra Super Active is a potent medication containing sildenafil citrate, a phosphodiesterase type 5 inhibitor. It is used to treat erectile dysfunction by enhancing blood flow to the penile region.', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Impotence, which is also referred to as <a href=\"/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-super-active-24\"><strong>erectile dysfunction</strong></a> (ED), remains a leading problem that many male adults grapple with all over the world today. Failure to get or maintain an erection can lead men into a state of low self-esteem and unsatisfactory intimate relations with the opposite gender. Luckily, however, due to medical progress made recently in the area of treatments that are developed, one is under consideration:&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-super-active-24\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Sildigra Super Active</span></strong></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">What is <a href=\"/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-super-active-24\">Sildigra Super Active</a>?</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-super-active-24\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Sildigra Super Active</span></strong></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;is a medication used for men to overcome issues associated with male sensuality capacity, including <a href=\"/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-super-active-24\"><strong>erectile dysfunction</strong></a>. It represents a group of tabs termed phosphodiesterase type five (PDE5) inhibitors active constituent of&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-super-active-24\">Sildigra Super Active</a>&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">is&nbsp;</span><a href=\"/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-super-active-24\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Sildenafil Citrate 100mg</span></strong></a><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">, an effective and selective inhibitor for PDE5.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-botto