g></a>. Accordingly, you are recommended to seek the guidance of a healthcare professional prior to taking&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/blog/overcome-the-challenges-posed-by-ed-using-aurogra-100mg\"><strong>Aurogra 100</strong></a>&nbsp;course administration, as every individual requires its dosage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Precautions</strong></p><ol><li>Before taking&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rsmmultilinkllp.blogspot.com/2024/04/overcome-challenges-posed-by-ed-using.html\"><strong>Aurogra 100</strong></a>, a physician should be informed about all pre-existing medical conditions, with particular concerns raised regarding heart-related issues, high or low blood pressure, liver or kidney problems, bleeding disorders, and allergies.</li><li>In exceptional cases,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rsmmultilinkllp.blogspot.com/2024/04/overcome-challenges-posed-by-ed-using.html\"><strong>Aurogra 100</strong></a>&nbsp;could lead to a complex and prolonged erection longer than 4 hours (priapism), could be very painful and needs urgent medical attention to avoid permanent damage to the genital area.</li><li>Some individuals can notice mild transient effects on the sight, for example, blurred vision or increased sensitivity to light when taking&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rsmmultilinkllp.blogspot.com/2024/04/overcome-challenges-posed-by-ed-using.html\"><strong>Aurogra 100</strong></a>. If these symptoms happen while making use of this product, discontinue it and consult a physician.</li></ol>', 1727, 4, 1, 1, '2024-04-08 09:40:15', '2026-06-14 02:00:40', NULL),
