(538, 'Treat The Most Distressing Condition of ED with Silvitra 120mg', 'treat-the-most-distressing-condition-of-ed-with-silvitra-120mg', 'images/INKDnRf0AdVqnoyKmTsWOb8u3jvJW7bIw6Egr2xN.jpeg', 'Silvitra 120 tablet is a potent medication for the treatment of Erectile Dysfunction. It contains the dynamic fixing Sildenafil Citrate and Vardenafil, which both are known to be highly successful medicines for erectile dysfunction.', '<p>Impotence, also referred to as <a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-vardenafil-22\"><strong>erectile dysfunction</strong></a>, is the inability to achieve or sustain an erection that is sufficient for penile-vaginal sensual intercourse. However, if you are having occasional difficulty with getting an erection, this is normal, but when you start to have persistent challenges, this indicates an underlying health <a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-vardenafil-22\"><strong>problem. ED</strong></a> may be accounted for by several different factors, including physical factors like diabetes, cardiovascular disease, and hormonal imbalances, which are also accompanied by psychological factors like stress, anxiety, and depression. Thankfully, the modern medical research has not come out in vain. For one,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-vardenafil-22\"><strong>Silvitra 120</strong></a>&nbsp;is, beyond doubt, the most effective remedy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Introducing </strong><a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-vardenafil-22\"><strong>Silvitra 120</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-vardenafil-22\"><strong>Silvitra 120</strong></a>&nbsp;is a breakthrough medication that is intended to focus on various aspects of the ED complex. It combines two potent active ingredients:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-vardenafil-22\"><strong>Sildenafil Citrate 100mg</strong></a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-vardenafil-22\"><strong>Vardenafil 20mg</strong></a>. <a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-vardenafil-22\"><strong>Sildenafil Citrate</strong></a>, popularly known as the active ingredient in <a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-vardenafil-22\"><strong>Viagra</strong></a>, increases blood flow to the genital area when it is sensually aroused, which in turn gives him an erection. However,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/product/viewdetail/sildenafil-vardenafil-22\"><strong>Vardenafil</strong></a>, as a representative of pills from the class of phosphodiesterase type 5 (PDE5) inhibitors, which enhance blood flow to the genitalia, works similarly, only a bit differently.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Benefits of </strong><a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/blog/treat-the-most-distressing-condition-of-ed-with-silvitra-120mg\"><strong>Silvitra 120</strong></a></p><p><strong>• </strong><a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/blog/treat-the-most-distressing-condition-of-ed-with-silvitra-120mg\"><strong>Silvitra 120mg</strong></a>&nbsp;uses two formulations of the same active compound in a two-in-one approach that increases its effectiveness and makes it suitable for a broad range of patients.<br>•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/blog/treat-the-most-distressing-condition-of-ed-with-silvitra-120mg\"><strong>Sildenafil Citrate 100mg</strong></a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/blog/treat-the-most-distressing-condition-of-ed-with-silvitra-120mg\"><strong>Vardenafil 20mg</strong></a>&nbsp;in combination are responsible for a rapid onset of action, which enables males to get erections within a short period after the pill intake.<br>•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://rsmmultilink.com/blog/treat-the-most-distressing-condition-of-ed-with-silvitra-120mg\"><strong>Silvitra 120mg</strong></a>&nbsp;acts with a durat