(8, NULL, 'Double X Power (Sildenafil 100mg & Dapoxetine 60mg)', 'double-x-power', 'cFU3mu0fiztpCbeYnjKS4Ypq7hy7ePqHHVfdLCZB.jpeg', 'Double X Power (Sildenafil 100mg & Dapoxetine 60mg)', '<p><strong>Buy Double X Power</strong> is an oral tablet that helps in treating <strong>Erectile Dysfunction</strong> and Premature Ejaculation in men. It contains active substances, <strong>Sildenafil citrate</strong> <strong>100mg</strong> and <strong>Dapoxetine 60mg</strong>. They belong to a class of PDE5 inhibitor enzymes. The manufacturing for <strong>Buy Double X Power</strong> is done for <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></p><p><strong>Purchase Double X Power</strong> works in improving sensual activity by giving a firm erection in men. It also works on the vanished urge of getting aroused in men. It relaxes the blood vessels around the penis leading to an increased blood flow that gives a satisfying result when indulging in physical activity.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></p><p><strong>Double X Power</strong> inhibits the PDE5 enzymes, responsible for no blood flow around the penis. <strong>Buy Sildenafil Citrate</strong> and <strong>Dapoxetine</strong>, active components in Medicine, work on the ability to gain or sustain an erection required for sensual coupling. It works to provide a satisfactory erection and avoid premature ejaculation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Dosing Information</strong></p><p>Take one pill a day with a low-fat meal. Try not to overdose within 24-hours time. Consume <strong>Double X Power</strong> an hour before sensual activity. Do not combine with similar Medicine to prevent unwanted results. It starts working on the body in 15-25 mins post consumption of the Medicine.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Treatment</strong></p><p>Inform your doctor about your medical history before taking this Medicine. Keep a list of products you use, including previous prescriptions, herbal products, and share it with your doctor.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></p><p>Side effects of <strong>Double X Power</strong> are Headache, Dizziness, Facial Flushing, Nausea, Vomiting, and Insomnia.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Overdose</strong></p><p>Consult the doctor immediately in case of an overdose. It can have severe symptoms like difficulty in breathing, weakness, dizziness and fainting.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></p><p><strong>Double X Power</strong> may interact with other Medicines used in treating severe health problems. Some of the Medicines <strong>Double X Power</strong> reacts with are fingolimod, azole antifungals, and pills to treat Hepatitis.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Precautions</strong></p><ul><li>Do not take <strong>Double X Power</strong> if you are allergic to <strong>Buy Sildenafil</strong> Dosage and <strong>Buy Dapoxetine</strong>.</li><li>Avoid using Nitrates with this Medicine.</li><li>Abstain using this Medicine if you have blurry vision.</li><li>Medicine does not prevent STDs.</li><li>It is advisable to avoid heavy meals before taking the medication.</li></ul>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 00:27:56', '2024-09-30 15:31:43', NULL, 'Double X Power (Sildenafil 100mg & Dapoxetine 60mg)  - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Buy Double  X Power  Tablets,Sildenafil and Dapoxetine pills online,Cheap Double X Power  online', 'Buy Double X Power (Sildenafil 100mg & Dapoxetine 60mg) is an oral tablet that helps in treating ED and Premature Ejaculation in men. Visit online store of rsmmultilink.com for details!!', 0, 1, NULL, ''),
