-size: 14.0000pt;\">This Medicine can interact with Medicines like Nitrate Medicines like nitroglycerin, Prostate disorders Medicines like alfuzosin, Terazosin, Doxazosin, tamsulosin etc</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Precautions:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">This Medicine should only be taken if prescribed by a doctor.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">This Medicine is not preferable with Medicines containing nitrates.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">LIght meal is preferable while taking this Medicine for more effect.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 00:43:21', '2024-01-25 11:42:55', NULL, 'Buy Victor Oral Jelly (Vardenafil 20mg Oral Jelly) - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Buy vardenafil oral jelly online, vardenafil oral jelly 20 mg , victor oral jelly online , Vardenafil oral jelly in USA', 'RSM Multilink LLP i