(19, NULL, 'Sildigra Plus', 'sildigra-plus', 'sx872aU547LnHG6nLMYLCyoo7OYRu41NosHUAPFf.png', 'Sildigra Plus', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>RSM Enterprises</strong>&nbsp;have created a strong foothold in the business of manufacturing and supplying&nbsp;<strong>Sildigra Plus</strong>. We manufacture Sildenafil Tablets for smooth muscle relaxation allows increased blood flow into certain areas of the penis, which leads to an erection which is the most efficient and result-oriented treatment of male impotence. Do not take more than once daily. These Sildenafil Citrate Pills can be used orally and can be taken in various dosages, through the mouth, and can be utilized in treating the health issues, these are different for different problems and contain various formulations in varying degree to cure or prevent a disease.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Some Facts about Sildigra Plus</strong>&nbsp;:</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Sildigra Plus is used to treat male sexual function problems (impotence or erectile dysfunction) by blocking a certain enzyme (phosphoiesterase-PDES) in the body. It is Unique and Extra effective combination, which contains Sildenafil 100mg+Ginseng+L-arginine+Vitamin B2+Folic acid and VitaminB1. Ginseng&amp;L-arginine enhances the effect of Sildenafil, and vitamins reduce the side effects of sildenafil. Sildigra Plus is one of its kind and has its monopoly.</span></span></p>\r\n<p