dium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Cautions before taking Sildigra Plus</strong>&nbsp;:</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Sildigra Plus is a prescription medication, one needs share the medical history with a doctor to make sure it is an appropriate treatment. Do not take more than once daily and consult your doctor or pharmacist for more information.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Sildigra Plus tablet has no side effects because it is effective combination of Sildenafil 100mg+Ginseng+L-arginine+Vitamin B2+Folic acid and VitaminB1. Ginseng&amp;L-arginine enhances the effect of Sildenafil, and vitamins reduce the side effects of sildenafil. Enjoy Extra Pleasure without the fear of any after use Pain. Bring Light in your Life. Ignite your Desires with SILDIGRA PLUS</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.</span></span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2020-01-23 00:57:21', '2020-08-20 13:44:22', NULL, 'Buy Sildigra Plus | sildenaffil Side Effects |  The Blue Pill', 'Buy Sildigra Plus, sildenaffil Side Effects, Blue Pill', 'Buy Sildigra Plus i.e. Blue Pill from rsmenterprises.com to treat male sensual function complications (impotence or erectile dysfunction) by hindering a certain enzyme (phosphoiesterase-PDES) in the body.', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
