(34, NULL, 'Shilajeet- Asphaltum', 'shilajeet-asphaltum-203', '22OGf5OCgZQEgZiBOThrygmCvQVaOSoDxgo4wBmf.png', 'Shilajeet- Asphaltum', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shilajeet (Asphaltum punjabinum) known as \"destroyer of weakness\" is a substance that oozes out of rocks in the himalayas and is known as the \"drink of the gods\".&nbsp;Shilajeet is a drug used in Indian ayurveda for medical reasons. It contains about 85 minerals which are vital for the energy metabolisnm in our body.&nbsp;Shilajeet is a Sanskrit word and also has other names like Mineral pitch, Ozokerite and Black Asphaltum. Shilajeet is generally found in Himalaya regions in India, Nepal, Pakistan, China, Tibet and Central Asia. People closer to the Himalayas saw white monkeys move into the mountains in the summer months and would chew on this black sticky substance that oozed out of the rocks. They then tried mimicking the monkeys and found that it gave them energy and a feeling of total well being.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shilajeetare collected during summer and processed by many drug manufactures. They are available in capsule form for human consumption. Although the use of Shilajeet is long-lasting it is not that much used or popular outside South Asia.&nbsp;Shilajeet includes amla, bioperine, benzopyrones and fulvic acids. Shilajeet has high anti-inflammatory and antioxidant properties used in reducing joint pain and inflammation.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Indications:</strong>Rejuvenator, Boosts Immunity, Aphrodisiac, Antioxidant, Improves Blood Circulation.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>What are the benefits of using Shilajeet?</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shilajeethelps in developing the health of nervous system, memory and mental stress and concentration.</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">This drug is used to regain the lost strength for those weakened by disease.</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">It helps for proper functioning of liver that helps in secretion of all juices that are important for proper metabolism in body.</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shilajeetused to improve sexual performance.</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">This also helps in improving functioning of pancreas and reduces digestion problems. &nbsp;</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shilajeetacts as a blood purifier and improves the flow of blood circulation.</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Regular intake of Shilajeet helps in improving memory and sexual drive and male fertility.</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">This is used in treating kidneys, urinary, ulcers, cough and reproductive systems.</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shilajeethelps in healing and improves immune system in the body.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Charaka says that \"There is hardly any curable disease which cannot be controlled or cured with the aid of Shilajeet\"</strong><br /><br /><strong>Dosage: One capsule daily.</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shivalik is the herbal manufacturing unit of RSM group.</span></span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2020-01-23 01:31:02', '2024-11-19 16:20:17', NULL, 'Shilajeet- Asphaltum | Rsm Enterprises', 'Shilajit, Asphaltum, Aphrodisiac, Rejuvenation, Anti Oxidant, Blood Circulation, Sex Medicine, Ayurvedic Medicines', 'Shilajeet is a drug used in Indian Ayurveda for medical reasons. It contains about 85 minerals which are vital for the energy metabolism in our body.', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
