(40, NULL, 'Karela- Momordica charantia', 'karela-momordica-charantia-197', 'uzW6MHwnQqIB1tOXWE7TxJRG1txbw84jhfpB7Yuk.png', 'Karela- Momordica charantia', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Karela(Momordica charantia)also known as bitter melon regulates blood sugar levels. It is Anthelmintics &amp; diuretic. Karela excite pancreas, spleen and liver and helps in admirable absorption of food in the GI tract. It is extremely beneficial in treating Diabetes mellitus. It helps in maintaining good and clear skin. Karela treats worm infestations and also helps in evading parasitic attack. It is helpful as an emetic, purgative, as an anthelmentic, in piles, and jaundice</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Benefits of Karela</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; margin-left: 0.25in;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Central nervous system:</strong>It dissipates melancholia and gross humors.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; margin-left: 0.25in;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Liver and biliary system:&nbsp;</strong>It is useful in sub acute cases of liver and spleen.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; margin-left: 0.25in;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Blood and haemopoeitic tissue:</strong>It exhibits some remarkable anticancer effects, especially leukemia. It purifies the blood</span></span></p>\r\n<p style