(41, NULL, 'Gugglu- Commiphora mukul', 'gugglu-commiphora-mukul-196', 'X3kwRE1GIsyc1zvskvWLZdAr6F5cenfeSAzTdEVk.png', 'Gugglu- Commiphora mukul', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Gugglu (Commiphora mukul) helps increase white blood cell production, disinfects mucus, sweat, and urine and regulates menstruation. Gugglu is a very helpful herb for curing arthritis. It is most specific for cleaning and strengthening the bone tissue. It helps the body to normalized blood sugar levels naturally and safely. It rejuvenates and strengthens the skeletal and neuromuscular systems, supporting comfortable movements of joints and muscles. Its therapeutic use helps in reducing pain, swelling and tenderness of the inflamed joints. It is also alterative, antiseptic, carminative, expectorant and has fat-reducing properties.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Benefits of Gugglu</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Blood and haemopoeitic tissue:&nbsp;</strong>It is used to increase blood count in anemic patients.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Central nervous system:&nbsp;</strong>Used in hemiplegia, migraine, neurasthenia and other nervous disorders.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><sp