ysical and emotional stress, enhances memory, counteracts fatigue without caffeine, and improves stamina.</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;It stimulates the immune system by spuring the production of the body\'s own virus fighting chemicals, helps reduce cholesterol levels in the blood.</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">It is beneficial for reducing mental stress and anxiety &amp; it increases mental clarity and alertness.</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">It is used for treating diabetes</span></span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">It helps in preventing the growth of certain types of cancer cells</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Shivalik Ginseng contains pure and concentrated Ginseng<br />Dosage: One capsule twice a day.<br />Package 60 capsules of 500mg each</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Shivalik is the herbal manufacturing unit of RSM group.</span></span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2020-01-23 01:51:47', '2024-11-19 16:24:35', NULL, 'Korean Ginseng Ayurvedic Medicines | Erectile Dysfunction', 'Ginseng, Korean Ginseng, Immunity, Sex Medicine, Aphrodisiac, Stamina, Memory, Stress, Alertness, Fatigue, Ayurvedic Medicines', 'Ginseng(Panax Ginseng) strengthens the heart and nervous system. It is also helpful to the men experiencing erectile dysfunction problem. Buy Ayurvedic Sex Medicines online from RSM Enterprises', 0, 0, NULL, NULL)