(73, NULL, 'Fluconazole Tablets', 'fluconazole-tablets-158', 'YyKjo4UefXpSWSzBcNKNwZk2CrXC4xrPfCOOFtPU.jpeg', 'Fluconazole Tablets', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">RSM Healthcare ( A Division of RSM Enterprises)&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">are highly specialized in&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">Manufacturing,&nbsp; Exporting and Supplying of Antifungal Medication Pills</strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;under the name Blucon ( Fluconazole ) tablets.&nbsp; which is manufactured using quality raw material sourced from highly reliable sources. Antifungal Medicines are prescribed for treating fungal infections like yeast infections of the throat, OESOPHAGUS, vagina, mouth, abdomen, lungs, blood, and other organs. Clients can avail these Antifungal Tablets in premium quality packaging material at market-leading prices.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">Wide range of Antifungal Medication Pills offered by us includes Fluconazole 50mg, Fluconazole 100mg, Fluconazole 150mg, Fluconazole 200mg etc.</strong></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2020-01-23 04:45:10', '2020-08-01 10:47:49', NULL, 'Buy cheap Fluconazole tablets in UK -rsmenterprises.in', 'Buy cheap fluconazole uk, fluconazole tablets , fluconazole 100mg', 'We are the reliable exporters of fluconazole tablets with cheap price.', 1, 0, NULL, NULL),
(74, '--', 'Generic Xenical 120mg', 'generic-xenical-120mg-146', 'Sfo4KeWWEj0ovW6oDJLUPxmBV9iOD1p1frskj70K.jpeg', 'Generic Xenical 120mg', '<p>Leveraging on our widely spread shipment network,&nbsp;<strong>RSM Enterprises</strong>&nbsp;are placed amidst ourselves as a leading Generic Zoloft 120mg Exporters from India. These Generic Zoloft 120mg Tablets are highly effective for the persons suffering from depression. It has also been used to treat a severe form of premenstrual syndrome (premenstrual dysphoric disorder- PMDD) and a sexual function (premature ejaculation) problem in men. But this Generic Zoloft 120mg cannot be consumed directly without any prior consultation of your physician. Our range of Generic Zoloft 120mg Tablets is in compliance with the international quality standards and offered at competitive prices.</p><p><strong>How to use Generic Xenical 120mg ?</strong><br><br>Generic Xenical 120mg comes as a capsule and a nonprescription capsule to take by mouth. It is usually taken three times a day with each main meal that contains fat. Take Generic Xenical 120mg during a meal or up to 1 hour after a meal. If a meal is missed or does not have fat, you may skip your dose. Follow the directions on your prescription label or the package label carefully, and ask your doctor or pharmacist to explain any part you do not understand. Take Generic Xenical 120mg exactly as directed. Do not take more or less of it or take it more often than prescribed by your doctor or stated on the package.<br><br><strong>Generic Xenical 120mg Side Effects :</strong><br><br>Generic Xenical 120mg comes with a patient information booklet that should be read carefully. The most common side effect of Generic Xenical 120mg is changes in bowel movement (BM) habits. This generally occurs during the first weeks of treatment; however, it may continue throughout your use of Generic Xenical 120mg. Some of the rare side effects are oily spotting on underwear or on clothing, gas with oily spotting, urgent need to have a bowel movement, loose stools, oily or fatty stools, increased number of bowel movements, difficulty controlling bowel movements, pain or discomfort in the rectum (bottom), stomach pain, irregular menstrual periods, headache, anxiety etc. Call your doctor, if you have any unusual problems while taking Generic Xenical 120mg.<br><br><strong>Generic Xenical 120mg Precautions :</strong><br><br>Before taking Generic Xenical 120mg, tell your doctor or pharmacist if you have any allergies, digestive disorders (malabsorption or cholestasis), low thyroid function (hypothyroidism), other metabolism problems (e.g., oxalate kidney stones, hyperoxaluria). This product may contain inactive ingredients, which can cause allergic reactions or other problems. This Generic Xenical 120mg should not be used if you have anorexia nervosa or bulimia-type eating disorders. Tell your doctor if you are pregnant before using this medication. The manufacturer does not recommend the use of this drug during pregnancy</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 04:48:45', '2024-12-13 17:40:10', NULL, 'Buy Online  Generic Xenical 120mg, Orlitac 120 mg with Dosage,Uses', 'Online  Generic Xenical 120mg,  Generic Xenical 120mg uses, Generic Xenical 120mg dosage, Orlitac 120 mg', 'Buy Online Generic Xenical 120mg that is the medication at present approved to help you lose weight from rsmmultilink.com. This medication stops your body from engrossing the fat from the food you eat.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(75, '--', 'Generic Xenical 60mg (Orlistat )', 'generic-xenical-60mg-145', 'hVYMG9iIH56cFDfM56jsJmqBzCLx6cy0lK879cnq.png', 'Generic Xenical 60mg (Orlistat )', '<p>At <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>, we take pride in being one of the most trusted suppliers and exporters of Generic Zoloft 50mg. This medication, classified as a selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor (SSRI), is widely prescribed to manage conditions such as depression, panic disorder, obsessive-compulsive disorder (OCD), post-traumatic stress disorder (PTSD), and severe premenstrual dysphoric disorder (PMDD).</p><p>Our <strong>Generic Zoloft 50mg </strong>tablets are meticulously processed under hygienic conditions to ensure premium quality. Known for their precise composition, purity, and effectiveness, these anti-depression medications are manufactured to meet bulk requirements within stipulated timelines. To uphold quality, every batch undergoes rigorous testing on well-defined parameters in our advanced laboratories, ensuring reliable and effective results.</p><p><strong>How to Use Generic Xenical 60mg?</strong></p><p><strong>Generic Xenical 60mg</strong> is an oral medication available as capsules. It is normally taken three times per day, with each large meal including fat. You can take the capsule during the meal or up to one hour after eating. If your meal is fat-free or skipped, you may skip the dose.</p><p>Follow the instructions on the prescription label or container carefully. If you have any questions, seek clarification from your doctor or pharmacist. Always take Generic Xenical 60mg as directed and avoid exceeding the prescribed dosage.</p><p><strong>Side Effects of Generic Xenical 60mg:</strong></p><p>This medication comes with a patient information leaflet that should be read thoroughly. The most common side effect involves changes in bowel movements, particularly during the first few weeks of treatment. These changes may persist throughout the course of use.</p><p><strong>Other possible side effects include:</strong></p><ul><li>Oily spotting on clothing or underwear</li><li>Gas with oily discharge</li><li>Difficulty controlling bowel movements</li><li>Stomach discomfort or pain</li><li>Irregular menstrual periods</li><li>Headache</li><li>Anxiety</li></ul><p>If you detect any unusual or severe side effects, call your doctor immediately.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Generic Xenical 60mg:</strong></p><p>Before using Generic Xenical 60mg, inform your doctor if you have:</p><ul><li>Allergies</li><li>Digestive disorders such as malabsorption or cholestasis</li><li>Low thyroid function (hypothyroidism)</li><li>Other metabolic issues like oxalate kidney stones or hyperoxaluria</li></ul><p>If you suffer from anorexia nervosa or bulimia, you should avoid taking this medication. Furthermore, this medication is not suggested during pregnancy. Consult your doctor if you are pregnant or want to become pregnant while taking this medicine.By adhering to these guidelines, you can safely and effectively use <strong>Generic Xenical 60mg</strong> to achieve the desired health outcomes.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 04:52:09', '2024-12-13 17:41:08', NULL, 'Buy Generic Xenical 60mg, Orlitac 60 mg  with Uses,Dosage', 'Buy Generic Xenical 60mg, Generic Xenical 60mg , Orlitac 60 mg', 'Buy Generic Xenical 60mg reduces the quantity of fat that is engrossed. This medication is clinically recognized to help you lose up to 50% more weight than by means of dieting alone from rsmmultilink.com.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(76, '--', 'Generic Proscar 5mg', 'generic-proscar-5mg-144', '3nDjkHBpbi52ptOoXMsF1QUm5wEDwHR18vSrtK59.png', 'Generic Proscar 5mg', '<p><strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong> is a renowned manufacturer, supplier, and exporter of <strong>Generic Proscar 5mg</strong>, an effective treatment for male pattern baldness. This medication is designed to treat mild to moderate hair loss in men, particularly targeting hair thinning on the top of the head and the front of the mid-scalp area. Generic Proscar 5mg tablets work by increasing hair growth, stimulating re-growth, and slowing further hair loss. It specifically targets scalp hair and does not impact hair growth in other body areas.</p><p>It is important to note that the benefits of this hair loss treatment will diminish if the medication is discontinued. <strong>Generic Proscar 5mg</strong> is not intended for use in women or children, making it a specialized solution for men dealing with hair loss. As a leading manufacturer and supplier of Generic Proscar 5mg pills in India, we ensure top-quality products that meet your needs.</p><p><strong>How Does Generic Propecia 5mg Work?</strong></p><p>Before starting treatment with Generic Propecia 5mg, it’s essential to read the patient information leaflet provided by your pharmacist. The tablets should be taken orally once daily, with or without food, as prescribed by your doctor. It is recommended to take the medication at the same time each day to help establish a routine and improve compliance. Always follow your doctor’s instructions and do not adjust your dosage without consulting them.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Using Generic Propecia 5mg:</strong></p><p>Before taking Generic Propecia 5mg, inform your doctor or pharmacist about any known allergies, including allergies to the active ingredients or any other substances. Inactive components in the medication can cause allergic reactions or other difficulties. Additionally, disclose any relevant medical history, particularly liver disease, prostate cancer, urinary problems, or infections.</p><p>This medication is not recommended for use in women or children, so ensure you follow your doctor’s guidance strictly.</p><p><strong>Side Effects of Generic Propecia 5mg:</strong></p><p>In clinical studies, the occurrence of side effects was rare, and most men did not experience any significant adverse reactions. The most common side effect was a decreased libido, which affected fewer than 2% of men using the medication. Importantly, this issue resolved quickly in all cases after discontinuing the medication.</p><p>For more information about side effects or concerns, consult with your healthcare provider to ensure <strong>Generic Propecia 5mg</strong> is the right treatment for your needs.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 04:54:34', '2024-12-13 17:41:58', NULL, 'Generic Proscar 5mg, Fenered 5 mg  Tablet with Uses,Dosage', 'Buy Generic Proscar 5mg, Generic Proscar 5mg uses, Generic Proscar 5mg Dosage, Fenered 5 mg', 'Generic Proscar 5mg i.e. Fenered 5 mg  Tablet with Uses has been clinically proved to show amend hair growth and treat baldness from rsmmultilink.com.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(77, '--', 'Generic Proscar 1mg (Fenered)', 'generic-proscar-1mg-143', 'uKq4da71PcH7bEKotIwVbiJL8pcWAIBY7gm538eT.jpeg', 'Generic Proscar 1mg (Fenered)', '<h2><strong>Description</strong></h2><p>Fenered 1 is an efficient Medicine, helps in treating prostate enlargement in men. The active ingredient of this Medicine is Finasteride. This Medicine is manufactured for RSM Enterprises.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></h2><p>Fenered 1 is used to treat male baldness at the crown and in the middle of the scalp. It is used to increase hair growth as well as re-growth on the scalp of the head.</p><h2><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></h2><p>Fenered 1 works by reducing the amount of a natural body hormone (DHT). A decrease in DHT increases the hair growth on the scalp. It is an effective hair-loss treatment for men with the best outcome.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Dosing Information</strong></h2><p>Consume a single dose of Fenered 1 in 24-hours duration with or without food. Avoid skipping the second dosage as it might cause an unfavourable effect. If you see any improvements, continue the Medicine at the same time as the regular dose.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Treatment</strong></h2><p>Consume Fenered 1 as prescribed by your doctor. Consult the doctor if you have liver or kidney disorders.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></h2><p>The side effects of Fenered 1 is decrease in libido. Some of the serious reactions are rashes, itching/swelling, dizziness, and trouble breathing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Overdose</strong></h2><p>Call your doctor immediately in case of an overdose, as it can have unfavourable effects on the body.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></h2><p>Inform your doctor about previous illness (if any) and medications or herbal products you consume currently.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Precautions</strong></h2><p>●&nbsp;Do not consume if you are sensitive to Finasteride or any elements from this Medicine.</p><p>●&nbsp;Keep it out of sight from children.</p><p>●&nbsp;This Medicine is for use for hair growth on the scalp only.</p><p>●&nbsp;Do not take this Medicine if you have liver or kidney issues.&nbsp;</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 04:58:34', '2024-12-13 17:42:49', NULL, 'Generic Proscar 1mg, Fenered 1mg', 'Generic Proscar 1mg  uses, Generic Proscar 1mg  dosage, Buy Generic Proscar 1mg, Fenered 1mg', 'Generic Proscar 1mg i.e. Fenered 1mg daily tablets to handle male pattern baldness. Accessible to buy online from rsmmultilink.com', 0, 0, NULL, '');
