(78, '--', 'Generic Nexium 40mg', 'generic-nexium-40mg-138', 'dCyvd47bKfT1zvGAbKE6hRyPqpVnKgmrUKftHFaq.jpeg', 'Generic Nexium 40mg', '<p><strong>Generic Nexium 40mg tablets</strong> are a powerful proton pump inhibitor used primarily for treating ulcers and related conditions. Stomach acid is naturally produced during digestion, and Generic Nexium 40mg pills work by reducing the amount of acid in the stomach, helping to heal ulcers and reduce acid reflux. This medication is commonly used to treat reflux esophagitis, where the acid flows back into the esophagus, causing irritation and damage. By stopping this acid reflux, it helps the lining of the food pipe heal.</p><p>As a leading Generic Nexium 40mg tablets manufacturer, exporter, and supplier from India, we are committed to providing high-quality products that meet your needs and expectations.</p><p><strong>How Does Generic Nexium 40mg Work?</strong></p><p>Before using Generic Nexium 40mg, it’s important to follow your doctor\'s advice. This oral tablet should be taken with a glass of water, which helps it dissolve easily. Follow the directions on the prescription label closely. The medication is most effective when taken on an empty stomach, at least one hour before meals. It\'s essential to maintain regular dosing intervals and avoid taking more than the prescribed amount.</p><p><strong>Side Effects of Generic Nexium 40mg:</strong></p><p>While Generic Nexium 40mg is generally well-tolerated, some individuals may experience side effects. These can include nausea, headache, diarrhea, dry mouth, drowsiness, dizziness, and upset stomach. More serious adverse effects, however rare, may include:</p><ul><li>Loss of appetite</li><li>Unexplained weight loss</li><li>Severe mental or mood changes</li><li>Increased sweating or flushing</li><li>Unusual fatigue</li><li>Tremors or uncontrolled movements</li></ul><p>If you see any of these significant side effects, contact your doctor right away. Always consult your healthcare provider if you notice any unusual symptoms while taking Generic Nexium 40mg.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Using Generic Nexium 40mg:</strong></p><p>If you are allergic to Generic Nexium 40mg or any of its contents, tell your doctor or pharmacist before taking it. It is also important to discuss all the medications, vitamins, herbal products, and supplements you are currently taking or plan to take. Never take higher doses than prescribed by your doctor, and seek medical attention if you experience any allergic reactions or other concerns.</p><p>By following these guidelines, you can use <strong>Generic Nexium 40mg</strong> safely and effectively to treat ulcers and related conditions.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 05:02:11', '2024-12-13 17:44:05', NULL, 'Buy Generic Nexium 40mg, Esomeprazole 40 mg', 'Generic Nexium 40mg, Generic Nexium 40mg pill, Generic Nexium 40mg  tablet, Esomeprazole 40 mg', 'Buy Generic Nexium 40mg, Esomeprazole 40 mg from rsmmultilink.com that is utilized to treat definite stomach and esophagus complications (such as acid reflux, ulcers).', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(79, '--', 'Generic Nexium 20mg', 'generic-nexium-20mg-137', 'S5z9flOBPcW29gwjcl8rFAsME5NT47NuofipBcmA.png', 'Generic Nexium 20mg', '<p>Generic <strong>Nexium Tablets 20mg</strong> are a trusted proton pump inhibitor (PPI) designed to treat ulcers and manage acid reflux conditions like reflux esophagitis. These tablets work by reducing stomach acid production, a crucial step in preventing acid from flowing back into the esophagus. This process helps the esophageal lining heal, providing relief from symptoms and improving digestive health.</p><p>Recognized for their effectiveness, Generic <strong>Nexium 20mg Pills</strong> are an excellent choice for managing acid indigestion and promoting the healing of stomach ulcers. As a leading Generic Nexium Tablets 20mg manufacturer, exporter, and supplier from India, we are committed to delivering top-quality solutions to meet your healthcare needs.</p><p><strong>How Does Generic Nexium 20mg Work?</strong></p><p>Generic <strong>Nexium 20mg</strong> inhibits proton pumps in the stomach lining, effectively decreasing acid production. This allows the stomach and esophagus to heal naturally, providing relief from discomfort caused by acid-related conditions.</p><p><strong>Usage Instructions</strong>: Always consult your doctor before using Generic Nexium 20mg. Take the oral tablet with a glass of water for optimal absorption.</p><p><strong>Dosage Timing</strong>: For best results, take the medication on an empty stomach at least one hour before meals. Avoid overdosing and adhere to your prescribed schedule.</p><p><strong>Side Effects of Generic Nexium 20mg:</strong></p><p>While Generic Nexium 20mg Tablets are generally safe, some individuals may experience mild side effects, including:</p><ul><li>Nausea</li><li>Headache</li><li>Diarrhea</li><li>Drowsiness or dizziness</li><li>Dry mouth</li><li>Upset stomach</li></ul><p><strong>Serious Side Effects (rare):</strong></p><ul><li>Loss of appetite</li><li>Unusual weight loss</li><li>Mood changes or increased sweating</li><li>Tremors</li></ul><p>If you experience severe or unusual symptoms, seek medical attention promptly. Always read the patient information booklet provided with the medication.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Generic Nexium 20mg:</strong></p><p>Allergy Notification: Inform your doctor if you are allergic to any of the ingredients in <strong>Generic Nexium 20mg.</strong></p><p>Medication Interactions: Share a complete list of any prescription and non-prescription drugs, vitamins, or herbal supplements you are using to avoid potential interactions.</p><p>Dosage Guidelines: Stick to the prescribed dose to avoid complications. Discontinue use if allergic reactions occur and consult your doctor immediately.</p><p><strong>Trusted Relief with Generic Nexium Tablets 20mg:</strong></p><p><strong>Generic Nexium Tablets 20mg</strong> offer a reliable and effective solution for managing acid-related digestive issues, ensuring healing and long-term relief. With our commitment to quality, we remain a preferred supplier for clients seeking trusted healthcare solutions worldwide.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 05:05:46', '2024-12-13 17:45:16', NULL, 'Online Generic Nexium 20mg, Esomeprazole 20 mg', 'Generic Nexium 20mg,Generic Nexium 20mg pill, Generic Nexium 20mg Uses, Esomeprazole 20 mg', 'Online Generic Nexium 20mg i.e.  Esomeprazole 20 mg from rsmmultilink.com relieves a number of stomach-related complaints by hindering a proton pump and dipping the manufacture of acid in the stomach.', 0, 0, 'Nexium Tablets 20mg', ''),
(80, NULL, 'Sertraline 100mg', 'sertraline-100mg-136', 'jErYSizHYvB58Ok1yE0NOTd45borpPSoWgCi8RL5.jpeg', 'Sertraline 100mg', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">Leveraging on our widely spread shipment network,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">RSM Enterprises</strong><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">are placed amidst ourselves as a leading&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">Generic Zoloft 100mg Exporters from India.</strong><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;These Generic Zoloft 100mg Tablets are highly effective for the persons suffering from depression. It has also been used to treat a severe form of premenstrual syndrome (premenstrual dysphoric disorder- PMDD) and a sexual function (premature ejaculation) problem in men. But this Generic Zoloft 100mg cannot be consumed directly without any prior consultation of your physician. Our range of Generic Zoloft 100mg Tablets is in compliance with the international quality standards and offered at competitive prices.</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 05:08:19', '2020-08-29 07:30:43', '2020-08-29 07:30:43', 'Buy Generic Zoloft 100mg , Sartine 100 mg Pill', 'Generic Zoloft 100mg pill, Generic Zoloft 100mg tablet, Generic Zoloft 100mg uses, Sartine 100 mg Pill', 'Buy Generic Zoloft 100mg i.e. Sartine 100 mg Pill from rsmenterprises.com that decreases fear, anxiety, unwanted thoughts, and the number of panic attacks.', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(81, NULL, 'Sertraline 50', 'sertraline-50-135', 'q8pCdWhKiPK9g0kp1oLmF7lQUWHyp9tMeINPqrls.jpeg', 'Sertraline 50', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">As we are the most prominent&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">Suppliers and Exporters</strong><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">RSM Enterprises</strong><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;offers widely used Generic Zoloft 50mg. Generic Zoloft 50mg is a selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor (ssri) used to treat depression, panic disorder, obsessive - compulsive disorders (ocd), post-traumatic stress disorder (ptsd, and a severe form of premenstrual syndrome (pmdd). These Anti Depression Generic Zoloft 50mg are hygienically processed and meet the bulk of requirements in a stipulated time. Also, these Generic Zoloft 50mg Medication is known for their precise composition, purity and efficacy. Prioritizing the final delivery, these Generic Zoloft 50mg are rigorously tested on various well defined parameters in our laboratories.</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 05:11:06', '2020-08-29 07:30:59', '2020-08-29 07:30:59', 'Buy Generic Zoloft 50mg, Sartine 50 mg Pill', 'Generic Zoloft 50mg, Generic Zoloft 50mg tablet, Generic Zoloft 50mg Pill, Sartine 50 mg', 'Buy Generic Zoloft 50mg, Sartine 50 mg Pill from rsmenterprises.com to cure depression, panic attacks, obsessive compulsive disorder, post-traumatic stress disorder, social anxiety disorder.', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(82, NULL, 'Generic Nolvadex 20mg', 'generic-nolvadex-20mg-134', 'mehue2snTGQSX3EBClWvnBngQSJmz61KyKq2PuVo.jpeg', 'Generic Nolvadex 20mg', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">The Generic Nolvadex 20mg offered by&nbsp;<strong>RSM Enterprises</strong>&nbsp;is a non-steroidal medication, used for the treatment of metastatic breast cancer. Generic Nolvadex 20mg Tablet is an anti-estrogen that is beneficial for treating both the early and advanced breast cancer. It may keep the cancer from spreading to other parts of the body. Generic Nolvadex 20mg Pills reduce the chance of getting a new breast cancer. It may also be prescribed to treat various other kinds of cancer, as determined by your doctor. With our vast experience in this field we have become one of the eminent&nbsp;<strong>Generic Nolvadex 20mg Medicines Manufacturers, Suppliers and Exporters from India.</strong><br /><br /><strong>How to use Generic Nolvadex 20mg ?</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Generic Nolvadex 20mg, an anticancer drug, is given to treat breast cancer in women and men. Swallow the Generic Nolvadex 20mg Tablet, with water or any nonalcoholic liquid. You can take Generic Nolvadex 20mg Pills with or without food. It should be used only when your doctor prescribes it for you. Never take it without prescription.<br /><br /><strong>Precautions to use Generic Nolvadex 20mg&nbsp; :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Tell your doctor about all prescription, over-the-counter and herbal medications you are taking before beginning treatment with Generic Nolvadex 20mg. Also, talk to your doctor about your complete medical history. Do not take Generic Nolvadex 20mg Tablet, if you are allergic to it or any of its components. Do not breastfeed if you are using Generic Nolvadex 20mg Pills.<br /><br /><strong>Side Effects of Generic Nolvadex 20mg :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">The most common side effects people have experienced include pain in the bones and muscles, constipation, a dry cough that is persistent, nausea and vomiting, fatigue, and weight loss. Many women experience excessive vaginal discharge. Only your doctor can determine, if it is safe for you to continue taking this Generic Nolvadex 20mg.</span></span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 05:14:34', '2020-08-29 07:34:45', '2020-08-29 07:34:45', 'Buy Generic Nolvadex 20mg , Tamoxifen 20 mg', 'Generic Nolvadex 20mg,Generic Nolvadex 20mg uses, Buy Generic Nolvadex 20mg , Tamoxifen 20 mg', 'Buy Generic Nolvadex 20mg i.e. Tamoxifen 20 mg Tablet from rsmenterprises.com that slows down the growth and reproduction of breast cancer cells.', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(83, '--', 'Tamilong 20 (Tamoxifen Citrate)', 'tamilong-20mg-133', 'A8pCNyS0Dq3f2fE9VCBFnG6W5F63ljDZ8zzhCjvZ.jpeg', 'Tamilong 20 (Tamoxifen Citrate)', '<p><strong>Trusted Source to Buy Tamoxifen Citrate 20mg Online</strong></p><p>Generic<strong> Nolvadex 10mg</strong>, offered by <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>, is a trusted non-steroidal medication widely used for treating metastatic breast cancer. This anti-estrogen drug, also available as Tamilong 20mg Tablets, effectively manages both early and advanced breast cancer stages, helping prevent the cancer from spreading to other parts of the body. Additionally, Tamilong 20mg Pills reduce the risk of developing new breast cancer, making it an essential choice for comprehensive cancer care.</p><p>With its proven efficacy, Tamilong 20mg may also be prescribed for treating various other cancers based on your doctor’s recommendation. Backed by extensive expertise, RSM Multilink LLP has positioned itself as a leading supplier and exporter of Tamilong 20mg Medicines from India.</p><p><strong>How to Use Generic Tamilong 20mg?</strong></p><p>Generic Tamilong 20mg is an anticancer medication prescribed for breast cancer treatment in both men and women.</p><p><strong>Administration:</strong> Swallow the Tamilong 20mg Tablet with water or a non-alcoholic liquid.</p><p><strong>With or Without Food:</strong> This medication can be taken regardless of meals.</p><p><strong>Doctor’s Prescription</strong>: Only use Tamilong 20mg when prescribed by a healthcare professional. Avoid self-medication.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Tamilong 20mg:</strong></p><p>To ensure safe and effective use of Generic Tamilong 20mg, consider the following precautions:</p><p><strong>Medical History</strong>: Inform your doctor about your complete medical history, including all prescription, over-the-counter, and herbal medications you are using.</p><p><strong>Allergies</strong>: Do not take Tamilong 20mg Tablets if you are allergic to any of its components.</p><p>Breastfeeding: Avoid breastfeeding while on Tamilong 20mg treatment to prevent potential risks to the infant.</p><p><strong>Side Effects of Tamilong 20mg:</strong></p><p>While Tamilong 20mg is effective, some individuals may experience side effects. Common side effects include:</p><ul><li>Bone and muscle pain</li><li>Constipation</li><li>Persistent dry cough</li><li>Nausea and vomiting</li><li>Fatigue and weight loss</li></ul><p>If you experience any side effects or unusual symptoms, consult your doctor immediately. Only your healthcare provider can determine if it is safe for you to continue with Tamilong 20mg.</p><p><strong>Why Choose Generic Tamilong 20mg?</strong></p><p>With its ability to prevent cancer progression and reduce the risk of recurrence, Generic Nolvadex 10mg and Tamilong 20mg Pills are reliable options for breast cancer management. Backed by the trusted expertise of <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>, these medications offer quality and assurance, making them a preferred choice globally.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 05:17:47', '2024-12-11 14:51:15', NULL, 'Buy Online Tamilong 20 (Tamoxifen Citrate) Tablet', 'Buy Tamilong 20 tablat, Tamoxifen Citrate tablet,Tamilong 20 mg', 'To Treat metastatic breast cancer, buy Tamoxifen 10mg tablet a non-steroidal medication. The medicine helps in reducing the chances of getting new cancer and works for both men and women.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(84, '--', 'Generic Accutane 20mg', 'generic-accutane-20mg-132', 'P6IyzVgx8J3i9OGzbUP2toPqnRJoLyfoztRXaYkR.jpeg', 'Generic Accutane 20mg', '<p><strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>, driven by expertise and a commitment to quality, has established itself as a leading manufacturer and supplier of Generic Accutane 20mg Tablets. Belonging to the retinoid class of chemical compounds, <strong>Generic Accutane 20mg Capsules </strong>are widely recognized for their efficacy in treating severe acne and improving skin conditions. These tablets help cleanse the skin, reduce acne, smooth wrinkles, and lighten pigment spots. Offered in diverse packaging and adhering to stringent quality standards, this medication is available at an affordable price, ensuring value for users worldwide.</p><p><strong>How to Use Generic Accutane 20mg?</strong></p><p>Generic Accutane 20mg is specifically designed to treat severe acne that does not respond to conventional treatments like antibiotics, creams, or drying agents.</p><p><strong>Administration</strong>: Take Generic Accutane 20mg Capsules orally as directed by your doctor.</p><p><strong>Dosage</strong>: Typically, it is recommended to take the medication twice daily.</p><p><strong>Instructions</strong>: Follow your doctor’s guidelines and the prescription label closely. Avoid altering the dosage or frequency without professional advice.</p><p><strong>Side Effects of Generic Accutane 20mg:</strong></p><p>While Generic Accutane 20mg Tablets are effective, they may cause side effects in some individuals. Common and rare side effects include:</p><ul><li>Common Side Effects:</li><li>Dry skin, lips, eyes, mouth, or nose</li><li>Nosebleeds, peeling skin, and changes in nail texture</li><li>Red, cracked, and sore lips</li><li>Hair loss or unwanted hair growth</li></ul><p><strong>Severe Side Effects:</strong></p><ul><li>Blurred vision, dizziness, or seizures</li><li>Stomach pain, chest pain, or difficulty swallowing</li><li>Yellowing of the skin or eyes</li><li>Joint, muscle, or bone pain</li><li>Unusual tiredness, nausea, or vomiting</li></ul><p>If any of these symptoms worsen or if new symptoms appear, consult your doctor immediately.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Using Generic Accutane 20mg:</strong></p><p>To ensure safety and efficacy, consider the following precautions when using Generic Accutane 20mg:</p><p><strong>Allergies</strong>: Inform your doctor about any allergies to this medication or its ingredients.</p><p><strong>Medication Interactions</strong>: Disclose all prescription and non-prescription drugs, vitamins, and supplements you are taking.</p><p><strong>Pregnancy Warning</strong>: Avoid using this medication if you are pregnant or planning to conceive. Discontinue use 2–3 months before attempting pregnancy to prevent potential risks.</p><p><strong>Dosage Limits</strong>: Do not exceed the prescribed dosage to avoid adverse effects.</p><p><strong>Why Choose Generic Accutane 20mg?</strong></p><p><strong>Generic Accutane 20mg Pills</strong> are a trusted choice for individuals struggling with severe acne. With its proven ability to improve skin health, smooth out imperfections, and lighten pigment spots, this medication offers a comprehensive skincare solution. Backed by the expertise of<strong> RSM Multilink LLP,</strong> these capsules are a reliable and affordable option for achieving healthier, clearer skin.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 05:21:37', '2024-12-13 17:46:50', NULL, 'Generic Accutane 20mg, Irotin 20 Tablet', 'Irotin 20, Generic Accutane 20mg, Irotin 20 Tablet', 'Generic Accutane 20mg i.e. Irotin 20 Tablet from rsmmultilink.com to handle a stark form of acne called recalcitrant nodular or cystic acne.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(85, NULL, 'Generic Accutane 10mg', 'generic-accutane-10mg-131', 'TDVVbIVsQ6bMDnzW0Ws2vAKruoXUGctZx9leuGBQ.jpeg', 'Generic Accutane 10mg', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\"><strong>RSM Enterprises</strong>&nbsp;urge to reach on top and deep industry knowledge assisted us in attaining a high reputation as an apparent&nbsp;<strong>Manufacturer and Supplier of the Generic Accutane 10mg.</strong>&nbsp;This drug belongs to a class of chemical compounds known as retinoids. Generic Accutane 10mg Capsules are mainly used as a remedy for the improvement of the skin condition and it copes with it very well. Generic Accutane 10mg Tablets are able to clean the skin from acne and also for a short period of time and also smooth out wrinkles, and remove pigment spots. These are provided in various packing&rsquo;s with quality measures and are accessed at reasonable price.<br /><br /><strong>How to take Generic Accutane 10mg ?</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Generic Accutane 10mg is used to cure severe acne that has not been treated well by more conservative treatment options like creams, antibiotics and drying agents. Generic Accutane 10mg Tablet comes as capsules to take by mouth. It is usually taken twice a day. Follow the instructions given by your doctor and on your prescription label carefully. Take Generic Accutane 10mg Pills exactly as directed. Do not take more or less of it or take it more often than prescribed by your doctor.<br /><br /><strong>Side Effects of Generic Accutane 10mg :</strong></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Generic Accutane 10mg come with a patient information booklet that should be read car