(91, NULL, 'Snovitra Super Power (Dapoxetine  +  Vardenafil)', 'dapoxetine-vardenafil-125', 'Js6HbeH5P2WLHp18abPBDXBofO049999cOb0HJZc.png', 'Snovitra Super Power (Dapoxetine  +  Vardenafil)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">Men who have erection problems can use Dapoxetine and Vardenafil that enable them to get and maintain erection during sensual activity. We fabricate Dapoxetine and Vardenafil Tablets which is a combination of active ingredient Vardenafil 20mg and Dapoxetine 60mg. These Dapoxetine + Vardenafil are effective for men with ED (erectile dysfunction) and helps to increase the blood flow to the male organ. Our range is clinically shown to improve the erectile function even in men who had other health disorders like diabetes or prostate surgery. We provide these Dapoxetine and Vardenafil at cheapest prices.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><strong>About Dapoxetine and Vardenafil Tablets:</strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">The Dapoxetine and Vardenafil Tablet is the highly recommended distinctive solution to get over the problem of premature ejaculation. The main objective of the drug is to delay the process of ejaculation resulting in enhanced sensual pleasures to a man suffering from the problem of pre-ejaculation. But this drug cannot be consumed directly without any prior consultation of your physician. Take doctors advised first if you are beginner Dapoxetine and Vardenafil consumer and do not try to change dose strength on your own decision.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><strong>How to take Dapoxetine and vardenafil Tablets:</strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">The Doctor&rsquo;s suggestion is always advisable before starting to consume this pill. Dapoxetine and vardenafi is an oral tablet should be consumed with a glass of water for dissolving easily. Overdoses are always restricted and do not need to take this pill on a daily basis. It should be taken once in a day (in an interval of 24 hours). Take this pill one hour prior to love making session. Because it takes time to show effects against sensual dysfunction &amp; premature ejaculation.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Dapoxetine and Vardenafil Precautions:</strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">These are the precautions to be remembered while taking Dapoxetine and Vardenafil and should be used only when your doctor prescribes it for you. Never take it without prescription. It is advisable to take this pill when you don&rsquo;t have any allergic problem from Sildenafil citrate and Dapoxetine. Try to avoid heavy meal before and after taking this pill otherwise it will lose the power to get harder and longer erection. Nitrates and Dapoxetine and Vardenafil are a very bad match and causes severe health hazards. Only men are liable for using Dapoxetine and Vardenafil.</div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Dapoxetine and Vardenafil Side Effects:</strong></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">Some of the rare side effects of Dapoxetine and Vardenafil are headache, diarrhea, nausea and dizziness. Only few users suffer from these side effects. These side effects are common in those people who consume even other drugs with Dapoxetine and Vardenafil. Increasing the dosage randomly without consulting a physician also may be a cause of the side effects.</div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2020-01-23 06:18:05', '2020-07