stuffiness, diarrhea and dizziness might occur.</div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2020-01-23 06:26:09', '2020-08-01 09:47:34', NULL, 'Buy Online Zewitra (vardenafil Oral Jelly) – rsmenterprises', 'Zewitra (vardenafil Oral Jelly),vardenafil Oral Jelly', 'Buy Online Zewitra (vardenafil Oral Jelly) from rsmenterprises.in that comprises a salt named vardenafil to cure erectile dysfunction or impotence at the earliest and to get rid of the symptoms of this disease.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(95, NULL, 'Snovitra Professional (Vardenafil )', 'vardenafil-professional-120', 'vswB7g37dC3PljAGddvQtzoOKYiCAAdnBZoQSK99.png', 'Snovitra Professional (Vardenafil )', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Vardenafil Professional is an FDA-approved oral prescription medication for the treatment of erectile dysfunction (ED) in men and can help you get and keep a quality erection. Vardenafil Professional Tablet block the enzyme called phosphodiesterase-5 or PDE5, through which the muscles in the penis can relax, allowing more blood flow and the proper sensual stimulation that leads to an erection. These Vardenafil Professional tablet are effective in improving erectile function in men who suffer from other health disorders and prostate surgery. It can be used only under the guidance of a doctor. At the same time, we are a prominent Manufacturers, Suppliers and Exporters of Vardenafil Professional from India.</span></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Things to Know about Vardenafil Professional:</strong></span></span></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Vardenafil Professional is useful for treatment of ED (erectile dysfunction) in men. Keeping male organ erection for a longer time, these tablets help in attaining utmost pleasure during sensual activity. These tablets are safe to use and effectively cure impotence and diseases associated with PDE5 inhibitors. This medicine is not intended for use by women or children. It will not protect against sensually transmitted diseases including HIV infection.</span></span></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Tips to use Vardenafil Professional:&nbsp;</strong></span></span></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Vardenafil Professional are taken orally 25 - 60 minutes before sensual activity or as directed by your doctor and comes with a patient information booklet that should be read carefully. It works along with sensual stimulation to help achieve an erection. Contact your doctor or pharmacist for more information. This medicine may be taken on an empty stomach or with food. However, taking this medicine with a high-fat meal may reduce the amount of medicine that your body absorbs</span></span></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Vardenafil Professional Precautions:&nbsp;</strong></span></span></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Vardenafil Professional is a prescription medication, one need to share the medical history with a doctor to make sure it is an appropriate treatment. Keep in mind, it is not for people who have allergies or taking any form of nitroglycerin or those who have had a heart attack, stroke, severe high or low blood pressure or life threatening heart irregularities. Do not take this medicine more often than once daily and consult your doctor or pharmacist for more information.</span></span></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong>Side effects of Vardenafil Professional:&nbsp;</strong></span></span></div>\r\n<div id=\"cke_pastebin\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">These are primarily used to treat erectile dysfunction in men, but yet there some rare side effects have been recognized which are Headache, flushing, stomach upset, nasal stuffiness, diarrhea and dizziness might occur. If these effects persist or worsen, notify your doctor promptly. For person with cardiac problems, the side effects can be severe. Before purchasing any impotence tablets at all, it is highly advisable to consult a doctor and let him or her decide, if synthetic drugs are the best treatment for you.</span></span></div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2020-01-23 06:28:10', '2023-05-19 11:20:43', NULL, 'Buy Vardenafil Professional ,  Snovitra Professional Tablet', 'Buy : Vardenafil Professional Tablet, Vardenafil Professional pill, Snovitra Professional', 'Buy Vardenafil Professional, i.e. Snovitra Professional Tablet from rsmenterprises.in that is a proficient tablet curing erectile dysfunction malfunction in men sooner.', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(96, '--', 'Vardenafil & Dapoxetine', 'vardenafil-dapoxetine-119', '6XmtTwC8x3y6pdvSTcl9vpb0LWZEFvOJYDk9tGj9.png', 'vaVardenafil & Dapoxetine', '<p><strong>Vardenafil &amp; Dapoxetine Tablets: A Trusted Solution for Erectile Dysfunction and Premature Ejaculation</strong></p><p>At RSM Multilink LLP, we offer a comprehensive range of Vardenafil &amp; Dapoxetine tablets, developed with the help of our skilled professionals. These tablets combine Vardenafil 20mg and Dapoxetine 80mg, working together to enhance blood flow to the male genital area. This powerful combination is designed to support men dealing with erectile dysfunction (ED) and helps improve erectile function, even for those with other health conditions such as diabetes or prostate surgery. As trusted manufacturers, exporters, and suppliers of Vardenafil &amp; Dapoxetine tablets, we provide high-quality products at competitive prices.</p><p><strong>Key Information about Vardenafil &amp; Dapoxetine Tablets:</strong></p><p>Vardenafil &amp; Dapoxetine tablets are an effective treatment for ED in men, helping maintain an erection for an extended period. These tablets also enhance pleasure during intimacy. Safe to use, they effectively address impotence and conditions related to PDE5 inhibitors. Please note that these tablets are intended only for men and are not suitable for women or children. Additionally, they do not offer protection against sensually transmitted diseases, including HIV.</p><p><strong>How to Use Vardenafil &amp; Dapoxetine Tablets?</strong></p><p>To achieve optimal results, take Vardenafil &amp; Dapoxetine tablets orally 25-60 minutes before engaging in sensual activity, or as directed by your healthcare provider. Always follow the instructions provided in the patient information booklet. These tablets work in conjunction with sensual stimulation to support the achievement of an erection. Vardenafil &amp; Dapoxetine tablets can be taken either on an empty stomach or with food. However, consuming them with high-fat meals may reduce the medication\'s absorption rate.</p><p><strong>Precautions and Safety Guidelines:</strong></p><p>Before using Vardenafil &amp; Dapoxetine tablets, it is important to consult with a healthcare professional, especially if you have pre-existing conditions like heart problems, stroke, or high or low blood pressure. Inform your doctor of your complete medical history to ensure the medication is suitable for you. This prescription medication should not be taken more than once per day. If you have any doubts or concerns, consult your doctor or pharmacist.</p><p><strong>Possible Side Effects of Vardenafil &amp; Dapoxetine</strong></p><p>While Vardenafil &amp; Dapoxetine tablets are generally safe and effective, some users may experience mild side effects such as headaches, flushing, nasal congestion, upset stomach, dizziness, or diarrhea. These symptoms are typically temporary and may subside on their own. However, if these effects persist or worsen, contact your doctor immediately. Individuals with cardiac issues may experience more severe side effects. Always consult your doctor before taking any medication for erectile dysfunction to ensure it is the right treatment for you.</p><p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p><p>Vardenafil &amp; Dapoxetine tablets provide an effective solution for men dealing with erectile dysfunction and premature ejaculation. With proper use and medical supervision, this medication can help improve sensual performance and overall quality of life. As a trusted supplier, RSM Multilink LLP ensures you receive only the highest-quality Vardenafil &amp; Dapoxetine tablets at competitive prices.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 06:30:08', '2024-12-13 17:50:00', NULL, 'Buy Vardenafil & Dapoxetine , Snovitra Super Power pill', 'Vardenafil & Dapoxetine tablet, Vardenafil & Dapoxetine pill,Snovitra super power', 'Buy Snovitra Super Power pill i.e. buy Vardenafil & Dapoxetine from rsmmultilink.com to cure the extensively spread conditions erectile dysfunction and premature ejaculation at low-rates.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(97, '--', 'Vardenafil 60mg', 'vardenafil-60mg-118', 'eNrCJueNyrwVavSE6Dd02ClKFPUTeyhJVvEJD2mx.png', 'Vardenafil 60mg', '<p><strong>Vardenafil 60mg</strong>&nbsp;is an FDA-approved oral prescription medication for the treatment of erectile dysfunction (ED) in men and can help you get and keep a quality erection. Generic Levitra 60mg Tablet block the enzyme called phosphodiesterase-5 or PDE5, through which the muscles in the penis can relax, allowing more blood flow and the proper sexual stimulation that leads to an erection. These Generic Levitra 60mg Pills are effective in improving erectile function in men who suffer from other health disorders and prostate surgery. It can be used only under the guidance of sexologist or a doctor. At the same time, we are a prominent&nbsp;<strong>Manufacturers, Suppliers and Exporters of Generic Levitra 60mg from India.</strong><br><br><strong>Things to Know about&nbsp;Vardenafil 60mg:</strong></p><p>Generic Levitra 60mg is useful for treatment of ED (erectile dysfunction) in men. Keeping penis erection for a longer time, these tablets help in attaining utmost pleasure during sexual activity. These generic tablets are safe to use and effectively cure impotence and diseases associated with PDE5 inhibitors. This medicine is not intended for use by women or children. It will not protect against sexually transmitted diseases including HIV infection.<br><br><strong>Tips to use&nbsp;Vardenafil 60mg&nbsp;:</strong></p><p>Generic Levitra 60mg are taken orally 25 - 60 minutes before sexual activity or as directed by your doctor. Generic Levitra 60mg come with a patient information booklet that should be read carefully. It works along with sexual stimulation to help achieve an erection. Contact your doctor or pharmacist for more information. This medicine may be taken on an empty stomach or with food. However, taking this medicine with a high-fat meal may reduce the amount of medicine that your body absorbs<br><br><strong>Vardenafil 60mg&nbsp;Precautions :</strong></p><p>Generic Levitra 60mg is a prescription medication, one need to share the medical history with a doctor to make sure it is an appropriate treatment. Keep in mind, it is not for people who have allergies or taking any form of nitroglycerin or those who have had a heart attack, stroke, severe high or low blood pressure or life threatening heart irregularities. Do not take this medicine more often than once daily and consult your doctor or pharmacist for more information.<br><br><strong>Side effects of&nbsp;Vardenafil 60mg:</strong><br><br>These are primarily used to treat erectile dysfunction in men, but yet there some rare side effects have been recognized which are Headache, flushing, stomach upset, nasal stuffiness, diarrhea and dizziness might occur. If these effects persist or worsen, notify your doctor promptly. For person with cardiac problems, the side effects can be severe. Before purchasing any impotence pills at all, it is highly advisable to consult a doctor and let him or her decide, if synthetic drugs are the best treatment for you.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 06:31:58', '2024-12-13 17:50:56', NULL, 'Vardenafil 60mg pill, Snovitra XL Dosage with uses', 'Vardenafil 60mg pill online,Vardenafil 60mg tablet online, Snovitra XL', 'Snovitra XL Dosage with uses i.e. Vardenafil 60mg pill is an effective medication from rsmmultilink.com for erectile dysfunction ailment that requests to be in use with water.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(98, '--', 'Vardenafil 40mg', 'vardenafil-40mg-117', 'okhxsuJZk96FTjqPINu4NsF5u1PQytr9XHcgV9pu.png', 'Vardenafil 40mg', '<p><strong>Vardenafil 40mg: An Effective Solution for Erectile Dysfunction</strong></p><p>Vardenafil 40mg is an FDA-approved oral medication used to treat erectile dysfunction (ED) in men, offering a reliable way to achieve and maintain a strong erection. This generic Levitra 40mg tablet works by inhibiting the enzyme phosphodiesterase-5 (PDE5), allowing the muscles in the genital region to relax and increasing blood flow. This mechanism ensures proper sensual stimulation, leading to an erection. Vardenafil 40mg has proven beneficial for men with ED, including those with health conditions like diabetes or who have undergone prostate surgery. However, it should only be used under the guidance of a healthcare provider.</p><p><strong>Key Information About Vardenafil 40mg:</strong></p><ul><li>Purpose: Primarily used to treat erectile dysfunction (ED), Generic Levitra 40mg helps maintain an erection during sensual activity. It is effective in providing longer-lasting erections and enhancing sensual pleasure.</li><li>Safety: These tablets are safe for most men and can address impotence and related conditions caused by PDE5 inhibitors. However, it is important to note that this medication is not suitable for women or children and does not provide protection against sensually transmitted diseases, including HIV.</li></ul><p><strong>How to Use Vardenafil 40mg?</strong></p><ul><li>Dosage: Take Generic Levitra 40mg orally 25-60 minutes before engaging in sensual activity, or as directed by your doctor.</li><li>Instructions: The medication works best with sensual stimulation. Be sure to read the patient information booklet carefully before use. It can be taken on an empty stomach or with food, but avoid high-fat meals, as they may reduce absorption.</li><li>Consultation: Always check with your healthcare provider for personalized instructions and more details.</li></ul><p><strong>Precautions When Using Vardenafil 40mg:</strong></p><ul><li>Consultation Required: As a prescription medication, you should inform your doctor about your medical history to ensure Vardenafil 40mg is suitable for you.</li><li>Avoid if: It should not be taken by individuals who have allergies to the ingredients, are on nitroglycerin medications, or have had a heart attack, stroke, severe blood pressure issues, or life-threatening heart conditions.</li><li>Dosage Limit: Do not exceed the recommended dose of one tablet per day.</li></ul><p><strong>Possible Side Effects of Vardenafil 40mg</strong></p><p><strong>While Generic Levitra 40mg is generally safe, some users may experience side effects, such as:</strong></p><ul><li>Headache</li><li>Flushing</li><li>Stomach upset</li><li>Nasal congestion</li><li>Diarrhea</li><li>Dizziness</li></ul><p>If any of these symptoms persist or worsen, consult your doctor immediately. For those with cardiac issues, side effects may be more severe. Always seek medical advice before using any erectile dysfunction medication to determine if it is the best treatment for you.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 06:33:52', '2024-12-13 17:51:44', NULL, 'Buy Vardenafil 40mg , Snovitra Strong Tablet with Uses', 'Vardenafil 40mg uses, Vardenafil 40mg tablet,Vardenafil 40mg pill, Snovitra Strong', 'Buy Vardenafil 40mg i.e. Snovitra Strong Tablet with Uses from rsmmultilink.com which is extra concentrated form of Vardenafil that guarantees men treatment from erectile dysfunction.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(99, '--', 'Vardenafil 20mg', 'vardenafil-20mg-116', '9O3bCSiiPytSwCKuV61NUeraTXakbYiFZKjQF0ik.png', 'Vardenafil 20mg', '<p><strong>Vardenafil 20mg: A Trusted Solution for Erectile Dysfunction (ED)</strong></p><p><strong>Vardenafil 20mg</strong> is an FDA-approved oral prescription medication designed to effectively treat erectile dysfunction (ED) in men. This medication helps men achieve and maintain a quality erection by blocking the enzyme phosphodiesterase-5 (PDE5). By inhibiting PDE5, Vardenafil enables the muscles in the genital region to relax, allowing increased blood flow, which is essential for a firm and lasting erection. It is particularly beneficial for men with ED due to underlying health conditions or following prostate surgery. It is critical to take this medication under the supervision of a healthcare expert. As leading manufacturers, suppliers, and exporters of Snovitra 20mg from India, we ensure top-quality products for our clients.</p><p><strong>Key Information About Vardenafil 20mg:</strong></p><p><strong>Snovitra 20mg</strong> is primarily used for the treatment of erectile dysfunction in men, helping them maintain an erection during sensual activity. This medication provides enhanced pleasure and satisfaction during intimacy by ensuring a longer-lasting erection. Vardenafil is a safe and effective solution for treating impotence and conditions related to PDE5 inhibitors. It is not suitable for women or children and does not protect against sensually transmitted diseases (including HIV).</p><p><strong>How to Use Vardenafil 20mg Effectively?</strong></p><p><strong>Vardenafil 20mg</strong> should be taken orally between 25-60 minutes before engaging in sensual activity, or as prescribed by your doctor. The medication works alongside sensual stimulation to help achieve an erection. Vardenafil can be taken with or without food; however, consuming it with a high-fat meal may reduce the absorption rate. Always refer to the patient information booklet provided with the medication and consult your healthcare provider for specific instructions.</p><p><strong>Precautions and Safety Guidelines:</strong></p><p>As a prescription medication, it is essential to consult with a healthcare professional before using Vardenafil 20mg. Share your complete medical history, especially if you have conditions such as heart problems, stroke, high or low blood pressure, or other severe health issues. Vardenafil is not recommended for individuals who are allergic to its ingredients or who are taking nitroglycerin. Do not take more than one dose per day, and follow your doctor\'s instructions closely to avoid potential risks.</p><p><strong>Possible Side Effects of Vardenafil 20mg:</strong></p><p><strong>While Vardenafil 20mg </strong>is generally well-tolerated, some users may experience mild side effects such as headaches, flushing, upset stomach, nasal congestion, diarrhea, or dizziness. These effects are typically temporary and subside on their own. However, if these symptoms persist or worsen, contact your doctor immediately. For individuals with pre-existing heart conditions, side effects may be more severe. It is crucial to consult with a healthcare provider to determine if Vardenafil 20mg is the right treatment for you.</p><p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p><p><strong>Vardenafil 20mg</strong> offers a safe and effective solution for men suffering from erectile dysfunction. By improving blood flow and ensuring a lasting erection, it helps restore confidence and enhance sensual satisfaction. Always consult with a healthcare professional before starting treatment to ensure it is suitable for your individual needs.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 06:35:36', '2024-12-13 17:52:40', NULL, 'Vardenafil 20mg Tablet, Snovitra 20 mg  pill -rsmmultilink.com', 'Vardenafil 20mg, Vardenafil 20mg pill,Vardenafil 20mg online, Snovitra 20 mg', 'Buy Snovitra 20 mg pill i.e. Vardenafil 20mg Tablet from rsmmultilink.com at lowest price which is the Best Erectile Dysfunction Medicine at the present time that upsurges blood content in the penile area.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
