(106, '--', 'Tadalafil 40mg', 'tadalafil-40mg-109', '8OCvsMYNBbejnGoZUik9pOFxYmHyvvDN8B7WZvwJ.png', 'Tadalafil 40mg', '<p><strong>RSM Enterprises</strong>take privilege in introducing itself as one of the chief Tadalafil 40mg Manufacturers, Exporters and Suppliers based in India. It is an oral drug used to treat male impotence. These Tadalafil 40mg Tablets are helpful to keep an erection during sexual excitement with erectile dysfunction. Tadalafil 40mg Pills act as a potent and a selective phosphodiesterase inhibitor which increases blood flow to the penis. Due to its salient features such as accurate composition, purity, effectiveness and longer shelf life, our offered Tadalafil 40mg Tablet has gained huge demand among clients. Hence, we are a famed&nbsp;<strong>Manufacturer and Suppliers of the Tadalafil 40mg from India.</strong><br><br><strong>What is Tadalafil 40mg ?</strong></p><p>Tadalafil 40mg are used to treat the physical problems of erectile dysfunction in men. These tablets are safe to use and effectively cure impotence and diseases associated with PDE5 inhibitors. These oral drugs are effectively used in the treatment for ED disorders in men assuring erection for longer duration of time.<br><br><strong>Guidance to take Tadalafil 40mg :</strong></p><p>Tadalafil 40mg medication should be consumed only with the help of water, this medication should be used at least 30-45 minutes before lovemaking and the effects of this medicine can be experienced for a long period of time that is for almost 36 hours. Tadalafil 40mg works along with sexual stimulation to help achieve an erection. It is usually recommended to start with a dosage of 40mg (half a pill). We strongly recommend you to consult with your health provider to know which dose is suitable for you before taking Tadalafil 40mg. To get the fastest result, take Tadalafil 40mg after eating a low-fat meal as it slow downs the effectiveness of Tadalafil 40mg.<br><br><strong>Who should not take Tadalafil 40mg ?</strong></p><p>Do not take Tadalafil 40mg, if either anyone has allergies or taking any form of nitroglycerin or those who have had a heart attack, stroke, severe high or low blood pressure or life threatening heart irregularities. This drug does not protect against sexually transmitted diseases (such as HIV, hepatitis B, gonorrhea, syphilis). Keep in mind, it is not for persons with conditions such as sickle cell anemia, multiple myeloma or leukemia. Seek medical advice with genital deformities such as Peyronie’s disease; also if you have a bleeding disorder, peptic ulcer, or retinitis pigmentosa.<br><br><strong>Cautions before taking Tadalafil 40mg :</strong></p><p>Tadalafil 40mg is a prescription medication, one needs share the medical history with a doctor to make sure it is an appropriate treatment. Do not take more than once daily and consult your doctor or pharmacist for more information.<br><br><strong>Some side effects of Tadalafil 40mg :</strong></p><p>These are primarily used to treat erectile dysfunction in men, but yet there some rare side effects have been recognized which are Headache, flushing, stomach upset, nasal stuffiness, diarrhea and dizziness might occur. If these effects persist or worsen, notify your doctor promptly. For person with cardiac problems, the side effects can be severe. Before purchasing any impotence pills at all, it is highly advisable to consult a doctor and let him or her decide, if synthetic drugs are the best treatment for you.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 06:50:00', '2024-12-13 17:53:25', NULL, 'Buy Tadalafil 40 mg,Tadagra soft 40 mg  Pill online', 'Tadalafil 40mg online, Buy Tadalafil 40mg online, Tadagra soft 40 mg', 'Buy Tadalafil 40 mg i.e. Tadagra soft 40 mg  Pill online from rsmmultilink.com at reasonable rates that is a selective inhibitor of cyclic guanosine monophosphate (cGMP)-specific phosphodiesterase type 5 (PDE5).', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(107, '--', 'Tadalafil 20mg', 'tadalafil-20mg-108', 'jTwvZYMbXWggNV7RGgS6Fr3gONuuQzNObjoC4DZY.png', 'Tadalafil 20mg', '<p><strong>Leading Tadalafil 20mg Manufacturer, Exporter, and Supplier - RSM Multilink</strong></p><p><strong>RSM Multilink</strong> proudly introduces itself as a trusted manufacturer, exporter, and supplier of <strong>Tadagra 20mg </strong>in India. This effective oral medication addresses male impotence by enhancing erectile function. Tadalafil 20mg tablets work as selective phosphodiesterase inhibitors, boosting blood flow to the genital area, and ensuring sustained erections during sensual activity for men with erectile dysfunction (ED). Renowned for its accurate composition, purity, effectiveness, and long shelf life, our Tadalafil 20mg tablets are in high demand, solidifying our reputation as a reliable pharmaceutical provider globally.</p><p><strong>What is Tadalafil 20mg?</strong></p><p>Tadalafil 20mg is an effective solution for treating erectile dysfunction in men. These safe and reliable oral tablets combat impotence and associated PDE5 inhibitor-related conditions. Designed to ensure a longer-lasting erection, Tadalafil 20mg is a proven choice for managing ED disorders.</p><p><strong>How to Take Tadalafil 20mg?</strong></p><ul><li>Consume Tadalafil 20mg tablets with water 30–45 minutes before sexual activity.</li><li>The effects can last up to 36 hours, providing ample flexibility.</li><li>The recommended starting dosage is 20mg (half a tablet).</li><li>For optimal results, avoid high-fat meals before use, as this may reduce the medication\'s efficacy.</li><li>Always consult your healthcare provider to determine the appropriate dosage and usage instructions.</li></ul><p><strong>Who Should Not Take Tadalafil 20mg?</strong></p><p><strong>Avoid using Tadalafil 20mg if:</strong></p><ul><li>You are allergic to its ingredients or currently using nitrate-based medications.</li><li>You have a history of severe heart conditions, including heart attack, stroke, or abnormal blood pressure.</li><li>This medication does not protect against sensually transmitted diseases like HIV, gonorrhea, syphilis, or hepatitis B.</li></ul><p><strong>Precautions When Using Tadalafil 20mg:</strong></p><p>Tadalafil 20mg is a prescription drug—share your medical history with a qualified doctor to ensure its safety and suitability.</p><ul><li>Do not exceed one dose per day.</li><li>Consult your doctor or pharmacist for additional guidance before use.</li></ul><p><strong>Potential Side Effects of Tadalafil 20mg</strong></p><p>Tadalafil 20mg is well-tolerated by most individuals, but some may experience minor side effects such as:</p><ul><li>Headache</li><li>Flushing</li><li>Nasal congestion</li><li>Stomach upset</li><li>Dizziness</li><li>Diarrhea</li></ul><p>In rare cases, users with pre-existing cardiac conditions may face severe reactions. Seek medical advice promptly if side effects persist or worsen.</p><p><strong>Why Choose RSM Multilink LLP for Tadalafil 20mg?</strong></p><p>RSM Multilink LLP is dedicated to providing premium-quality pharmaceutical products that meet global standards. Our Tadalafil 20mg tablets deliver reliable and safe results, making us the go-to choice for ED treatments. Connect with us today to explore our range of trusted pharmaceutical solutions!</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 06:52:26', '2024-12-13 17:54:33', NULL, 'Buy Tadalafil 20mg, Tadagra 20mg  Pill online', 'Tadalafil 20mg pill online, Tadalafil 20mg tablet online, Tadagra 20mg', 'Buy Tadalafil 20mg i.e. Tadagra 20mg  Pill online from rsmmultilink.com that is an oral treatment that is utilized for treating impotence (the inability to attain or maintain a penile erection) and benign prostatic hyperplasia (BPH).', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(108, '--', 'Tadalafil 10mg', 'tadalafil-10mg-107', 'FI9Jx0KUWZdIGGY368GVzyob6S177F7JkUXSZGKO.png', 'Tadalafil 10mg', '<p><strong>Discover Premium Tadalafil 10mg Solutions with RSM Multilink LLP:</strong></p><p><strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong> proudly stands as a leading manufacturer, exporter, and supplier of <strong>Tadalafil 10mg.</strong> This oral medication is designed to treat male impotence by improving erectile function.<strong> Tadaga 10mg</strong> tablets enhance blood flow to the genital region, aiding men with erectile dysfunction (ED) in achieving and maintaining an erection during sensual stimulation. Known for its precise composition, purity, effectiveness, and extended shelf life, our Tadalafil 10mg tablets have earned the trust of clients globally, making us a renowned name in the pharmaceutical industry.</p><p><strong>What is Tadaga 10mg?</strong></p><p><strong>Tadalafil 10mg </strong>is a trusted treatment for erectile dysfunction in men. These tablets work effectively to resolve impotence and address issues related to PDE5 inhibitors. By ensuring long-lasting erections, Tadalafil 10mg is a reliable choice for men seeking effective solutions for ED.</p><p><strong>How to Take Tadalafil 10mg?</strong></p><ul><li>Take Tadalafil 10mg with water approximately 30–45 minutes before sensual activity.</li><li>The effects of this medication last up to 36 hours, providing ample time for natural stimulation to take effect.</li><li>It is commonly advised to start with a 10mg dose (half a pill).</li><li>For the best results, avoid high-fat meals before consumption, as they may delay the medication\'s effectiveness.</li><li>Always visit a healthcare provider to establish the best dosage for you.</li></ul><p><strong>Who Should Avoid Tadalafil 10mg?</strong></p><ul><li>Individuals allergic to Tadalafil or its ingredients.</li><li>Those using medications containing nitroglycerin.</li><li>Men with a history of severe cardiovascular conditions such as heart attack, stroke, or life-threatening arrhythmias.</li><li>Tadalafil 10mg does not protect against sensually transmitted infections (e.g., HIV, gonorrhea, syphilis).</li></ul><p><strong>Precautions When Using Tadalafil 10mg:</strong></p><ul><li>This is a prescription medication; ensure you share your medical history with a doctor to determine suitability.</li><li>Avoid taking the medication more than once daily.</li><li>Discuss any existing medications or health conditions with your healthcare provider to prevent complications.</li></ul><p><strong>Possible Side Effects of Tadalafil 10mg</strong></p><p>While Tadaga 10mg is generally well-tolerated, some users may experience mild side effects, including:</p><ul><li>Headache</li><li>Flushing</li><li>Nasal congestion</li><li>Stomach upset</li><li>Dizziness</li><li>Diarrhea</li></ul><p>In rare cases, individuals with pre-existing cardiac conditions may face severe reactions. Always visit a healthcare expert to determine whether Tadalafil 10mg is the best option for you.</p><p><strong>Why Choose RSM Multilink for Tadalafil 10mg?</strong></p><p><strong>RSM Multilink</strong> is committed to delivering high-quality, effective, and safe ED treatments. With stringent quality standards, our <strong>Tadalafil 10mg</strong> tablets are a trusted solution for men seeking reliable results. Connect with us today to explore superior pharmaceutical solutions crafted for your needs.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 06:53:56', '2024-12-13 17:55:14', NULL, 'Tadalafil 10 mg ,Tadaga 10 mg | Erectile Dysfunction Pills', NULL, 'Tadalafil 10mg (Tadaga 10mg) are the Erectile Dysfunction Pills helps a majority of men to keep an erection when they become sensually excited available at rsmmultilink.com.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(109, '--', 'Tadalafil 5mg', 'tadalafil-5mg-106', 'bbcc3Ot8CzKXUmCRg4J0Ch00k5x7ZzbqPGCW0fgm.png', 'Tadalafil 5mg', '<p><strong>RSM Multilink LLP </strong>is proud to be a leading Tadalafil 5mg manufacturer, exporter, and supplier based in India. Tadalafil 5mg tablets are an effective oral medication for treating male impotence. These <strong>Tadalafil 5mg pills</strong> help men maintain an erection during sensual stimulation by acting as a potent phosphodiesterase inhibitor, increasing blood flow to the genital region. Known for their precise composition, high purity, effectiveness, and long shelf life, our Tadalafil 5mg tablets have gained significant demand among customers. As trusted Tadalafil 5mg suppliers, we are committed to providing top-quality solutions for erectile dysfunction.</p><p><strong>Tadalafil 5mg</strong> is designed to address erectile dysfunction (ED) in men, offering a safe and effective treatment. The <strong>Tadalafil 5mg</strong> tablets work by increasing blood circulation to the genital area, helping men achieve and maintain an erection for an extended period. These oral medications are a reliable treatment for ED, ensuring longer-lasting results.</p><p><strong>How to Take Tadalafil 5mg:</strong></p><p>Before taking <strong>Tadalafil 5mg</strong>, ensure you are not allergic to any of its ingredients, and avoid it if you are using nitrates or have had a heart attack, stroke, or severe blood pressure issues. This medication does not protect against sensually transmitted diseases such as HIV, gonorrhea, or syphilis. It is also unsuitable for individuals with conditions like sickle cell anemia, leukemia, multiple myeloma, or Peyronie’s disease. For those with bleeding disorders, peptic ulcers, or retinitis pigmentosa, seek medical advice before use.</p><p><strong>Precautions Before Taking Tadalafil 5mg:</strong></p><p>While <strong>Tadalafil 5mg </strong>is commonly used to treat erectile dysfunction, some rare side effects such as headaches