(112, NULL, 'Sildigra Prof  (Sildenafil Citrate Professional)', 'sildenafil-citrate-professional-103', 'bH7znySR55SklNCJVJwTosPzpRQ0lQT7FyRcd9z3.png', 'Sildigra Prof  (Sildenafil Citrate Professional)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">With the talent of our competent team,&nbsp;<strong>RSM Enterprises</strong>&nbsp;are engaged in&nbsp;<strong>Manufacturing, Exporting and Supplying of Sildenafil Professional (Sildigra Professional).</strong>&nbsp;It acts by inhibiting CGMP specific phosphodiesterase type 5, an enzyme that regulates blood flow in the penis resulting in strong &amp; hard erection. The primary indication of Sildenafil Professional Tablets is treatment of erectile dysfunction (inability to sustain a satisfactory erection to complete intercourse). The offered Sildenafil Professional comply with International Quality Standards and are offered at competitive market prices.<br /><br /><strong>Some Facts about Sildenafil Professional (Sildigra Professional)</strong><br />Sildenafil Professional is used to treat male sexual function problems (impotence or erectile dysfunction) by blocking a certain enzyme (phosphoiesterase-PDES) in the body. In combination with sexual stimulation, Sildenafil Citrate works by helping the blood flow into the penis to achieve and maintain an erection.<br /><br /><strong>How to take Sildenafil Professional (Sildigra Professional) :</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">TDo not take Sildenafil Professional, if either anyone has allergies or taking any form of nitroglycerin or those who have had a heart attack, stroke, severe high or low blood pressure or life threatening heart irregularities. This drug does not protect against sexually transmitted diseases (such as HIV, hepatitis B, gonorrhea, syphilis). Keep in mind, it is not for persons with conditions such as sickle cell anemia, multiple myeloma or leukemia. Seek medical advice with genital deformities such as Peyronie&rsquo;s disease; also if you have a bleeding disorder, peptic ulcer, or retinitis pigmentosa.<br /><br /><strong>Cautions before taking Sildenafil Professional :</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">Sildenafil Professional is highly effective pills to treat erectile dysfunction in men, but yet there some rare side effects have been recognized are headaches, stomach upset, diarrhea, flu-like symptoms and nausea, when the pills are overdosed. Before purchasing any impotence pills at all, it is highly advisable to consult a doctor and let him or her decide, if synthetic drugs are the best treatment for you.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2020-01-23 07:32:15', '2020-07-30 12:29:28', NULL, 'Sildenafil Citrate Professional, Sildigra Prof', 'Buy Sildenafil Citrate  pill, Sildenafil Citrate Uses, Sildigra Prof', 'Buy Sildenafil Citrate Professional from rsmenterprises.in preserving poorest cases of erectile dysfunction in men by growing blood drift in man’s penile.', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
