(121, '--', 'Sildenafil citrate 120mg', 'sildenafil-citrate-120mg-94', 'Gxbd166rdg9Gd41mPh5VgzQy6av6QmgcdhZwEZtR.png', 'Sildenafil citrate 120mg', '<p><strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong> is a leading supplier and exporter of <strong>Sildenafil Citrate 120mg,</strong> a widely used oral suspension medication for treating erectile dysfunction (ED) and pulmonary arterial hypertension (PAH). Sildenafil Citrate 120mg Tablets work by enhancing blood flow to the genital region, helping men achieve and sustain an erection. Due to its soft formulation, the active ingredient is quickly absorbed into the bloodstream. These Sildenafil Citrate 120mg Pills are available as white, film-coated tablets for oral consumption and are also marketed as Sildenafil Citrate 120mg. Primarily used for male erectile dysfunction, these tablets are offered in various fruit flavors for a more pleasant experience. You can buy Sildenafil Citrate 120mg online from RSM Multilink at competitive prices.</p><p><strong>Key Facts About Sildenafil Citrate 120mg:</strong></p><p><strong>Sildenafil Citrate 120mg </strong>is an effective treatment for erectile dysfunction by inhibiting the enzyme phosphodiesterase type 5 (PDE5). When combined with sensual arousal, Sildenafil Citrate enhances blood flow to the Genital area, enabling men to achieve and maintain an erection.</p><p><strong>How to Take Sildenafil Citrate 120mg?</strong></p><p>For optimal results, take <strong>Sildenafil Citrate 120mg</strong> at least 30 minutes before sensual activity, but not more than 4 hours prior (1 hour before is most effective). Avoid high-fat meals because they may diminish the medication\'s efficacy.</p><p><strong>Who Should Not Take Sildenafil Citrate 120mg?</strong></p><p>Do not use Sildenafil Citrate 120mg if you are allergic to it, or if you are taking nitrates such as nitroglycerin, or if you have experienced a heart attack, stroke, or severe blood pressure issues. This medication does not protect against sensually transmitted diseases (STDs) such as HIV, hepatitis B, gonorrhea, or syphilis. It is not suitable for individuals with conditions like sickle cell anemia, leukemia, multiple myeloma, or Peyronie’s disease. Seek medical advice if you have a bleeding disorder, peptic ulcers, or retinitis pigmentosa.</p><p><strong>Precautions Before Taking Sildenafil Citrate 120mg:</strong></p><p>As Sildenafil Citrate 120mg is a prescription medication, it is essential to discuss your medical history with your doctor to ensure it is appropriate for your condition. Do not take more than one dose per day, and consult your healthcare provider for more information.</p><p><strong>Side Effects of Sildenafil Citrate 120mg:</strong></p><p>While Sildenafil Citrate 120mg is generally effective for treating erectile dysfunction, some users may experience mild side effects such as headaches, upset stomach, diarrhea, flu-like symptoms, and nausea, particularly if the medication is taken in excess. It is always recommended to consult a doctor before purchasing any medication to ensure it is the best option for you.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 07:57:52', '2024-12-13 18:00:52', NULL, 'Buy Sildenafil citrate 120mg pill uses,Dosage', 'Sildenafil citrate 120mg, Buy Sildenafil citrate 120mg, Sildenafil citrate 120mg pill, Sildenafil citrate 120mg pill uses', 'Buy Sildenafil citrate 120mg pill uses from rsmmultilink.com at lowermost price is one of the most in effect medicament to treat Impotence, and it has verified to work on 97% of males.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
