(123, '--', 'Sildenafil 25mg', 'sildenafil-25mg-91', 'sgYrg8linu1RvpT0n1CepC4Jp1M08LKMEJK7POmn.png', 'Sildenafil 25mg', '<p>We offer a highly effective range of Sildenafil 25mg tablets, designed to address male impotence by promoting smooth muscle relaxation and increasing blood flow to specific areas, leading to a firm and lasting erection. These Sildenafil 25mg Pills are among the most efficient and results-driven treatments for erectile dysfunction. For optimal results, it is important to use them as directed, with no more than one dose per day. Our Sildenafil 25mg Tablets are available in various dosages, and when used as recommended, they can effectively help treat a range of health issues. As leading manufacturers and suppliers of Sildenafil 25mg medicines from India, we ensure high-quality products.</p><p><strong>Key Facts about Sildenafil 25mg:</strong></p><p>Sildenafil 25mg inhibits the enzyme phosphodiesterase type 5 (PDE5), which increases blood flow to the genital area when associated with sensuous arousal. This helps men achieve and maintain an erection, making it a trusted solution for treating erectile dysfunction.</p><p><strong>How to Take Sildenafil 25mg?</strong></p><p>For best results, take Sildenafil 25mg at least 30 minutes before sensual activity, but no more than 4 hours beforehand. Avoid consuming high-fat meals while taking this medication, as fatty foods can reduce its effectiveness.</p><p><strong>Who Should Avoid Sildenafil 25mg?</strong></p><p>Do not take Sildenafil 25mg if you are allergic to it or if you are using nitrates (e.g., nitroglycerin). It is also not suitable for individuals who have had a heart attack, stroke, severe high or low blood pressure, or life-threatening heart conditions. This medication does not protect against sensually transmitted diseases (STDs) such as HIV, hepatitis B, gonorrhea, or syphilis. It is also not recommended for men with conditions like sickle cell anemia, leukemia, or multiple myeloma. If you have any genital deformities like Peyronie’s disease, or if you suffer from a bleeding disorder, peptic ulcers, or retinitis pigmentosa, consult a doctor before using this medication.</p><p><strong>Precautions Before Using Sildenafil 25mg:</strong></p><p>As Sildenafil 25mg is a prescription medication, it is important to consult with your healthcare provider to ensure it is a suitable treatment for your condition. Do not exceed one dose per day, and always follow the dosage instructions provided by your doctor or pharmacist.</p><p><strong>Possible Side Effects of Sildenafil 25mg:</strong></p><p>While Sildenafil 25mg is generally effective for treating erectile dysfunction, some users may experience rare side effects, including headaches, upset stomach, diarrhea, flu-like symptoms, and nausea, especially when the medication is overdosed. It is always advisable to consult a doctor before starting any treatment for impotence to ensure it is the right choice for you.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 08:04:37', '2024-12-13 18:02:31', NULL, 'Buy Sildenafil 25mg Online from rsmmultilink.com', 'Buy Sildenafil 25mg, Online Sildenafil 25mg', 'Buy Sildenafil 25mg Online from rsmmultilink.com at lowest price that is an expert drug or oral medication for Impotence or ED related issues in males today.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
