(134, NULL, 'Kamagra Gold (Sildenafil Citrate 100mg)', 'kamagra-gold-80', '1PyhFzRprcTnx1BNXN71bjMMKD2noNIfgyILcKq5.jpeg', 'Kamagra Gold (Sildenafil Citrate 100mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Kamagra Gold</strong> is used to treat ED in men. It works by improving the blood flow in the penis, giving a firm erection. This Medicine is manufactured for Ajanta Pharma. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Kamagra Gold 100 mg is the Medicine used in treating ED or impotence in men. It belongs to a class of PDE5 inhibitors. Chronic lifestyle factors like junk food, obesity and stress contribute to ED in men and Kamagra Gold 100mg helps to cure that . </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Kamagra Gold 100mg</strong> contains <strong>sildenafil 100mg</strong> which is an active element to inhibit &nbsp;enzymes. It acts on the erectile tissue of the penis to enhance blood flow and differs from person to person. Kamagra Gold 100 mg is more effective in tablet form as sildenafil is easily absorbed into the blood, increasing the flow in the penile area .</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consume one tablet of Kamagra Gold 100 mg with one glass of water. Avoid large or high-meals before using this tablet. It shows the effect in 5-10 minutes. Do not skip the dose without a physician\'s consultation. </span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Study the directions thoroughly before taking Kamagra Gold 100 mg prescribed by your doctor. Consult the physician if you have had a condition of cardiovascular or heart problems or you have had a heart attack or stroke in the last six months.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The side effects of Kamagra Gold 100 mg that may occour &nbsp;are flushing, dizziness, headache, upset stomach, blurred vision, and rashes. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid exerting an overdose at any price. Taking an excess dosage can have harmful effects on your health. Seek necessary help in case of severe symptoms. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Kamagra Gold 100 mg interacts with any nitrate medication, such as nitroglycerin. It may interact with the following Medicines:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\"><!-- [if !supportLists