ont-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if you are allergic to sildenafil or any ingredients in <strong>Kamagra Gold 100mg</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Ask your physician if you have high or low blood pressure, anaemia, genital deformity, stomach ulcer, liver disease before using this Medicine.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 00:30:41', '2023-08-09 11:29:26', NULL, 'Buy Online Kamagra Gold (Sildenafil Citrate 100mg) Tablets - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Buy kamagra 100mg online, rsm enterprises, Cheap Kamagra Gold, erectile dysfunction pills', 'Buy Online Kamagra Gold (Sildenafil Citrate 100mg) Tablets is used to treat ED in men. It works by improving the blood flow in the penis, giving a firm erection.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(136, '--', 'Kamagra Effervescent (Sildenafil Citrate 100mg)', 'kamagra-effervescent-79', 'hVt7NOiIvYeTKyNmLjTepj3fxFqWNVQkuzcfHABc.jpeg', 'Kamagra Effervescent (Sildenafil Citrate 100mg)', '<h2><strong>Description</strong></h2><p>Kamagra Effervescent ® is used to treat ED in men. It works by increasing the blood in the penis, giving a firm erection. This Medicine is manufactured for Ajanta Pharma.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></h2><p>Kamagra Effervescent ® is the Medicine used in treating ED or impotence in men. It belongs to a group of &nbsp;(PDE 5) inhibitors. It relaxes the blood vessels around the penile area. It works only when a man is sexually aroused.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></h2><p>Kamagra Effervescent ® contains sildenafil 100 mg which is an active element to hinder &nbsp;enzymes. It acts on the erectile tissue of the penis to increase blood flow. Kamagra Effervescent 100mg is more effective in tablet form as sildenafil is easily absorbed into the blood.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Dosing Information</strong></h2><p>Stir gently one tablet of Kamagra Effervescent ® into one glass of water. Avoid large or high-meal before consuming this tablet. It shows the result in 5-10 minutes. Do not skip the dose without a doctor\'s consultation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Treatment</strong></h2><p>Study the directions thoroughly before taking Kamagra Effervescent ® prescribed by your doctor. Consult the physician if you have had a condition of cardiovascular or heart problems or you have had a heart attack or stroke in the last six months.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></h2><p>The side effects of Kamagra Effervescent ® are flushing, dizziness, headache, upset stomach, blurred vision, and rashes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Overdose</strong></h2><p>Avoid exerting an overdose at any price. Taking an excess dosage can have harmful effects on your health. Seek necessary help in case of severe symptoms.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></h2><p>Kamagra Effervescent ® interacts with any nitrate medication, such as nitroglycerin. It interacts with Medicines for handling ulcers, fungal infections and HIV. If you have high blood pressure, this Medicine acts with alpha-blockers like doxazosin.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Precautions</strong></h2><p>●&nbsp;Do not consume if you are allergic to sildenafil or any ingredients in Kamagra Effervescent ®.</p><p>●&nbsp;Ask your doctor if you have high or low blood pressure, liver disease before using this Medicine.&nbsp;</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 00:32:18', '2024-12-13 17:38:33', NULL, 'Buy kamagra 100mg Online, Kamagra Effervescent  Pills', 'Kamagra 100mg, Buy kamagra 100mg Online, RSM Multilink LLP, Cheap kamagra Effervescent', 'Buy best quality Kamagra Effervescent tablets and kamagra 100mg online at RSM Multilink LLP. These are highly effective to be used for erectile dysfunction. Cheapest drugs online - buy to save money!', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(137, NULL, 'Kamagra 100mg', 'kamagra-100mg-78', 'Ok48HrvYkNi3PnhupKJ21XESyBCqVNuKd940d4Gb.jpeg', 'Kamagra 100mg', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Kamagra 100mg</strong> is a sildenafil citrate 100mg salt derivative for treating impotence or ED in men. It works by easing the blood vessels around the penis, giving a stiff erection before sensual activity. This Medicine is manufactured for Ajanta Pharma. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Kamagra&reg; 100mg is used in treating poor penile erection in men, which is an inability to maintain a stiff erection for a longer duration. It belongs to a group of Medicines called &nbsp;PDE5 inhibitors. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Kamagra&reg; 100mg contains sildenafil citrate, which acts by hindering PDE-5 and enhancing nitric oxide (NO) action in the penis. It helps in increasing the blood flow. As a result, it gives a prolonged erection for a satisfying sensual performance. Kamagra&reg; 100mg comes in tablet form as swallowed directly into the mouth.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Consume Kamagra 100mg</strong> having an active ingredient, <strong>sildenafil citrate</strong>, one hour before the sensual activity. Avoid large or high-meal as it can lower the effect. Do not miss the following dosage without a doctor\'s consultation. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Study the instructions thoroughly before taking <strong>Kamagra 100mg</strong> prescribed by your doctor. Consult the doctor if you have recently had a stroke or heart attack or have low blood pressure.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The side effects of Kamagra&reg; 100mg</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">are Dyspepsia, dizziness, headache, and sleeping disorder. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Taking an excess dosage can have harmful effects on your health, like a painful erection.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Kamagra 100mg</strong> interacts with any Medicine that contains nitrate ingredients. It&nbsp; May Interact </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">with fentanyl, amlodipine, Atorvastatin, Zafirlukast etc.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if you are allergic to <strong>sildenafil</strong> or any active elements present in Kamagra&reg; 100mg. </span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Ask your physician if you have heart problems, kidney or liver disease before using this Medicine. </span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">It is not suitable for women. </span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Use it with care if you have a heart condition or blood pressure.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 00:34:10', '2023-08-09 10:43:00', NULL, 'Buy Online Kamagra 100mg (Sildenafil 100mg) Tablets - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Kamagra 100mg tablet price, buy online Kamagra 100mg tablet, Buy kamagra - 100mg tablets online, best price Kamagra 100mg tablet, Kamagra 100mg tablet uses', 'Buy Online Kamagra 100mg (Sildenafil 100mg) is a sildenafil citrate 100mg salt derivative for treating impotence or ED in men. Order Now!!!', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(138, '--', 'Orlistat Capsules 120mg', 'orlistat-capsules-120mg-72', 'CZFnd8YGkIQ7AZpFU5i07EAyFzWQ2CQbPylMgny8.png', 'Orlistat Capsules 120mg', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Orlistat Capsules 120mg,</strong> offered by <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>, are a trusted solution for weight management and obesity control. These pills operate by inhibiting the absorption of certain dietary fats, which aids in weight loss and maintenance when combined with a calorie-reduced diet. Manufactured with high-grade chemicals in a quality-controlled laboratory environment, Orlistat Capsules ensure purity and effectiveness without adverse side effects. As leading manufacturers, exporters, and suppliers, RSM Multilink LLP provides Orlistat Capsules 120mg at competitive prices.</p><p><strong>How to Use Orlistat Capsules 120mg (Euslim 120mg)?</strong></p><p><strong>For best results, follow these guidelines:</strong></p><p><strong>Dosage: Take Orlistat Capsules 120mg three times daily, with each main meal containing fat.</strong></p><p><strong>Timing</strong>: Consume during the meal or within one hour after eating. If you skip a meal or have a fat-free meal, you can skip the dosage.</p><p>Follow the instructions given by your doctor or on the package label. Do not exceed the prescribed dosage.</p><p><strong>Potential Side Effects of Orlistat Capsules 120mg:</strong></p><p>While Orlistat Capsules 120mg are generally safe, some side effects may occur, especially in the initial weeks:</p><p><strong>Common</strong>: Changes in bowel motions, oily spots on clothing, loose or fatty stools, and increased bowel movement frequency.</p><p><strong>Rare</strong>: Abdominal pain, gas with oily spotting, irregular menstrual periods, headache, rectal discomfort, or difficulty controlling bowel movements.</p><p>If you notice any unusual or severe symptoms, seek immediate medical attention from your doctor.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Using Orlistat Capsules 120mg:</strong></p><p>To guarantee the safe and effective use of Orlistat:</p><p><strong>Medical History</strong>: Inform your doctor if you have any allergies, digestive disorders, hypothyroidism, or metabolic issues like kidney stones.</p><p><strong>Inactive Ingredients</strong>: Stay informed about the possibility of allergic reactions caused by the inactive components present in the capsules.</p><p><strong>Eating Disorders</strong>: This medication is unsuitable for individuals with conditions like anorexia nervosa or bulimia.</p><p><strong>Pregnancy</strong>: Orlistat should not be used during pregnancy, as its use is discouraged by the manufacturer.</p><p><strong>Why Choose Orlistat Capsules 120mg by RSM Multilink LLP?</strong></p><p><strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong> offers high-quality Orlistat Capsules 120mg that are reliable and effective for weight management. With a commitment to affordability, quality, and customer satisfaction, these capsules are an excellent choice for individuals seeking a dependable weight-loss aid.</p><p>Achieve your weight-loss goals with<strong> Orlistat Capsules 120mg</strong>—a proven solution for managing obesity and improving overall health.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 00:35:36', '2024-12-12 14:08:43', NULL, 'Orlistat Capsules 120mg: Effective Weight Loss Solution by RSM Multilink LLP', 'orlistat 120mg , Euslim 120mg', 'orlistat is use to treatment for weight loss which is intended for tablet usage only under the guidance of the doctor or a physician.its manufactured by RSM Multilink LLP .', 0, 0, NULL, '');
