(139, '--', 'Orlistat Capsules 60mg', 'orlistat-capsules-60mg-71', 'ydm7rCk058BLokxDI8xPEJwJJyUKpynOvFVVG8WP.png', 'Orlistat Capsules 60mg', '<p><strong>RSM Enterprises</strong>&nbsp;are recognized amidst prominent&nbsp;<strong>Orlistat Capsules 60mg (Euslim 60mg) Manufacturers, Exporters and Suppliers in India.</strong>&nbsp;Orlistat 60mg Weight Loss Pills are a prescription weight-control medication containing orlistat, which acts as a lipase inhibitor. It is useful for the long-term treatment of significant obesity. Moreover, it also helps to prevent regaining weight previously lost. Orlistat 60mg works by blocking some of the fat normally digested by the intestine. We ensure that this is formulated under the direction of experienced professional keeping in mind the international quality standard. Widely appreciated for their purity, effectiveness and precise combination.<br><br><strong>How to use Orlistat Capsules 60mg (Euslim 60mg) ?</strong><br><br>Orlistat Capsules 60mg comes as a capsule and a nonprescription capsule to take by mouth. It is usually taken three times a day with each main meal that contains fat. Take Orlistat Capsules 60mg during a meal or up to 1 hour after a meal. If a meal is missed or does not have fat, you may skip your dose. Follow the directions on your prescription label or the package label carefully, and ask your doctor or pharmacist to explain any part you do not understand. Take Orlistat Capsules 60mg exactly as directed. Do not take more or less of it or take it more often than prescribed by your doctor or stated on the package.<br><br><strong>Orlistat Capsules 60mg (Euslim 60mg) Side Effects :</strong></p><p>Orlistat Capsules 60mg come with a patient information booklet that should be read carefully. The most common side effect of Orlistat Capsules 60mg is changes in bowel movement (BM) habits. This generally occurs during the first weeks of treatment; however, it may continue throughout your use of Orlistat Capsules 60mg. Some of the rare side effects are oily spotting on underwear or on clothing, gas with oily spotting, urgent need to have a bowel movement, loose stools, oily or fatty stools, increased number of bowel movements, difficulty controlling bowel movements, pain or discomfort in the rectum (bottom), stomach pain, irregular menstrual periods, headache, anxiety etc. Call your doctor, if you have any unusual problems while taking Orlistat Capsules 60mg.<br><br><strong>Orlistat Capsules 60mg (Euslim 60mg) Precautions :</strong><br><br>Before taking Orlistat Capsules 60mg, tell your doctor or pharmacist if you have any allergies, digestive disorders (malabsorption or cholestasis), low thyroid function (hypothyroidism), other metabolism problems (e.g., oxalate kidney stones, hyperoxaluria). This product may contain inactive ingredients, which can cause allergic reactions or other problems. This Orlistat Capsules 60mg should not be used if you have anorexia nervosa or bulimia-type eating disorders. Tell your doctor if you are pregnant before using this medication. The manufacturer does not recommend the use of this drug during pregnancy.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 00:37:02', '2024-12-13 17:33:44', NULL, 'Generic xenical 60 mg | Orlistate capsule 60mg | RSM Multilink LLP', 'Orlistat Capsules 60mg, Buy Orlistat Capsules 60mg', 'Buy Orlistat Capsules 60mg from rsmmultilink.com that mechanisms by hindering absorption of 25% of the fat in a meal and is utilized for weight loss in overweight adults', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(140, '--', 'Finasteride 5mg', 'finasteride-5mg-70', 'Ueto5V2UMPG2Btc6Anoj0kFiAoZ7GjQaaegQ0kYx.png', 'Finasteride 5mg', '<p><strong>Finasteride 5mg (Fenered 5mg): A Reliable Solution for Male Pattern Hair Loss</strong></p><p>Finasteride 5mg, marketed as Fenered 5mg, is an effective treatment for male pattern hair loss. This medication works by blocking the production of dihydrotestosterone (DHT), a male hormone that contributes to hair loss in the scalp. It is specifically formulated to address mild to moderate hair thinning at the crown and the front of the mid-scalp area. By slowing down hair loss, improving hair regrowth, and increasing overall hair density, Finasteride 5mg offers a comprehensive solution for scalp hair issues. It is important to note that it has no effect on hair development elsewhere on the body. However, discontinuing treatment may result in the loss of all previously gained benefits. Not suitable for women or children, this medication is a trusted product from leading manufacturers and suppliers of Finasteride 5mg pills in India.</p><p><strong>How Does Finasteride 5mg (Fenered 5mg) Work?</strong></p><p>Finasteride 5mg should be taken exactly as prescribed by a healthcare provider. The tablet is normally taken orally once a day, with or without food. For optimal results, take it at the same time each day, as consistency aids in maintaining therapeutic effects. Always follow the dosage instructions provided by your doctor and avoid taking more or less than prescribed. A pharmacist\'s guidance can also help you understand the correct use of this medication.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Finasteride 5mg (Fenered 5mg):</strong></p><p>Before starting Finasteride 5mg, inform your doctor about any known allergies or medical conditions. This medication may contain inactive ingredients that could trigger allergic reactions or other complications. Patients with a history of liver disease, prostate cancer, urinary problems, or infections should exercise caution and seek medical advice before use. Finasteride 5mg is not recommended for use by children or women, as it is designed specifically for adult men.</p><p><strong>Side Effects of Finasteride 5mg (Fenered 5mg):</strong></p><p>In clinical studies, Finasteride 5mg has been shown to be well-tolerated, with adverse reactions reported infrequently. The most common side effect was a temporary decrease in libido, observed in less than 2% of users. This issue typically resolved after discontinuation of the medication. If you experience any unusual symptoms or prolonged side effects, consult your healthcare provider promptly.</p><p>With its proven efficacy and targeted action, Finasteride 5mg (Fenered 5mg) remains a trusted choice for managing male pattern hair loss.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 00:38:18', '2024-11-25 13:46:35', NULL, 'Finasteride 5mg, Buy Finasteride 5mg online', 'Finasteride 5mg, Buy Finasteride 5mg online', 'Buy Finasteride 5mg online from rsmenterprises.in that handles male pattern hair loss by hindering the body\'s creation of a male hormone in the scalp that halts hair growth.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(141, '--', 'Finasteride 1mg', 'finasteride-1mg-69', 'aZpQ2UT04NsEGHq0J1LnmIrX9Kfnqlk1pOPrUqdX.png', 'Finasteride 1mg', '<p><strong>Finasteride 1mg (Fenered 1mg): An Effective Solution for Male Pattern Hair Loss</strong></p><p>RSM Multilink LLP presents Finasteride 1mg (Fenered 1mg), a proven treatment for male pattern hair loss. This condition, characterized by gradual thinning of scalp hair leading to a receding hairline or balding at the crown, affects many men globally. Finasteride 1mg works by reducing the levels of dihydrotestosterone (DHT), a hormone responsible for hair loss. By lowering DHT levels, this medication promotes hair regrowth and slows the progression of hair loss. Notably, it exclusively targets scalp hair without influencing hair growth on other parts of the body. It is not suitable for women or children.&nbsp; As a trusted manufacturer, exporter, and supplier of Finasteride 1mg, we ensure competitive pricing and timely delivery of our products.</p><p><strong>How Does Finasteride 1mg (Fenered 1mg) Work?</strong></p><p>Finasteride 1mg is a daily oral tablet taken as prescribed by your doctor. It can be consumed with or without food, and it’s best to take it at the same time each day for consistent results. Always follow your doctor’s instructions, and avoid adjusting the dosage on your own. A patient information leaflet is provided with the medication to help you understand its proper use.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Finasteride 1mg (Fenered 1mg):</strong></p><p>Before starting Finasteride 1mg, consult your doctor or pharmacist, especially if you have any allergies or pre-existing conditions such as:</p><p>• Liver disease</p><p>• Prostate cancer</p><p>• Infections</p><p>• Urinary issues</p><p>Finasteride 1mg contains inactive ingredients that may cause allergic reactions in some individuals. This medication is intended exclusively for adult men and should not be used by women or children.</p><p><strong>Side Effects of Finasteride 1mg (Fenered 1mg):</strong></p><p>Clinical studies indicate that Finasteride 1mg is generally well-tolerated, with rare side effects. The most commonly reported issue is a temporary decrease in libido, occurring in fewer than 2% of men. This side effect typically resolves once the medication is discontinued.</p><p><strong>For any unusual or prolonged side effects, consult your healthcare provider immediately.</strong></p><p>Choose Finasteride 1mg (Fenered 1mg) for a reliable and effective solution to male pattern hair loss, backed by a trusted supplier committed to quality and customer satisfaction.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 00:39:39', '2024-12-13 17:31:39', NULL, 'Finasteride 1 mg  (generic proscar)tablets -RSM Multilink LLP', 'Finasteride 1 mg, Finasteride 1 mg Online', 'RSM Multilink LLP  is the manufacturers of ed products like sildenafil, vardenafil , tadalfil and herbal products like many more . for more details contact us !', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
