(144, '--', 'Esomeprazole 40mg', 'esomeprazole-40mg-64', 'gbXE9BrhjeMaTBx0oFaPkPQixBnXPNbiolqyikOI.png', 'Esomeprazole 40mg', '<p><strong>Esomeprazole Tablets 40mg: Effective Treatment for Ulcers and Acid Reflux</strong></p><p>Esomeprazole Tablets 40mg, a powerful proton pump inhibitor, are widely used for treating stomach ulcers and acid-related conditions. The stomach naturally produces acid for digestion, but excessive acid can cause discomfort and damage, leading to ulcers and acid reflux. Esomeprazole 40mg effectively reduces acid production, making it an ideal solution for managing conditions like reflux esophagitis by allowing the esophageal lining to heal. These tablets are a trusted choice for those seeking relief from acid indigestion and other gastric issues. As a prominent manufacturer, exporter, and supplier of Esomeprazole Tablets 40mg in India, we are committed to delivering quality healthcare solutions.</p><p><strong>How Esomeprazole Tablets 40mg (Esomiz-40) Work?</strong></p><p>Esomeprazole Tablets 40mg are oral medications designed to decrease stomach acid production. They should be taken with water and are most effective when consumed on an empty stomach, ideally an hour before meals. It’s crucial to follow your doctor’s prescription and avoid overdoses. Regular intervals between doses ensure optimal results. Always consult a healthcare provider before beginning treatment with Esomeprazole 40mg.</p><p><strong>Potential Side Effects of Esomeprazole Tablets 40mg (Esomiz-40):</strong></p><p>While Esomeprazole is generally well-tolerated, it may cause mild side effects, such as:</p><ul><li>Nausea</li><li>Headache</li><li>Diarrhea</li><li>Drowsiness or dizziness</li><li>Upset stomach</li><li>Dry mouth</li></ul><p>In rare cases, serious side effects like loss of appetite, severe weight loss, mood changes, unusual fatigue, tremors, or allergic reactions may occur. If you experience any adverse effects, especially severe ones, seek immediate medical advice.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Using Esomeprazole Tablets 40mg:</strong></p><p>Before starting Esomeprazole 40mg, inform your doctor about any allergies, current medications (including vitamins and supplements), or existing medical conditions. Avoid exceeding the prescribed dosage to prevent complications. Allergic reactions or inappropriate use of the medication should be reported to your healthcare provider.</p><p>Esomeprazole Tablets 40mg are a proven and reliable solution for managing ulcers, acid reflux, and related conditions. With proper medical guidance and adherence to the prescribed regimen, you can experience relief and improved digestive health. Choose Esomiz-40 for quality and effectiveness, backed by trusted manufacturing and expertise.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 00:43:39', '2024-12-13 17:21:10', NULL, 'Esomeprazole capsules 20 mg , 40 mg, (generic Nexium ) ESOMIZ', 'Esomeprazole 40mg,  Esomeprazole 40mg pill', 'Esomeprazole 40mg pill from rsmmultilink.com is used for heartburn, acid reflux and gastro-oesophageal reflux disease (GORD) and also utilized to prevent and treat stomach ulcers.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(145, '--', 'Esomeprazole 20mg', 'esomeprazole-20mg-63', '3Yc0StopYv80z24BuBUiEexfhKhr8QHfYwQqqIGX.png', 'Esomeprazole 20mg', '<p><strong>Premium Quality Esomeprazole Tablets 20mg (Esomiz-20) by RSM Multilink:</strong></p><p><strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>, a trusted name among leading manufacturers, exporters, and suppliers, offers premium-quality Esomeprazole Tablets 20mg (Esomiz-20). These tablets belong to a class of medications known as proton pump inhibitors and are formulated to reduce stomach acid production. Esomeprazole 20mg helps alleviate symptoms of gastroesophageal reflux disease (GERD), such as heartburn, by minimizing acid reflux into the esophagus. Additionally, it is used alongside other medications to treat and prevent stomach ulcers caused by specific bacteria. This highly effective medicine, processed as enteric-coated pellets, ensures rapid action and long-lasting relief.</p><p><strong>How Esomeprazole Tablets 20mg (Esomiz-20) Work:</strong></p><p>Esomeprazole Tablets 20mg are designed for oral consumption. They should be taken with water, as directed by a doctor, to ensure effective absorption. These tablets are best taken on an empty stomach, at least an hour before a meal. Strict adherence to the prescribed dosage is essential to avoid any complications. Regularly spaced doses help optimize the medication’s effects. Always follow the prescription label for accurate guidance.</p><p><strong>Side Effects of Esomeprazole Tablets 20mg (Esomiz-20):</strong></p><p>While Esomeprazole 20mg is generally safe, some individuals may experience minor side effects, such as:</p><ul><li>Nausea</li><li>Headache</li><li>Diarrhea</li><li>Dry mouth</li><li>Drowsiness or dizziness</li><li>Upset stomach</li></ul><p>In rare cases, serious side effects like loss of appetite, severe weight loss, mood changes, increased sweating, fatigue, or tremors may occur. If you notice any severe or unusual reactions, consult your doctor immediately.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Using Esomeprazole Tablets 20mg (Esomiz-20):</strong></p><p>Before starting Esomeprazole Tablets 20mg, inform your healthcare provider about any allergies or existing medical conditions. Discuss all prescription and over-the-counter medications, supplements, and herbal products you are taking to avoid potential interactions. Do not exceed the prescribed dose or continue usage if allergic symptoms arise.</p><p><strong>Why Choose Esomeprazole Tablets 20mg from RSM Multilink?</strong></p><p>RSM Multilink LLP takes pride in delivering high-quality Esomeprazole 20mg tablets designed for effective relief from acid reflux and related conditions. As a trusted exporter and supplier, we ensure that each product meets stringent quality standards, offering reliable and long-term solutions for managing acid-related health issues. Choose Esomiz-20 for proven results and improved digestive health.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 00:45:09', '2024-12-13 17:21:58', NULL, 'Esomeprazole 20mg,generic nexium (ESOMIZ) esomeprazole capsules', 'Esomeprazole 20mg, Buy Esomeprazole 20mg', 'Buy Esomeprazole 20mg from rsmmultilink.com is used to handle indications of gastroesophageal reflux disease(GERD) and other circumstances connecting excessive stomach acid such as Zollinger-Ellison syndrome', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
