(147, NULL, 'Sertraline Tablets 50mg', 'sertraline-tablets-50mg-61', 's4htcJqol0bfsmxOh3bZs7f642J4hdtTmTIIWMyW.jpeg', 'Sertraline Tablets 50mg', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">Leveraging on our widely spread shipment network,&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">RSM Enterprises</strong><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">are placed amidst ourselves as a leading Sertraline Tablets 50mg&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">Manufacturers and Suppliers from India.</strong><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;These Anxiety Sertraline Tablets are highly effective for the persons suffering from depression. It has also been used to treat a severe form of premenstrual syndrome (premenstrual dysphoric disorder- PMDD) and a sexual function (premature ejaculation) problem in men. But this Sertraline 50mg cannot be consumed directly without any prior consultation of your physician. Our range of Sertraline 50mg Tablets is in compliance with the international quality standards and offered at competitive prices.</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 00:50:52', '2020-01-24 05:36:03', NULL, 'generic  zoloft(setraline 50 mg) suppliers & manufacturers - RSM Enterprises', 'Sertraline Tablets 50mg, Buy Sertraline Tablets 50mg', 'Buy Sertraline Tablets 50mg from rsmenterprises.in is signposted for the handling of major depressive episodes and hindrance of reappearance of major depressing episodes.', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(148, NULL, 'Tamoxifen Citrate 20mg', 'tamoxifen-citrate-20mg-60', 'bCI4P70dneZmET9FUcJSXNOBLyKvV41w5d4AsPel.jpeg', 'Tamoxifen Citrate 20mg', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Acquire&nbsp;<strong>Tamoxifen Citrate 20mg&nbsp;</strong>from&nbsp;<strong>RSM Enterprises</strong>, a trusted&nbsp;<strong>Manufacturer and Supplier based in India.&nbsp;</strong>Tamoxifen Citrate 20mg Tablet is an anti-estrogen that is beneficial for treating both the early and advanced breast cancer. It is also favorable for those who are at a high risk of developing breast cancer. The Tamoxifen Citrate 20mg medicines competes with estradiol for estrogen receptor protein and treats breast cancer. It is useful when the cancer cells have multiplied in other parts of the body. These Tamoxifen Citrate 20mg Pills are provided at reasonable rates. Kindly seek medical advice from a registered Medical Doctor/ hospital/Institute.<br /><br /><strong>How to use Tamoxifen Citrate 20mg (Tamilong 20mg) ?</strong><br />Tamoxifen Citrate, an anticancer drug, is given to treat breast cancer in women and men. Swallow the Tamoxifen Citrate Tablet, with water or any nonalcoholic liquid. You can take Tamoxifen Citrate Pills with or without food. It should be used only when your doctor prescribes it for you. Never take it without prescription.<br /><br /><strong>Precautions to use Tamoxifen Citrate 20mg (Tamilong 20mg) :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Tell your doctor about all prescription, over-the-counter and herbal medications you are taking before beginning treatment with Tamoxifen Citrate. Also, talk to your doctor about your complete medical history. Do not take Tamoxifen Citrate Tablet, if you are allergic to it or any of its components. Do not breastfeed if you are using Tamoxifen Citrate Pills.<br /><br /><strong>Side Effects of Tamoxifen Citrate 20mg (<strong>Tamilong</strong>&nbsp;20mg)</strong></span>&nbsp;<strong>:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">The most common side effects people have experienced include pain in the bones and muscles, constipation, a dry cough that is persistent, nausea and vomiting, fatigue, and weight loss. Many women experience excessive vaginal discharge. Only your doctor can determine, if it is safe for you to continue taking this Tamoxifen Citrate.</span></span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 00:52:22', '2023-05-09 11:01:10', NULL, 'Buy Online Generic Nolvadex (TAMOXIFEN CITRATE 20MG 10,20 mg)', 'Tamoxifen Citrate 20mg, Buy Tamoxifen Citrate 20mg', 'Buy Online generic Nolvadex to help reverse the problem of breast cancer in women. It is effective to treat overall health.', 0, 0, NULL, 'thumbnail/1683630070.jpg'),
(149, '--', 'Tamoxifen Citrate 10mg', 'tamoxifen-citrate-10mg-59', 'VbcemUR5OZ05kDLic37XNUjkko3yzGWoDifnxTVm.jpeg', 'Tamoxifen Citrate 10mg', '<p>The&nbsp;<strong>Tamoxifen Citrate 10mg (Relvadex 10mg)</strong>&nbsp;offered by&nbsp;<strong>RSM Enterprises&nbsp;</strong>is a non-steroidal medication, used for the treatment of metastatic breast cancer. Tamoxifen Citrate 10mg Tablet is an anti-estrogen that is beneficial for treating both the early and advanced breast cancer. It may keep the cancer from spreading to other parts of the body. Tamoxifen Citrate 10mg Pills reduce the chance of getting a new breast cancer. It may also be prescribed to treat various other kinds of cancer, as determined by your doctor. With our vast experience in this field we have become one of the eminent&nbsp;<strong>Tamoxifen Citrate 10mg Medicines Manufacturers, Suppliers and Exporters from India.</strong><br><br><br><strong>How to use Tamoxifen Citrate 10mg (Relvadex 10mg) ?</strong></p><p>Tamoxifen Citrate, an anticancer drug, is given to treat breast cancer in women and men. Swallow the Tamoxifen Citrate Tablet, with water or any nonalcoholic liquid. You can take Tamoxifen Citrate Pills with or without food. It should be used only when your doctor prescribes it for you. Never take it without prescription.<br><br><strong>Precautions to use Tamoxifen Citrate 10mg (Relvadex 10mg) :</strong></p><p>Tell your doctor about all prescription, over-the-counter and herbal medications you are taking before beginning treatment with Tamoxifen Citrate. Also, talk to your doctor about your complete medical history. Do not take Tamoxifen Citrate Tablet, if you are allergic to it or any of its components. Do not breastfeed if you are using Tamoxifen Citrate Pills.<br><br><strong>Side Effects of Tamoxifen Citrate 10mg (Relvadex 10mg)</strong>&nbsp;<strong>:</strong></p><p>The most common side effects people have experienced include pain in the bones and muscles, constipation, a dry cough that is persistent, nausea and vomiting, fatigue, and weight loss. Many women experience excessive vaginal discharge. Only your doctor can determine, if it is safe for you to continue taking this Tamoxifen Citrate.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 00:54:05', '2024-12-13 16:14:03', NULL, 'Generic Nolvadex (tamoxifen citrate 10 mg) tablets - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Tamoxifen Citrate 10mg, Buy Tamoxifen Citrate 10mg', 'Buy Tamoxifen Citrate 10mg from rsmmultilink.com that blocks the activities of estrogen and is employed to handle and prevent some sorts of breast cancer.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(150, '--', 'ISOTRETINOIN 20MG', 'isotretinoin-20mg-58', '53FYqKNAhr8wGeR6HKqzU6n6aFiiRjHDwYPMMrbR.jpeg', 'RSM Multilink LLP are among prominent companies engaged in Manufacturing, Exporting, and Supplying Isotretinoin 20mg (Eratin 20mg).', '<p><strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong> is a well-established company specializing in the manufacturing, exporting, and supplying of <strong>Isotretinoin 20mg (Eratin 20mg</strong>), an effective medication used to treat severe acne. Isotretinoin 20mg capsules work by reducing the skin\'s production of sebum, the oily substance responsible for acne breakouts. This medication is highly effective, often clearing even the most stubborn acne cases. However, Isotretinoin 20mg is typically prescribed after other acne treatments have been unsuccessful, due to the potential for serious side effects. It has gained widespread popularity for offering a reliable balance of quality and affordability.</p><p><strong>How to Take Isotretinoin 20mg (Eratin 20mg)</strong></p><p><strong>Isotretinoin 20mg</strong> is primarily used to treat severe acne that has not responded to less aggressive treatments such as creams, antibiotics, or drying agents. The medication comes in capsule form, to be taken orally, typically twice a day. It is essential to follow the instructions provided by your doctor and the prescription label carefully. Take Isotretinoin 20mg exactly as prescribed and do not adjust the dosage or frequency without consulting your healthcare provider.</p><p><strong>Side Effects of Isotretinoin 20mg (Eratin 20mg)</strong></p><p><strong>Isotretinoin 20mg</strong> comes with a patient information booklet that should be thoroughly read. Although effective, this medication can cause some rare side effects. Common side effects may include dry skin, eyes, mouth, or nose, red or cracked lips, nosebleeds, and peeling skin, especially on the palms and soles. Other possible side effects include changes in skin color, hair loss or unwanted hair growth, difficulty swallowing, chest pain, muscle or joint pain, dizziness, blurred vision, nausea, and headaches. In rare cases, serious side effects like seizures, weakness, numbness, or yellowing of the skin and eyes may occur. It is important to contact your doctor immediately if any unusual or severe symptoms appear during treatment.</p><p><strong>Precautions AboutIsotretinoin 20mg (Eratin 20mg)</strong></p><p>Before taking Isotretinoin 20mg, inform your doctor and pharmacist if you are allergic to the medication, any other drugs, or any of the ingredients in Isotretinoin 20mg tablets. Be sure to discuss any prescription or over-the-counter medications, as well as vitamins, herbal products, and nutritional supplements you are currently using or plan to take. Never take Isotretinoin 20mg in doses higher than prescribed, and avoid using it if you have any signs of an allergic reaction. If you plan to become pregnant, discontinue<strong> Isotretinoin 20mg </strong>use 2-3 months before attempting conception, as the medication can have adverse effects on pregnancy.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 00:55:28', '2024-12-13 16:11:01', NULL, 'Buy Online ISOTRETINOIN 20MG in Best Price', 'generic Accutance manufacturers & suppiiers, RSM Multilink LLP, Isotretinoin 20mg, buy Eratin  20mg, Eratin 20mg online', 'To help promote improvement in acne issues, buy online isotretinoin 20mg capsules in best price. Visit rsmenterprises.in for better and enhanced outcomes!!', 0, 0, 'Isotretinoin 20mg,Eratin 20mg', ''),
(151, '--', 'Isotretinoin 10mg', 'isotretinoin-10mg-57', 'q8tYOGPhRwRELlqjvHUDqAFKjPgkVzWz4WWODyG0.jpeg', 'Isotretinoin 10mg', '<p><strong>Isotretinoin 10mg: A Reliable Solution for Effective Acne Treatment</strong></p><p><strong>Isotretinoin 10mg</strong> is an oral medication widely recognized for its effectiveness in treating stubborn acne. Manufactured by <strong>RSM Multilink LLP </strong>under the brand name <strong>Eratin 10mg</strong>, this medication contains 10mg of Isotretinoin, a powerful retinoid derived from Vitamin A. It works by significantly reducing sebum production, the natural oil responsible for acne development, and directly targeting the oil-producing glands to minimize bacterial growth and inflammation. This makes it highly effective in managing severe acne types like acne vulgaris and nodular acne.</p><p>The unique formulation of <strong>Isotretinoin 10mg</strong> ensures optimal results, especially for cases unresponsive to other treatments like antibiotics. By controlling the production of natural body substances and leveraging its anti-inflammatory properties, it helps improve overall skin health. It is also available in both oral and topical forms to provide flexible treatment options for individuals struggling with persistent acne.</p><p><strong>How to Use Isotretinoin 10mg&nbsp;(Eratin 10mg)</strong></p><p>Take<strong> Isotretinoin capsules</strong> with a full glass of water to ensure proper absorption. Do not chew or crush the pill; instead, swallow it completely. Follow your healthcare provider\'s advice about whether to take it with or without food. To achieve maximum results, stick to the prescribed dosage schedule, typically twice daily, and avoid missing doses. If you happen to skip a dose, do not double it—simply continue with the regular schedule. Overdosing or taking inadequate amounts may exacerbate acne.</p><p><strong>Possible Side Effects of Isotretinoin 10mg (Eratin 10mg)</strong></p><p>While Isotretinoin 10mg delivers excellent results, it may cause some side effects, especially if not used as directed. Common side effects include:</p><ul><li>Dry skin</li><li>Dry eyes</li><li>Excessive sweating</li><li>Facial flushing</li><li>Cold-like symptoms</li><li>Changes in weight</li></ul><p><strong>If any of these symptoms persist or worsen, consult your healthcare provider promptly.</strong></p><p><strong>Precautions for Isotretinoin 10mg (Eratin 10mg)</strong></p><p><strong>To ensure safe use of Isotretinoin 10mg, adhere to the following precautions:</strong></p><ul><li>Avoid the medication if you are allergic to Isotretinoin or have hypervitaminosis A.</li><li>If you are pregnant or intend to become pregnant, do not use.</li><li>It is not suitable for individuals under the age of 12.</li><li>Refrain from use if you have a known allergy to peanuts or soy products.</li></ul><p>Inform your doctor of any history of liver or kidney disease, depressive illness, or other chronic medical conditions. Limit sun exposure during treatment, as the medication may increase skin sensitivity. Avoid taking tetracycline, as it may reduce the effectiveness of Isotretinoin.</p><p><strong>Isotretinoin 10mg: Restoring Confidence Through Clearer Skin</strong></p><p>When used responsibly under medical guidance, <strong>Isotretinoin 10mg</strong> offers a reliable solution for managing severe acne. By addressing the root causes of acne, such as excess sebum production and inflammation, it provides noticeable and lasting results. Follow your doctor’s instructions to maximize the benefits and regain confidence with clearer, healthier skin.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 00:57:05', '2024-12-13 16:12:05', NULL, 'Buy Isotretinoin 10mg Tablet- RSM Multilink LLP', 'Buy Generic accutane, Eratin 10mg, buy Eratin 10mg', 'For efficacious treatment of severe acne conditions, buy Isotretinoin 10mg tablet. Avail resistant treatment at rsmmultilink.com store. Guaranteed offers!!', 0, 0, NULL, '');
