(152, NULL, 'Fluconazole 200mg', 'fluconazole-200mg-56', 'oZG6WHqMUwAR2AVeYr9JQGpN1s5XngOV3utBUDbE.png', 'Fluconazole 200mg', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Avail from&nbsp;<strong>RSM Enterprises</strong>&nbsp;a comprehensive range of&nbsp;<strong>Fluconazole 200mg (Fluc 200mg)</strong>&nbsp;that are used to prevent and treat a variety of fungal and yeast infections. These Fluconazole 200mg Tablets belong to a class of drugs called azole antifungal. Our product range is formulated using supreme class ingredients and latest processing methodology under the guidance of skilled pharmacists. We offer these Fluconazole 200mg Pills at the most reasonable prices in the market. We have advanced testing facilities in our laboratory where the products are tested on various parameters so that quality product reaches the clients. Besides, we are one of the most prominent&nbsp;<strong>Fluconazole 200mg Manufacturers, Exporters and Suppliers from India.</strong><br /><br /><strong>How to use Fluconazole 200mg (Fluc 200mg) ?</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Fluconazole 200mg comes as a tablet and a suspension (liquid) to take by mouth. It is usually taken once a day, with or without food as directed by your doctor. Follow the directions on your prescription label carefully and ask your doctor or pharmacist to explain any part you do not understand. Do not take more or less of it or take it more often than prescribed by your doctor.<br /><br /><strong>Precautions Fluconazole 200mg (Fluc 200mg) :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Before using Fluconazole 200mg, tell your doctor or pharmacist your medical history, especially of: liver disease, kidney disease. This Fluconazole 200mg may contain inactive ingredients, which can cause allergic reactions or other problems. Talk to your pharmacist for more details. In addition to that, tell your doctor and pharmacist what prescription and nonprescription medications, vitamins, nutritional supplements and herbal products you are taking or plan to take.</span></span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2020-01-24 00:59:40', '2020-09-27 09:42:28', NULL, 'Generic diflucan pills , Fluconazole 200mg- RSM Enterprises', 'Fluconazole 200mg', 'Fluconazole 200mg from rsmenterprises.com can be bought at sensible low-priced rate. It is an antifungal medication used for the handling of severe fungal infections.', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(153, '--', 'Fluconazole 150mg', 'fluconazole-150mg-55', '4qPRj2lqJVsaeXLVvQT0gc2vSKwRBxW08PLrKM10.jpeg', 'Fluconazole 150mg', '<p><strong>Fluconazole 150mg: Effective Treatment for Serious Fungal Infections</strong></p><p><strong>RSM Multilink</strong> is renowned for delivering top-quality Generic Diflucan 150mg Tablets, a reliable treatment for parasitic and amoebic infections. Acting as an effective antifungal and antiprotozoal medication, Generic Diflucan 150mg works by disrupting the formation of fungal cell membranes, ultimately weakening and eliminating sensitive fungi.</p><p>Processed in hygienic facilities and rigorously tested on well-defined quality parameters, these tablets meet bulk requirements with timely delivery. As a trusted Generic Diflucan 150mg Manufacturer, Supplier, and Exporter from India, RSM Multilink ensures products that adhere to high standards of efficacy and safety.</p><p><strong>How to Use Generic Diflucan 150mg?</strong></p><p>Generic Diflucan 150mg Tablets are designed for ease of use and effectiveness.</p><p><strong>Dosage Form</strong>: Available as tablets and oral suspension (liquid).</p><p><strong>Administration:</strong> Take the medication once daily, with or without food, as directed by your doctor.</p><p><strong>Instructions</strong>: Follow your prescription label closely. Do not alter the dosage or frequency without consulting your healthcare provider.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Generic Diflucan 150mg:</strong></p><p>To ensure safe usage and optimal results, consider the following precautions when taking Generic Diflucan 150mg Pills:</p><p><strong>Medical History: Inform your doctor about any history of liver or kidney disease.</strong></p><p><strong>Allergic Reactions</strong>: Some inactive ingredients in the medication may cause allergic reactions. Discuss potential risks with your pharmacist.</p><p><strong>Drug Interactions</strong>: Provide a complete list of prescription and over-the-counter medications, vitamin