(157, NULL, 'Ladygra 50mg (Sildenafil Citrate 50mg)', 'sildenafil-citrate-50mg-50', 'S9BVGvDn0JestQxkYteXItqup6lMprEiTPyPB4ki.png', 'Ladygra 50mg (Sildenafil Citrate 50mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">RSM Enterprises</strong><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;are highly specialized in supplying Women Sildenafil Citrate 50mg which are manufactured using quality raw material sourced from highly reliable sources. Provides intense sexual satisfaction for women seeking intensified pleasure during sexual activity. Our range of Women Sildenafil Citrate Tablets is in compliance with the international quality standards and offered at competitive prices. We have advanced testing facilities in our laboratory where the products are tested on various parameters so that quality product reaches the clients. Hence, we are one of the proficient&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva; font-size: small;\">Manufacturers and Suppliers of Women Sildenafil Citrate 50mg Tablets from India.</strong></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2020-01-24 01:06:48', '2020-08-26 13:10:46', NULL, 'sildenafil citrate 50mg, Ladygra 50mg -women\'s health products', 'Buy sildenafil citrate 50mg , sildenafil citrate 50mg for women, erectile dysfunction products online, Women\'s Health pills', 'RSM Enterprises is the manufacturers of ed products like sildenafil citrate 50mg, Sildenafil Citrate 50mg, vardenafil , tadalfil and herbal products like many more..', 1, 0, NULL, NULL),
(158, '--', 'Zhewitra (Vardenafil Oral Jelly)', 'vardenafil-oral-jelly-49', 'vJj5IupXvNQN4dGEV2VbLMyoiV3DmHF4wMk0E93v.jpeg', 'RSM Multilink LLP is involved in manufacturing, exporting and supplying of Vardenafil Oral Jelly. rdenafil Oral Jelly', '<p><strong>RSM Multilink LLP </strong>specializes in manufacturing, exporting, and supplying Vardenafil Oral Jelly, a trusted solution for treating Erectile Dysfunction (ED). This Generic Vardenafil Oral Jelly is specifically designed to help men sustain their erections for longer durations, boosting their performance and endurance. It improves sensual health, which increases satisfaction and intimacy. Available in liquid form, Vardenafil Oral Jelly is an excellent option for individuals, especially older adults, who struggle to swallow tablets. With competitive pricing, our product is highly regarded by clients for its affordability. We proudly lead the market as a key exporter and supplier of Vardenafil Oral Jelly, offering an effective solution for overcoming impotence issues.</p><p><strong>About Vardenafil Oral Jelly (Zhewitra Oral Jelly)</strong></p><p>Vardenafil Oral Jelly is formulated to help men with Erectile Dysfunction achieve and maintain an erection. It is a safe and effective treatment for impotence and conditions related to PDE5 inhibitors. Available in a jelly form, it is much easier to swallow than traditional tablets, making it particularly suitable for older individuals or those with difficulty swallowing pills. The product is available in various flavors, adding to its appeal. However, it is important to note that Vardenafil Oral Jelly is not recommended for use by women or children and does not offer protection against sensually transmitted diseases, including HIV.</p><p><strong>How Vardenafil Oral Jelly Works (Zhewitra Oral Jelly)</strong></p><p><strong>Vardenafil Oral Jelly</strong> should be taken 15 to 30 minutes before engaging in intimate activity or as prescribed by a healthcare professional. The jelly is designed for men who have difficulty swallowing pills. To use, simply place the jelly under your tongue and wait for it to dissolve completely. However, it\'s important to note that consuming the jelly with a high-fat meal may reduce the absorption of the medication, affecting its effectiveness.</p><p><strong>Side Effects of Vardenafil Oral Jelly (Zhewitra Oral Jelly)</strong></p><p>When used according to a doctor\'s guidance, <strong>Vardenafil Oral Jelly</strong> is generally safe. Some users may experience mild side effects such as headaches, facial flushing, upset stomach, nasal congestion, diarrhea, or dizziness. Additionally, vision-related side effects such as heightened sensitivity to light, blurred vision, or trouble distinguishing between blue and green may occur. If any side effects persist or worsen, it is recommended to consult a healthcare provider.</p><p><strong>Precautions Regarding Vardenafil Oral Jelly (Zhewitra Oral Jelly)</strong></p><p><strong>Vardenafil Oral Jelly</strong> should only be used as prescribed by a doctor. It is important not to take this medication without a prescription. Combining Vardenafil Oral Jelly with nitrates or similar medications can be dangerous. To maximize its effectiveness, avoid consuming heavy meals before and after taking the jelly, as this can reduce its ability to promote a longer and stronger erection. Vardenafil Oral Jelly is specifically designed for men, and individuals with conditions such as diabetes, kidney issues, heart disease, high blood pressure, liver disorders, ocular abnormalities, or sickle cell anemia must consult with a doctor before starting treatment.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 01:08:18', '2024-12-13 16:39:13', NULL, 'Buy Online  Vardenafil Oral Jelly (Zhewitra Oral Jelly)', 'oral jelly, vardenafil oral jelly, buy oral jelly, oral jelly,erectile dysfunction products', 'RSM Multilink LLP is the manufacturers and exporters of all types of oral jelly like sildenafil, vardenafil, tadalafil oral jelly and ed pills. These all are used for erectile dysfunction treatment.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(159, '--', 'Tadalafil Oral Jelly (Tadalafil 20mg Oral Jelly)', 'tadalafil-oral-jelly-48', 'jFZR2PLZLPBU3D4ZOjjPsYQOfkU1Sgt2EXclOMDT.jpeg', 'Tadalafil Oral Jelly (Tadalafil 20mg Oral Jelly)', '<p><strong>Tadalafil Oral Jelly (Tadalafil 20mg Oral Jelly): A Convenient Solution for Erectile Dysfunction</strong></p><p><strong>Erectile Dysfunction (ED)</strong>, sometimes known as impotence, affects a large proportion of men worldwide. This disorder is defined by a persistent failure to achieve or sustain an erection sufficient for satisfying sensual action, which is frequently caused by insufficient blood supply to the genital region. Tadalafil Oral Jelly (Tadaga Oral Jelly) is an effective and easy treatment option for men with erectile dysfunction. While it does not cure the illness, it does help men regain the capacity to have full sexual intercourse with greater satisfaction.</p><p><strong>Overview of Tadalafil Oral Jelly (Tadaga Oral Jelly)</strong></p><p><strong>Tadalafil Oral Jelly</strong> is a fast-acting medication specifically designed for the treatment of Erectile Dysfunction in men. Its jelly form makes it easier to consume compared to traditional tablets, making it ideal for older individuals or those with swallowing difficulties. Available in various flavors, it is a popular choice for enhancing the experience of ED treatment. However, it is not suitable for use by women or children and does not offer protection against sensually transmitted diseases, including HIV.</p><p><strong>Mechanism of Action for Tadalafil Oral Jelly:</strong></p><p>Tadalafil Oral Jelly should be taken orally, 15 to 30 minutes before sensual activity, or as directed by a healthcare provider. Designed for men who prefer not to swallow pills, the jelly dissolves quickly in the mouth, offering convenience and discretion. For best results, avoid consuming high-fat meals, as these may reduce the medication\'s effectiveness.</p><p><strong>Potential Side Effects of Tadalafil Oral Jelly:</strong></p><p>Tadalafil Oral Jelly is safe when used as prescribed, but some individuals may experience minor side effects, including:</p><ul><li>Headache</li><li>Flushing</li><li>Stomach upset</li><li>Nasal congestion</li><li>Diarrhea</li><li>Dizziness</li></ul><p>Users might experience temporary vision alterations, such as increased light sensitivity or blurred vision. If you have any serious adverse effects, get medical attention immediately.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Using Tadalafil Oral Jelly:</strong></p><p>To ensure safety, Tadalafil Oral Jelly should only be used under medical supervision. Avoid combining it with nitrate-containing medications, as this can lead to serious complications. Refrain from consuming heavy meals before or after taking the medication, as this may reduce its effectiveness.</p><p>Men with pre-existing health conditions such as diabetes, heart disease, high blood pressure, liver issues, renal disorders, ocular abnormalities, or sickle cell anemia should consult their doctor before starting treatment. <strong>Tadalafil Oral Jelly</strong> is intended exclusively for men, offering them a reliable and convenient solution for improving their sensual health.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 01:09:59', '2024-11-25 13:57:57', NULL, 'Buy Online Tadalafil Oral Jelly (Tadalafil 20mg Oral Jelly) - RSM Multilink LLP', 'tadalafil oral jelly,Buy Cheap Tadalafil Oral Jelly Online, Tadalafil Oral Jelly uses, Buy Tadalafil oral jelly', 'Buy Cheap Tadalafil Oral Jelly (Tadalafil 20mg Oral Jelly) medicine online from RSM Multilink LLP which is easy to use & help to sustain & maintain erection longer time for satisfactory intercourse.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
