(161, NULL, 'Snovitra Power (Dapoxetine 60mg + Vardenafil 40mg)', 'dapoxetine-vardenafil-46', 'kAnUxwWBVEzpWckv8le0E1FBXdZFMabW8nK6wncy.jpeg', 'Snovitra Power (Dapoxetine 60mg + Vardenafil 40mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Snovitra Power 100mg</strong> is a Medicine that is used to treat ED as well as PE in men by making use of <strong>Vardenafil 40mg</strong> that improves libido and sexual function in the penis thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained and <strong>Dapoxetine 60mg</strong> that delays ejaculation. The Medicine is manufactured by <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The Medicine is used in treating ED in men by relaxing the blood vessels around the penis. By improving blood flow to the penis, an erection can be maintained throughout sexual intercourse with an improved libido. Moreover, Medicine is also used to combat the issue of PE in men.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Vardenafil 40mg</strong>, the active component in the Medicine, belongs to a group of PDE5 type 5 inhibitor enzymes. It helps in boosting the blood flow to the penis and improves sexual function and libido of the organ. <strong>Dapoxetine 60mg</strong> is the secondary active component of the Medicine that works to delay PE for men. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consume the dosage advised by the doctor with a low-fat meal and an hour before sensual activity with water to promote dissolution. A high-fat meal can lower the efficacy of the Medicine. Avoid more than 1 dose within a 24-hours duration. Consult your doctor before consuming this Medicine. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; 