(163, NULL, 'Prejac 60 (Dapoxetine 60mg)', 'dapoxetine-60mg-44', 'gjzcfDwc3BLbuIpdU8Hvv3Jp8dHXeZApuNGXRtFj.jpeg', 'Prejac 60 (Dapoxetine 60mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Description</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Prejac 60mg is a powerful Medicine that helps in treating PE in men. It contains the active substance of daPrejacine that is used to treat sexual dysfunction in men. This Medicine is manufactured for RSM Enterprises. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Prejac 60mg helps men to overcome PE. It is used to improve control over ejaculation and increase the time between sexual intercourse and penetration. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Prejac 60mg belongs to the group of selective serotonin reuptake inhibitors (SSRI) and contains Dapoxetine with 60 mg composition. It is useful in disturbing the condition by preventing the persistent occurrence of PE and also creates visible improvement in men. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The recommended dose is 60 mg. Dissolve one tablet into the water with a low-fat meal. Take this Medicine one hour before the sensual activity. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consult your doctor before taking Prejac 60mg if you are allergic or hypersensitive to the active substance Dapoxetine. Ask your physician if you have heart-related or blood pressure problems. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The side effects of Prejac 60mg are headache, diarrhoea, nausea, and dizziness. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Immediately seek your physician\'s help in case of an overdose. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Inform your doctor if you are on vitamins or herbal supplements. Poxet 90mg interacts with monoamine oxidase inhibitors, thioridazine, the anticoagulant warfarin, aspirin, sumatriptan, paroxetine, and venlafaxine.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if you are allergic to Dapoxetine present in Prejac 60mg. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Ask your doctor if you have bipolar disorder, liver disease or bleeding problems. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Keep them out of sight from children. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">It is a prescribed Medicine by the doctor.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 01:17:43', '2023-09-21 09:58:05', NULL, 'Buy Prejac 60 (Dapoxetine 60mg) - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Dapoxetine 60mg, Prejac Tablet, Buy Dapoxetine 60mg', 'Buy Prejac 60mg (Dapoxetine 60mg) tablets from online pharmacy rsmmultilinkllp to cure premature ejaculation i.e. this medication outspreads the ejaculation time of a sensual commotion.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(165, NULL, 'Snovitra Professional (Vardenafil 20mg Professional)', 'vardenafil-professional-42', 'SlY8obEgvk4IFjHKbTrr6yjNHeanjBVxA28fuIrL.png', 'Snovitra Professional (Vardenafil 20mg Professional)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Snovitra Professional 20mg</strong> is a Medicine that is used to treat ED in men by making use of <strong>Vardenafil 20mg</strong> that improves libido and sexual function in the penis thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained. The Medicine is manufactured by RSM Enterprises. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The Medicine is used in treating ED in men by relaxing the blood vessels around the penis. By improving blood flow to the penis, an erection can be maintained throughout sexual intercourse with an improved libido.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Verdenafil 20 mg, the active component in the Medicine, belongs to a group of PDE5 type 5 inhibitor enzymes. It helps in boosting the blood flow to the penis and improves sexual function and libido of the organ. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consume the dosage advised by the doctor with a low-fat meal and about 15 minutes &nbsp;before sensual activity. A high-fat meal can lower the efficacy of the Medicine. Avoid more than 1 dose within a 24-hours duration. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The Medicine should be avoided in the presence of past adverse reactions to vardenafil and does not have any use in preventing sexually transmitted diseases. Alcohol, grapes and tobacco must be avoided when taking the Medicine. In the presence of major health issues such as blood pressure issues and so on, consulting a doctor before consuming the Medicine is advisable.</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The common side effects are headache, dizziness, body pain, facial flushing, nausea or vomiting.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Snovitra Professional 20 mg must be consumed only under the advice of a doctor and not more than once a day. In the event of an overdose, adverse reactions may occur that would require instant medical attention.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 165%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 165%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using alcohol with this Medicine as it can cause adverse reactions. Verdenafil may react with grapefruit leading to unwanted results. Doctor recommendation is a must if using any other Medicine to treat impotence in men. Tobacco must also not be consumed while taking the Medicine as it may cause adverse reactions. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Take the Medicine portion as recommended by the doctor.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using the medication if adversely affected by Verdenafil in the past. </span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if experiencing a bleeding, neurological or heart issue.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">If suffering from a blood pressure issue, abstain from utilising the Medicine.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Keep the Medicine away from children.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 01:22:47', '2023-07-14 10:49:07', NULL, 'Buy Snovitra Professional (Vardenafil 20mg Professional) - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Buy Vardenafil Online, Vardenafil Professional,  buy Vardenafil Professional, erectile dysfunction products,Snovitra  Professional', 'Snovitra Professional (Vardenafil 20mg Professional) is a powerful medication containing Vardenafil as its active ingredient. RSM Multilink LLP provides all ed products at reasonable prices.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(166, NULL, 'Snovitra Super Power (Vardenafil 20mg + Dapoxetine 60mg)', 'vardenafil-dapoxetine-41', 'XcMfBVRuqNsvK8QrLrpcFNAqs4U9fGTgvz6oEePh.jpeg', 'Snovitra Super Power (Vardenafil 20mg + Dapoxetine 60mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Snovitra Super Power</strong> is a Medicine that is used to treat ED in men by making use of <strong>Vardenafil 20mg</strong> in combination with <strong>Dapoxetine 60mg</strong> that improves libido and sexual function, while treating PE in the penis thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained. The Medicine is manufactured by <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The Medicine is used in treating ED along with PE in men by relaxing the blood vessels around the penis. By improving blood flow to the penis, an erection can be maintained throughout sexual intercourse with an improved libido.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Vardenafil 20mg</strong> along with <strong>Dapoxetine 60mg</strong>, the active component in the Medicine, belongs to a group of PDE5 type 5 inhibitor enzymes. It helps in boosting the blood flow to the penis and improves sexual function and libido of the organ while treating PE.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consume the dosage advised by the doctor with a low-fat meal and an hour before sensual activity. A high-fat meal can lower the efficacy of the Medicine. Avoid more than 1 dose within a 24-hours duration.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The Medicine should be avoided in the presence of past adverse reactions to <strong>vardenafil</strong> or <strong>dapoxetine</strong> and does not have any use in preventing sexually transmitted diseases. Alcohol, grapes and tobacco must be avoided when taking the Medicine. In the presence of major health issues such as blood pressure issues and so on, consulting a doctor before consuming the Medicine is advisable.</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The common side effects are headache, dizziness, body pain, facial flushing, nausea or vomiting.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Snovitra Super Power</strong> must be consumed only under the advice of a doctor and not more than once a day. In the event of an overdose, adverse reactions may occur that would require instant medical attention.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 165%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 165%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using alcohol with this Medicine as it can cause adverse reactions. <strong>Vardenafil</strong> may react with grapefruit leading to unwanted results. This Medicine should not be taken by persons who are allergic to nitroglycerin. Doctor recommendation is a must if using any other Medicine to treat impotence in men. Tobacco must also not be consumed while taking the Medicine as it may cause adverse reactions. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Take the Medicine portion as recommended by the doctor.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using the medication if adversely affected by sildenafil in the past. </span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if experiencing a bleeding, neurological or heart issue.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">If suffering from a blood pressure issue, abstain from utilising the Medicine.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Keep the Medicine away from children.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 01:25:32', '2023-07-15 10:34:31', NULL, 'Buy Snovitra Super Power (Vardenafil 20mg + Dapoxetine 60mg) Tablets - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Snovitra Super power tablets, erectile dysfunction pills, buy Snovitra Super power,Vardenafil Tablets,Dapoxetine', 'Snovitra Super Power  is a potent medication manufactured by RSM Multilink LLP. Composed of Vardenafil 20 mg and Dapoxetine 60 mg, it offers a comprehensive solution for male sensual disorders. Order Now', 0, 0, NULL, '');
