iness, diarrhea and dizziness might occur. If these effects persist or worsen, notify your doctor promptly. For person with cardiac problems, the side effects can be severe. Before purchasing any impotence pills at all, it is highly advisable to consult a doctor and let him or her decide, if synthetic drugs are the best treatment for you.</span></span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 01:29:08', '2023-07-18 10:19:20', NULL, 'Buy Online Snovitra Strong (Vardenafil 40mg) Tablets - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Snovitra Strong tablets, Vardenafil 40mg,erectile dysfunction pills, buy Snovitra Strong tablets', 'Snovitra Strong (Vardenafil 40mg) potent PDE5 inhibitor that helps improve erectile function by increasing blood flow to the penis.Today Order Now!!!', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
