(171, '--', 'Tadapox 80mg (Tadalafil 20 mg + Dapoxetine 60 mg)', 'tadalafil-dapoxetine-36', 'uG0y3lV4vrnPP8mV4P3waBXF2BBlu9PFjhKPhfrT.jpeg', 'Tadapox 80mg (Tadalafil 20 mg + Dapoxetine 60 mg)', '<p>With the talent of our competent team,&nbsp;<strong>RSM Multilink LLP </strong>are engaged in&nbsp;Manufacturing, Supplying and Exporting of <strong>Tadapox 80mg (Tadalafil 20 mg + Dapoxetine 60 mg).</strong>Combined with <strong>Dapoxetine</strong> and <strong>Tadalafil</strong> goes to work for typical sexual problems. Dapoxetine-Tadalafil Tablets opens blood vessels within the penis that allows for an erection when the necessary sexual stimulation is applied. It is an oral drug used to treat male impotence. Dapoxetine-Tadalafil Pills are composed from solid composites of Dapoxetine that exhibits high solubility and rate of dissolution. Delivery in time &amp; customer satisfaction is our specialty.</p><p><br><strong>About Dapoxetine and Tadalafil Tablets (Tadapox) :</strong></p><p>The <strong>Dapoxetine 60mg</strong> and <strong>Tadalafil 20mg</strong> Tablet is the highly recommended distinctive solution to get over the problem of premature ejaculation. The main objective of the drug is to delay the process of ejaculation resulting in enhanced sexual pleasures to a man suffering from the problem of pre-ejaculation. But this drug cannot be consumed directly without any prior consultation of your physician. Take doctors advised first if you are beginner <strong>Dapoxetine </strong>and <strong>Tadalafil </strong>consumer and do not try to change dose strength on your own decision.<br><br><strong>How to take Tadapox 80mg (Tadalafil 20 mg + Dapoxetine 60 mg)?</strong></p><p>The Doctor’s suggestion is always advisable before starting to consume this pill. Dapoxetine and Tadalafil is an oral tablet should be consumed with a glass of water for dissolving easily. Overdoses are always restricted and do not need to take this pill on a daily basis. It should be taken once in a day (in an interval of 24 hours). Take this pill one hour prior to love making session. Because it takes time to show effects against sexual dysfunction &amp; premature ejaculation.<br><br><strong>Dapoxetine and Tadalafil Tablets (Tadapox) Precautions :</strong></p><p>These are the precautions to be remembered while taking Dapoxetine and Tadalafil. Dapoxetine and Tadalafil should be used only when your doctor prescribes it for you. Never take it without prescription. It is advisable to take this pill when you don’t have any allergic problem from Sildenafil citrate and Dapoxetine. Try to avoid heavy meal before and after taking this pill otherwise it will lose the power to get harder and longer erection. Nitrates and Dapoxetine and Tadalafil are a very bad match and causes severe health hazards. Only men are liable for using Dapoxetine and Tadalafil.<br><br><strong>Dapoxetine and Tadalafil Tablets (Tadapox) Side Effects :</strong></p><p>Some of the rare side effects of Dapoxetine and Tadalafil are headache, diarrhea, nausea and dizziness. Only few users suffer from these side effects. These side effects are common in those people who consume even other drugs with Dapoxetine and Tadalafil. Increasing the dosage randomly without consulting a physician also may be a cause of the side effects.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 01:34:16', '2024-10-01 16:10:42', NULL, 'Tadapox 80mg (Tadalafil 20 mg + Dapoxetine 60 mg) - RSM Multilink LLP', 'buy online Tadalafil Dapoxetine tablets, buy online tadapox tablet, buy online tadapox pill, online Dapoxetine and Tadalafil Pills, tadalafil dapoxetine tablets, Best price tadalafil dapoxetine tablets', 'Tadapox 80mg (Tadalafil 20 mg + Dapoxetine 60 mg) Tablets online at discounted price for treatment of premature ejaculation at RSM Multilink LLP manufacture & supply all ED medicine online at low cost.', 0, 1, NULL, '');
