size: 12.0000pt;\">The Medicine should be avoided in the presence of past adverse reactions to it and does not have any use in preventing sexually transmitted diseases. Alcohol, grapes and tobacco must be avoided when taking the Medicine. In the presence of major health issues such as blood pressure issues and so on, consulting a doctor before consuming the Medicine is advisable.</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The common side effects are headache, dizziness, body pain, facial flushing, diarrhea, nausea or vomiting.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Tadaga 2.5mg</strong> must be consumed only under the advice of a doctor and not more than once a day. In the event of an overdose, adverse reactions may occur that would require instant medical attention.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 165%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 165%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using alcohol with this Medicine as it can cause adverse reactions. Doctor recommendation and prescription is a must if using any other Medicine to treat impotence in men. Tobacco must also not be consumed while taking the Medicine as it may cause adverse reactions. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Take the Medicine portion as recommended by the doctor.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using the medication if adversely affected by sildenafil in the past. </span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if experiencing a bleeding, neurological or heart issue.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">If suffering from a blood pressure issue, abstain from utilising the Medicine .</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Keep the Medicine away from children.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 02:00:49', '2023-07-01 09:47:18', NULL, 'Buy Tadaga 2.5 (Tadalafil 2.5mg) Tablets - RSM Multilink LLP', 'tadaga 2.5,tadalafil 2.5 mg ,tadalafil 2.5mg manufacturers,tadalfil 2.5 mg\r\nexporters,tadalafil 2.5 mg supplier,tadaga 2.5 manufacturers,tadaga 2.5 suppliers \r\ntadaga 2.5 exporters,buy tadalafil 2.5 mg,online tadalail 2.5 mg,cheap tadalafil \r\n2.5 mg', 'Tadaga 2.5 (Tadalafil 2.5mg) is a medication commonly prescribed for the treatment of impotence (ED) in men. Today Order Now!!!', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(180, NULL, 'Sildigra Soft (Sildenafil Soft Chewable)', 'sildenafil-soft-chewable-27', 'kidBMcJCYF3lT66V2xReORVsXYWiP47EoVde6p7s.png', 'Sildigra Soft (Sildenafil Soft Chewable)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\"><strong>The</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Sildenafil Soft Chewable Tablets that are Manufactured, Exported as well as Supplied</strong>&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>RSM Enterprises</strong>&nbsp;are very popular amidst the clients in the treatment of erectile dysfunction and they don\'t pose any threat to general health due to nil side effects. These Sildenafil Chewable Tablets have very exclusively flavored and have sweet, minty and refreshing taste. It is formulated using high quality extracts and is available in a blister pack of 10 Tablets. Their easy accessibility at affordable prices has made them the first choice in the market.<br /><br /><strong>Some Facts about Sildenafil Soft Chewable Tablets :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Sildenafil Soft Chewable Tablets are used to treat male sexual function problems (impotence or erectile dysfunction) by blocking a certain enzyme (phosphoiesterase-PDES) in the body. In combination with sexual stimulation, Sildenafil Citrate works by helping the blood flow into the penis to achieve and maintain an erection.<br /><br /><strong>How to take Sildenafil Soft Chewable Tablets&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Take Sildenafil Soft Chewable Tablets at least 30 minutes before, but not more than 4 hours before sexual activity (1 hour before is the most effective). While taking Sildenafil Citrate you should avoid meals high in fat. Foods high in fat can slow down the effectiveness of&nbsp; Sildenafil Citrate.<br /><br /><strong>Who should not take Sildenafil Soft Chewable Tablets :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Do not take Sildenafil Soft Chewable Tablets, if either anyone has allergies or taking any form of nitroglycerin or those who have had a heart attack, stroke, severe high or low blood pressure or life threatening heart irregularities. This drug does not protect against sexually transmitted diseases (such as HIV, hepatitis B, gonorrhea, syphilis). Keep in mind, it is not for persons with conditions such as sickle cell anemia, multiple myeloma or leukemia. Seek medical advice with genital deformities such as Peyronie&rsquo;s disease; also if you have a bleeding disorder, peptic ulcer, or retinitis pigmentosa.<br /><br /><strong>Cautions before taking Sildenafil Soft Chewable Tablets :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Sildenafil Soft Chewable Tablets are a prescription medication, one needs share the medical history with a doctor to make sure it is an appropriate treatment. Do not take more than once daily and consult your doctor or pharmacist for more information.<br /><br /><strong>Some side effects of Sildenafil Soft Chewable Tablets :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Sildenafil Soft Chewable Tablets are highly effective pills to treat erectile dysfunction in men, but yet there some rare side effects have been recognized are headaches, stomach upset, diarrhea, flu-like symptoms and nausea, when the pills are overdosed. Before purchasing any impotence pills at all, it is highly advisable to consult a doctor and let him or her decide, if synthetic drugs are the best treatment for you.</span></span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2020-01-24 02:02:28', '2020-08-20 12:33:50', NULL, 'Buy Online Sildigra Soft (Sildenafil Soft Chewable) tablet', 'sildenafil soft chewable,sildenafil soft chewable\r\nmanufacturers,sildenafil soft chewable distributors, Sildenafil UK\r\ncheap sildenafil soft chewable , generic sildenafil soft\r\nchewable, erectile dysfunction pills, RSM enterprises', 'The Sildenafil Soft Chewable Tablets treatment for erectile dysfunction. Sildenafil Chewable Tablets have very exclusively flavored and have sweet, minty and refreshing taste.', 0, 0, NULL, NULL);
