(183, NULL, 'Sildigra Super Active (Sildenafil 100mg Super Active)', 'sildenafil-super-active-24', '35yciqUMb1ROfOnYRuSWCrYQZcbcp2KCWybM94DR.jpeg', 'Sildigra Super Active (Sildenafil 100mg Super Active)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">As we are the most prominent&nbsp;<strong>Suppliers and Exporters</strong>,&nbsp;<strong>RSM Multilink LLP </strong>offers widely used&nbsp;<strong>Sildenafil Super Active (Sildigra super active)</strong>. We manufacture <strong>Sildenafil Super Active</strong> Tablets for smooth muscle relaxation allows increased blood flow into certain areas of the penis, sexual arousal in harsh, prolonged erection for maximum sexual performance. Further, these <strong>Sildenafil Super Active Pills</strong> are also used by sports athletes as they believe that this Viagra is effective for enhancing performance and opening blood vessels, which will enrich muscles.<br /><br /><strong>Some Facts about Sildenafil Super Active (Sildigra super active) :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\"><strong>Sildenafil Super Active</strong> is used to treat male sexual function problems (impotence or erectile dysfunction) by blocking a certain enzyme (phosphoiesterase-PDES) in the body. In combination with sexual stimulation, <strong>Sildenafil Citrate</strong> works by helping the blood flow into the penis to achieve and maintain an erection.<br /><br /><strong>How to take Sildenafil Super Active (Sildigra super active) :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Take <strong>Sildenafil Super Active</strong> at least 30 minutes before, but not more than 4 hours before sexual activity (1 hour before is the most effective). While taking Sildigra super active (Sildenafil) you should avoid meals high in fat. Foods high in fat can slow down the effectiveness of <strong>Sildigra super active</strong> (Sildenafil).<br /><br /><strong>Who should not take Sildenafil Super Active (Sildigra super active) :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Do not take<strong> Sildenafil Super Active</strong>, if either anyone has allergies or taking any form of nitroglycerin or those who have had a heart attack, stroke, severe high or low blood pressure or life threatening heart irregularities. This drug does not protect against sexually transmitted diseases (such as HIV, hepatitis B, gonorrhea, syphilis). Keep in mind, it is not for persons with conditions such as sickle cell anemia, multiple myeloma or leukemia. Seek medical advice with genital deformities such as Peyronie&rsquo;s disease; also if you have a bleeding disorder, peptic ulcer, or retinitis pigmentosa.<br /><br /><strong>Cautions before taking Sildenafil Super Active :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\"><strong>Sildenafil Super Active</strong> is a prescription medication, one needs share the medical history with a doctor to make sure it is an appropriate treatment. Do not take more than once daily and consult your doctor or pharmacist for more information.<br /><br /><strong>Some side effects of Sildenafil Super Active (Sildigra super active) :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\"><strong>Sildenafil Super Active</strong> is highly effective pills to treat <strong>erectile dysfunction</strong> in men, but yet there some rare side effects have been recognized are headaches, stomach upset, diarrhea, flu-like symptoms and nausea, when the pills are overdosed. Before purchasing any impotence pills at all, it is highly advisable to consult a doctor and let him or her decide, if synthetic drugs are the best treatment for you.</span></span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 02:07:43', '2023-05-15 12:07:29', NULL, 'Sildigra Super Active (Sildenafil 100mg)- RSM Multilink LLP', 'sildigra Super Active, Buy sildigra super active, Sildenafil 100mg Super Active', 'Buy Sildigra Super Active (Sildenafil 100mg) at best and affordable price to treat ED in men. Visit rsmmultilink.com to avail discount offers!!!', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(184, 'iUs4OlhtIWLxEjZmBJn5mmLtoMol65tabgQO4Uvznew.webp', 'Sildalist (Sildenafil Citrate 100mg + Tadalafil 20mg)', 'sildenafil-citrate-tadalafil-23', 'iUs4OlhtIWLxEjZmBJn5mmLtoMol65tabgQO4Uvz.jpeg', 'Sildalist (Sildenafil Citrate 100mg + Tadalafil 20mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Sildalist 120mg</strong> is a powerful Medicine that helps in treating ED in men. It contains the active substance of <strong>Sildenafil Citrate 100mg</strong> and <strong>Tadalafil 20mg</strong>, used to treat sexual dysfunction in men. This Medicine is manufactured for <strong>RSM Multilink LLP. </strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Sildalist 120mg</strong> helps men to treat the signs and symptoms of ED(impotence) men. It is used to improve the sensual functioning of the penile area and provide a firm erection.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Sildalist 120mg</strong> helps to smooth the penile muscles and increases the flow of blood around the penis. It works effectively to treat other sensual disorders in men. The erection occurs by increasing bloodstream levels in the genitals. Sildenafil and tadalafil belong to the group of PDE5 inhibitors that helps in strong blood flow, causing the man to achieve a hard erection. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Take one tablet with one glass of water with a low-fat meal. Consume this Medicine 20 minutes to one hour before the sensual activity. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consult your doctor before taking Sildalist 120 mg if you are allergic or hypersensitive to the active substances. Ask your doctor if you have heart-related or blood pressure problems. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The side effects of Sildalist 120 mg are headache, diarrhoea, nausea, blurred vision and dizziness. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Immediately seek your doctor\'s help in case of an overdose. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Inform your physician if you are on vitamins or herbal supplements. <strong>Sildalist 120 mg</strong> interacts with Medicines that contain active elements <strong>Sildenafil Citrate 100mg</strong> and <strong>Tadalafil 20mg</strong>. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if you are allergic to Sildenafil Citrate 100mg and Tadalafil 20mg in Sildalist 120 mg. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Ask your doctor if you have a heart condition.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Keep them out of sight from children.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 02:09:27', '2023-05-19 12:11:28', NULL, 'Buy Sildalist (Sildenafil Citrate 100mg + Tadalafil 20mg) - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Buy Cheap Sildalist Pills Online, buy sildalist pills online, Buy Sildalist online in uk, Buy Cheap Sildalist Pills Online, Buying Cheap Generic Sildalist', 'Buy Sildalist (Sildenafil Citrate 100mg + Tadalafil 20mg) Tablets online to cure most severe problem of ED in men available online at cheap cost in RSM Multilink LLP.', 0, 1, NULL, ''),
(185, NULL, 'Silvitra 120mg (Sildenafil 100mg + Vardenafil 20mg)', 'sildenafil-vardenafil-22', 'X9d7Cu9JaSQAVJi5H4TNlMB1qFE9iJJ46TrKqrla.jpeg', 'Silvitra 120mg (Sildenafil 100mg + Vardenafil 20mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Silvitra 120mg</strong> is a Medicine that is used to treat ED in men by making use of <strong>Sildenafil Citrate 100 mg</strong> along with <strong>Verdenafil 20 mg</strong> that relaxes the blood vessels in the penis and counteracts the hormones in the body that prevent erections, thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained. The Medicine is manufactured by <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The Medicine is used in treating ED, whether psychological or physiological in nature, in men by relaxing the blood vessels and the smooth muscles around the penis. By improving blood flow to the penis, an erection can be maintained throughout sexual intercourse.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Sildenafil citrate 100 mg</strong>, the active component in the Medicine, belongs to a group of PDE5 type 5 inhibitor enzymes. When combined with <strong>Verdenafil 20 mg</strong>, it helps sustain an erection for long periods of time. It also helps in boosting the blood flow to the penis and improves sexual function and libido of the organ. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consume the dosage advised by the doctor with a low-fat meal and an hour before sensual activity. A high-fat meal can lower the efficacy of the Medicine. Avoid more than 1 dose within a 24-hours duration. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The Medicine should be avoided in the presence of past adverse reactions to sildenafil or vardenafil and does not have any use in preventing sexually transmitted diseases. Alcohol, grapes and tobacco must be avoided when taking the Medicine. In the presence of major health issues such as blood pressure issues and so on, consulting a doctor before consuming the Medicine is advisable.</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The common side effects are itching, rash, shortness of breath, and swelling up of the face and lips.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Overdoses should be strictly avoided since too much of the Medicine could create additional issues in the body such as severe backaches, and might require medical attention</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 165%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 165%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using alcohol with this Medicine as it can cause adverse reactions. <strong>Sildenafil</strong> may react with grapefruit leading to unwanted results. Doctor recommendation is a must if using any other Medicine to treat impotence in men. Tobacco must also not be consumed while taking the Medicine as it may cause adverse reactions. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Take the Medicine portion as recommended by the doctor.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using the medication if adversely affected by <strong>sildenafil</strong> in the past. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if experiencing a bleeding or any heart issue.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">If suffering from a blood pressure issue, abstain from utilising the Medicine.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Keep the Medicine away from children.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-24 02:11:32