(195, NULL, 'Vardenafil Super Active 40mg', 'vardenafil-super-active-40mg', 'DIitAa4s3ZOZIaSDO3FXs7KFpAPwnEF7E8nvJoK5.jpeg', 'Vardenafil Super Active 40mg', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Our organization offers a wide range of&nbsp;<strong>Generic Levitra Super Active 40mg</strong>, which helps to increase the blood flow to the penis. Generic Levitra Super Active 40mg Tablets is a prescription medicine that is used to treat erectile dysfunction (ED) and can help you get and keep a quality erection, so that you can make the most of each sexual experience. But the results of the clinical researches conducted as part of the FDA approval process, have shown that Generic Levitra Super Active 40mg Pills start acting more quickly and has a longer effect than Viagra does. We offer these Generic Generic Levitra Super Active 40mg Tablets at nominal price within the committed time delivery. Hence, we are counted among a leading&nbsp;<strong>Manufacturers, Exporters and Suppliers of Generic Levitra Super Active 40mg from India.</strong><br /><br /><strong>Things to Know about Generic Levitra Super Active 40mg :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Generic Levitra Super Active 40mg is useful for treatment of ED (erectile dysfunction) in men. Keeping penis erection for a longer time, these tablets help in attaining utmost pleasure during sexual activity. These generic tablets are safe to use and effectively cure impotence and diseases associated with PDE5 inhibitors. This medicine is not intended for use by women or children. It will not protect against sexually transmitted diseases including HIV infection.<br /><br /><strong>Tips to use Generic Levitra Super Active 40mg :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Generic Levitra Super Active 40mg are taken orally 25 - 60 minutes before sexual activity or as directed by your doctor. Generic Levitra Super Active 40mg come with a patient information booklet that should be read carefully. It works along with sexual stimulation to help achieve an erection. Contact your doctor or pharmacist for more information. This medicine may be taken on an empty stomach or with food. However, taking this medicine with a high-fat meal may reduce the amount of medicine that your body absorbs<br /><br /><strong>Generic Levitra Super Active 40mg 40mg Precautions :</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">Generic Levitra Super Active 40mg is a prescription medication, one need to share the medical history with a doctor to make sure it is an appropriate treatment. Keep in mind, it is not for people who have allergies or taking any form of nitroglycerin or those who have had a heart attack, stroke, severe high or low blood pressure or life threatening heart irregularities. Do not take this medicine more often than once daily and consult your doctor or pharmacist for more information.<br /><br /><strong>Side effects of Generic Levitra Super Active 40mg :</strong></span><br /><br /><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva;\">These are primarily used to treat erectile dysfunction in men, but yet there some rare side effects have been recognized which are Headache, flushing, stomach upset, nasal stuffiness, diarrhea and dizziness might occur. If these effects persist or worsen, notify your doctor promptly. For person with cardiac problems, the side effects can be severe. Before purchasing any impotence pills at all, it is highly advisable to consult a doctor and let him or her decide, if synthetic drugs are the best treatment for you.</span></span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-01-31 01:43:37', '2020-08-20 12:23:17', NULL, 'Vardenafil Super Active 40mg, Snovitra 40 mg', 'Vardenafil Super Active 40mg,Vardenafil Super Active 40mg tablet, Snovitra 40 mg', 'Buy Vardenafil Super Active 40mg i.e. Snovitra 40 mg from rsmenterprises.in curing severe problematical  cases of erectile dysfunction in men at inexpensive rates.', 0, 0, NULL, NULL),
(196, NULL, 'Bluemen 25 (Sildenafil 25mg)', 'blueman-25-sildenafil-25mg', 'zYIO1IbQmTpFMBdO3YLiO2Lmt29Fv4ZOh4v7lPBm.jpeg', 'Bluemen 25 (Sildenafil 25mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Bluemen 25mg</strong> is an effective Medicine for men to achieve proficiency by improving ED. It contains <strong>Sildenafil citrate 25mg</strong> as an active substance to enhance sensual desire and sustain an erection for a prolonged period in men. The manufacturing of the Medicine is done for <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>.</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Bluemen 25mg</strong> is used in treating ED in men by relaxing the smooth muscles around the penis. It enhances the blood flow in the pelvic organs, maintaining an erection required for satisfying sensual activity. </span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Sildenafil citrate 25mg</strong>, an active component in <strong>Bluemen 25mg</strong>, belongs to a group of Phosphodiesterase type 5 inhibitor enzymes. It helps in boosting the blood flow in the penile region to improve overall sensual functioning. Along with working on the desire to achieve a firm erection, this Medicine also promotes overall health in men. </span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consume the usual dosage with a low-fat meal and an hour before sensual activity. A high-fat meal can lower the effect of the Medicine. Avoid overdose within the 24-hours duration. <strong>Bluemen 25mg</strong> holds the erection for more than 4 hours. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">One should avoid <strong>Bluemen 25mg</strong> if sensitive to the active substance <strong>Sildenafil</strong>. It does not help protect one against sexually transmitted diseases. Seek doctor\'s help if suffering from a bleeding disorder, cardiovascular disease, uncontrolled hypertension, kidney or liver disease. Avoid consuming the Medicine with alcohol and grapefruit beverages.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Some of the side effects of <strong>Bluemen 25mg</strong> are headache, dizziness, body pain, facial flushing, nausea or vomiting.</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">In single-dose volunteer studies of doses up to 200 mg, resulting in adverse reactions like headache, flushing, dizziness, dyspepsia, nasal congestion and altered vision. </span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using alcohol with this Medicine as it can cause side effects. <strong>Sildenafil</strong> may react with grapefruit leading to unwanted results. Doctor recommendation is a must if using any other Medicine to treat impotence in men. </span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Take the Medicine portion as recommended by the doctor.</span></li>\r\n<li><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using the medication if adversely affected by sildenafil in the past. </span></li>\r\n<li><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if experiencing a bleeding issue.</span></li>\r\n<li><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">If suffering from a blood pressure issue, abstain from utilising the Medicine.</span></li>\r\n<li><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Keep the Medicine far away from kids around.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-02-05 05:27:40', '2023-05-30 11:45:19', NULL, 'Buy Bluemen 25 (Sildenafil 25mg) Tablets - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Bluemen 25mg,Sildenafil 25mg,Health,HealthCare,Men ED Medicine, RSM Multilink LLP, Generic Viagra 25mg', 'Buy Bluemen 25 Tablets is an efficient medicament that works to treat Erectile Dysfunction in men. It contains an