(200, '--', 'Orliford  (Orlistat) 120mg', 'orliford-120mg', 'XEfdoEwee7ax29hQkpiJQDztNewBenBnWfn0yGok.png', 'Orliford 120 is an ideal solution to deal with obesity. It has an active component of Orlistat 120mg bioequivalent to the dosage. The manufacturing of medicine is done for Banford.', '<p><strong>Orliford 120mg</strong> is a reliable medication designed to combat obesity effectively. Containing the active ingredient <strong>Orlistat 120mg</strong>, this medication is manufactured by Banford and is an excellent choice for individuals struggling with weight-related challenges. By blocking the absorption of fat from consumed food, it helps reduce body fat and improve weight management. Its mechanism of action focuses on breaking down and eliminating excess fat through digestive processes, making it a trusted solution for long-term obesity treatment.</p><p><strong>How Orliford 120mg Works?</strong></p><ul><li>Fat Absorption Prevention: Orliford 120mg blocks the absorption of approximately one-fourth of dietary fat, reducing calorie intake.</li><li>Metabolism Boost: The medication improves metabolic efficiency, enhancing the body’s ability to process fats effectively.</li><li>Lifestyle Integration: To achieve optimal results, Orliford should be paired with a calorie-controlled diet, regular physical activity, and a healthy routine.</li></ul><p><strong>How to Use Orlistat 120mg (Orliford 120mg)?</strong></p><ul><li>Dosage Instructions: Take one capsule three times daily before meals. For maximum benefit, consume the capsule within an hour before eating.</li><li>Balanced Diet: Incorporate a well-balanced, low-fat diet to ensure the effectiveness of the medication.</li><li>Vitamin Absorption: Since the medicine reduces fat absorption, essential vitamins may also be affected. Consider a multivitamin supplement as advised by your doctor.</li><li>Missed Dose: If you skip a meal, you can skip the corresponding dose to avoid unnecessary medication.</li></ul><p><strong>Side Effects of Orlistat 120mg (Orliford 120mg)</strong></p><p>While Orliford 120mg is effective, some individuals may experience mild to moderate side effects, including:</p><ul><li>Oily spotting on clothing</li><li>Loose or fatty stools</li><li>Frequent bowel movements</li><li>Abdominal discomfort or stomach pain</li><li>Irregular menstrual cycles</li><li>Headache or anxiety</li></ul><p>In rare cases, side effects may persist. Seek medical attention promptly if symptoms worsen or do not resolve.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Orlistat 120mg (Orliford 120mg)</strong></p><ul><li>Medical Supervision: Consult a healthcare provider before starting Orliford 120mg to ensure it is suitable for your health condition.</li><li>Health Conditions: Avoid this medication if you have metabolic disorders, low thyroid function, or digestive issues.</li><li>Pregnancy: Orliford 120mg is not recommended for pregnant women as it may affect fetal health.</li><li>Allergies: Inform your doctor about any allergies or previous reactions to Orlistat or similar medications.</li></ul><p><strong>Why Choose Orliford 120mg?</strong></p><p><strong>Orliford 120mg</strong> is a trusted choice for individuals seeking an effective and long-term solution for obesity. By integrating this medication with a healthy lifestyle, you can achieve sustainable weight loss and improved overall well-being. With proper guidance and adherence to prescribed usage, the medication empowers users to take control of their weight and lead healthier lives.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-02-11 05:06:17', '2024-11-29 10:10:48', NULL, NULL, 'Orliford 120 is an ideal solution to deal with obesity. It has an active component of Orliford 120mg bioequivalent to the dosage. The manufacturing of medicine is done for Banford.', 'Orliford 120 is an ideal solution to deal with obesity. It has an active component of Orliford 120mg bioequivalent to the dosage. The manufacturing of medicine is done for Banford.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
