pt;\">Consult your doctor before taking <strong>Pink Lady 100</strong> if you are allergic to the active substance <strong>Sildenafil Citrate</strong>. Ask your doctor if having cardiovascular or heart issues, hypertension or kidney or either liver problem. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The side effects of <strong>Pink Lady 100</strong> are stomach pain, headache, dizziness, facial flushing, chest pain, and nausea. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not overdose on it as it can have an unwanted outcome on your health. &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Pink Lady 100</strong> interacts with Medicine that contains organic nitrates. It also interacts with Medicines used to treat HIV infection, fungal infection, vision problems, heart stroke, kidney or liver diseases. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if you are allergic to <strong>Sildenafil Citrate</strong> or any active elements present in <strong>Pink Lady 100</strong>. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Ask your doctor if you have a kidney or liver disorder. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Keep them safe from children. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">It does not prevent one from sexually transmitted diseases. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not take this Medicine if you are taking Nitrate in any form.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-02-11 05:21:26', '2023-06-08 12:10:47', NULL, 'Buy Pink Lady 100 (Female Sildenafil Citrate 100mg) - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Pink Lady 100mg,Sildenafil 100mg,Female Generic Viagra 100mg,Female Sildenafil 100mg,Female Pink Lady 100mg,Female Health,', 'Pink Lady 100 (Female Sildenafil Citrate 100mg) is a potent Medicine that helps to work on sensual disorders in women. Visit rsmmultilink.com for more info!!!', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(202, '--', 'Orlijohn (Orlistat USP) Capsule 120', 'orlistat-capsule-120', '3WkwNOpb83w3J3kYCvBVWEzB72Cd6DwYHkbhRhRC.png', 'Orlijohn 120 is a long term medicine effective in managing weight loss. It has an active component of Orlistat USP 120mg.', '<p><strong>Orlijohn 120</strong>, developed by Johnlee Pharmaceuticals Pvt. Ltd., is a highly effective long-term medication designed to aid in weight management. Each capsule contains <strong>Orlistat 120mg</strong>, a proven active ingredient that helps reduce appetite and promotes weight loss. The medicine works by interfering with the body\'s ability to absorb specific nutrients, thereby lowering caloric intake and aiding in the treatment of obesity.</p><p><strong>Key Benefits of Orlijohn 120:</strong></p><p><strong>Appetite Suppression</strong>: Expands in the stomach to create a feeling of fullness.</p><p><strong>Reduced Nutrient Absorption</strong>: Inhibits fat digestion, lowering calorie absorption.</p><p><strong>Weight Loss Support</strong>: A trusted anti-obesity medication that helps reduce excess weight.</p><p><strong>How to Use Orlijohn 120 (Orlistat USP Capsules 120mg)?</strong></p><p>For optimal results, follow these guidelines:</p><p><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong>: Orlijohn 120 inhibits pancreatic lipase enzymes, reducing fat absorption from the diet.</p><p><strong>Prescription Use</strong>: Available only with a doctor\'s prescription, ensuring safety and effectiveness.</p><p><strong>Usage</strong>: Designed to assist individuals with obesity or elevated BMI levels by breaking down triglycerides in the intestine.</p><p>Dietary Adjustments: Incorporate a low-fat diet to minimize side effects and enhance the benefits.</p><p><strong>Possible Side Effects of Orlijohn 120:</strong></p><p><strong>Although effective, some users may experience side effects, primarily gastrointestinal-related issues:</strong></p><ul><li>Increased or urgent bowel movements</li><li>Difficulty controlling stool</li><li>Abdominal pain or discomfort</li><li>Headache, nervousness, or restlessness</li></ul><p><strong>To reduce side effects, maintain a low-fat, calorie-restricted diet during use.</strong></p><p><strong>Precautions While Using Orlijohn 120:</strong></p><p>For safe and effective usage, consider the following precautions:</p><p><strong>Medical Supervision</strong>: Use only under a doctor’s guidance to ensure proper dosage and safety.</p><p><strong>Dietary Consistency</strong>: Avoid taking the medication if not consuming a fat-containing meal.</p><p><strong>Pregnancy and Breastfeeding</strong>: Not recommended during these periods due to potential risks.</p><p><strong>Inactive Components</strong>: Be aware of possible allergic reactions to inactive ingredients in the capsules.</p><p><strong>Lifestyle Changes</strong>: Incorporate regular physical activity and a balanced diet to maximize results.</p><p><strong>Why Choose Orlijohn 120?</strong></p><p><strong>Orlijohn 120</strong> is a reliable choice for individuals seeking to manage obesity and achieve sustainable weight loss. With its ability to reduce calorie absorption and suppress appetite, this medication is an excellent addition to a comprehensive weight-loss plan involving a balanced diet and regular exercise.</p><p>Take the step towards a healthier lifestyle with <strong>Orlijohn 120</strong>—a trusted partner in your weight management journey.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-02-13 10:09:58', '2024-12-12 14:10:53', NULL, 'Orlijohn 120: Effective Weight Loss Solution with Orlistat 120mg', NULL, 'Orlijohn 120, developed by Johnlee Pharmaceuticals Pvt. Ltd., is a highly effective long-term medication designed to aid in weight management.', 0, 0, 'Orlijohn 120,Orlistat USP Capsules 120mg', ''),
(203, '--', 'Orlijohn (Orlistat USP 60mg) Capsules', 'orlijohn-orlistat-usp-60mg-capsules', 'OMk3xrXp90BtQrDetfazoHCrsEUwxUUTx9hP7zq4.png', 'Orlihohn 60 is an effective medicine in resolving weight issues or obesity. It contains an active component of Orlistat 60mg. The manufacturing of the medicine is done for Johnlee Pharmaceuticals Pvt. Ltd.', '<p><strong>Orlijohn 60mg: An Effective Solution for Weight Management</strong></p><p><strong>Orlijohn 60mg</strong> is a trusted medication designed to address obesity and weight management issues effectively. The active ingredient in this medicine is Orlistat 60mg, a clinically proven compound that inhibits fat absorption from the diet. By promoting weight loss, it supports lifestyle improvements such as reduced blood pressure and enhanced metabolic health. With strict adherence to quality standards, this prescription medication offers reliable results for individuals aiming to achieve and maintain a healthy weight.</p><p><strong>How to Use Orlijohn 60mg (Orlistat Capsules)?</strong></p><ul><li>Weight Loss Benefits: Orlijohn 60mg is effective in managing weight loss by reducing fat absorption and controlling appetite.</li><li>Individualized Treatment: The medication works best when paired with a low-fat, calorie-controlled diet and regular physical activity.</li><li>Dosage: Take Orlijohn 60mg as prescribed by your healthcare provider. It is essential to follow a consistent routine to maximize its benefits.</li><li>Promotes Metabolism: By improving metabolism and aiding fat reduction, Orlijohn helps maintain long-term weight control.</li></ul><p><strong>Side Effects of Orlijohn 60mg</strong></p><p>While <strong>Orlijohn 60mg </strong>is generally well-tolerated, some individuals may experience side effects. These include:</p><ul><li>Oily or loose stools</li><li>Frequent bowel movements</li><li>Abdominal discomfort</li><li>Oily spots on clothing</li></ul><p>To minimize these side effects, it is advisable to avoid consuming high-fat meals while taking the medication. Maintaining a balanced, low-fat diet can significantly reduce unpleasant digestive issues.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Orlijohn 60mg (Orlistat Capsules):</strong></p><p>Before starting <strong>Orlijohn 60mg</strong>, consider the following precautions:</p><ul><li>Allergies: Inform your doctor if you are allergic to Orlistat or any other components of the medication.</li><li>Health Conditions: Avoid using this medicine if you have a history of eating disorders (e.g., anorexia nervosa), diabetes, kidney stones, or thyroid issues.</li><li>Medical Interactions: If you are on immune-suppressing medications, ensure a gap of at least two hours before or after taking Orlijohn.</li><li>Medical Supervision: Regular monitoring and consultation with your healthcare provider are crucial for safe and effective treatment.</li></ul><p><strong>Why Choose Orlijohn 60mg for Weight Management?</strong></p><p><strong>Orlijohn 60mg</strong> is an innovative solution for individuals struggling with obesity. By combining fat reduction with metabolic improvements, it supports long-term weight control and overall health. With proper medical guidance, lifestyle adjustments, and consistent use, Orlijohn 60mg can help you achieve your weight loss goals while promoting a healthier and more active life.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-02-14 07:06:04', '2024-11-29 10:05:31', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Orlistat Capsules 60mg', ''),
(204, '--', 'Orligal 120 (Orlistat USP 120mg)', 'orligal-120-orlistat-usp-120mg', 'kxcfRzKAWd2fTmFGCcaX7OqJIS4Xe0IRzR1BhVcN.png', 'Orligal 120 is a medicine that helps one to reduce weight in over-weighted people. It contains an active component of Orlistat USP 120mg. The manufacturing of the medicine is done for Signature.', '<p><strong>Orligal 120 (Orlistat USP 120mg)</strong></p><p><strong>Orligal 120mg </strong>is a clinically proven medication designed to aid in weight reduction for individuals struggling with obesity or a high Body Mass Index (BMI). The active ingredient, Orlistat USP 120mg, works by blocking enzymes in the intestines, reducing fat absorption by more than one-third. The unabsorbed fat is then eliminated from the body through bowel movements. This medication is most effective when combined with a calorie-controlled diet and regular physical activity. Orligal 120mg is intended exclusively for adults and supports healthy weight loss, leading to improved overall well-being.</p><p><strong>How Orligal 120mg (Orlistat USP 120mg) Works?</strong></p><p>Orligal 120mg targets fat metabolism by preventing the breakdown and absorption of dietary fat in the intestines. This mechanism not only helps in shedding excess weight but also promotes fat elimination through natural bodily processes. The medication is particularly suitable for individuals with obesity-related health issues or a BMI exceeding recommended levels. By complementing a reduced-calorie diet, Orligal enhances the weight-loss process, paving the way for better metabolic health.</p><p><strong>How to Use Orligal 120mg Capsules?</strong></p><p>Who Should Use It: <strong>Orligal 120mg </strong>is designed for adults with a high BMI or those classified as overweight.</p><p><strong>Dosage</strong>: Take the capsule as directed by a healthcare professional, typically with each main meal containing fat.</p><p><strong>Lifestyle Changes</strong>: For best results, pair Orligal with a balanced, calorie-controlled diet and consistent physical activity.</p><p><strong>Important Note</strong>: Orligal is not intended for individuals with normal or underweight BMI levels.</p><p><strong>Side Effects of Orligal 120mg:</strong></p><p>Although Orligal 120mg is generally well-tolerated, some users may experience mild side effects, particularly affecting the digestive system. These include:</p><ul><li>Headaches</li><li>Abdominal discomfort</li><li>Oily or loose stools</li><li>Increased frequency of bowel movements</li><li>Low blood sugar levels</li><li>Dental issues</li></ul><p>To minimize side effects, avoid consuming high-fat meals while using the medication.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Using Orligal 120mg Capsules:</strong></p><p>Allergic Reactions: Avoid Orligal if you are sensitive to Orlistat or its components.</p><p>Pre-existing Conditions: Individuals with eating disorders, low metabolism, or normal/underweight BMI should not use this medication.</p><p>Medication Interactions: Combining Orligal with other medications may cause adverse effects such as high blood pressure or cholesterol.</p><p>Monitoring: Regularly check your BMI levels while using Orligal to ensure safe and effective results.</p><p><strong>Why Choose Orligal 120mg?</strong></p><p>Orligal 120mg offers a comprehensive approach to weight loss by targeting fat absorption and promoting natural elimination. Backed by its clinically proven formula, this medication serves as an effective tool for adults seeking a healthier lifestyle. By combining Orligal with proper dietary habits and exercise, users can achieve sustainable weight loss and enhance their overall health.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-02-15 06:39:25', '2024-11-29 10:09:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(205, NULL, 'Aurogra 100  (Sildenafil citrate 100mg)', 'aurogra-100', 'QOPYwC9hK7WKUgPld7xdsExGtdOXQuJ043whkuAU.jpeg', 'Aurogra 100  (Sildenafil citrate 100mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Aurogra 100mg</strong> is an oral medication that helps in treating ED in men. It is an inability in men to achieve a penile erection for satisfactory sexual activity. It comes with an active ingredient, <strong>Sildenafil Citrate</strong>, which helps in increasing the blood flow around private organs in men. <strong>Sildenafil Citrate</strong> belongs to a class of medications called &nbsp;inhibitors. It is manufactured for Aurochem Laboratories. The manufacturing of <strong>Aurogra 100mg</strong> is done for Aurochem Laboratories.</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Aurogra 100mg</strong> Medicine helps men with impotence or ED. It is one of the well-known therapy for sensual disorders. It also helps in treating high blood pressure in the lungs.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The mechanism of <strong>Aurogra</strong> is similar to that of <strong>Viagra</strong> as <strong>Sildenafil citrate</strong> is the same ingredient in both of them. PDE5 plays an important role in restricting the flow of blood in the pelvic region and repairs the blood provision pattern.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consume <strong>Aurogra</strong> 30 minutes before the sensual desire for the best results. Avoid taking this Medicine with high-fat food as it may cause unwanted side effects. It is advised to take one pill only in 24 hours with one glass of water.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">If a person has allergic reactions to an active substance in <strong>Aurogra 100mg</strong>, avoid consuming this Medicine. Have a word with your doctor if suffering from hypertension, arrhythmia, blood vessel diseases, cardiac problems, and leukaemia. Consult your healthcare provider before combining other medication with <strong>Aurogra 100mg</strong>.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Some of the side effects of <strong>Aurogra 100mg</strong> are skin irritation, change in hearing, flushing of the face and cheeks, breathlessness, painful erection, and swelling in the lips.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">An overdose of <strong>Aurogra 100mg</strong> in 24 hours can trigger side effects like dizziness, stomach upset, sensitivity to light, prolonged erection, blood pressure, and nausea.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Aurogra 100mg</strong> may interact with riociguat. Do not use <strong>sildenafil</strong> with Medicines having nitrates as it can cause a drop in blood pressure. As a result, it leads to dizziness, fainting and stroke in rare cases. Avoid consuming this Medicine with other Medicines to treat high blood pressure and chest pain.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consult your doctor if you are having a health condition like high pressure, diabetes and heart problems. It can worsen your situation if you continue to do so.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not participate in activities that require alertness post consumption of this Medicine.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">It does not prevent sexually transmitted disease or unwanted pregnancies.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Abstain consuming alcohol or grapefruit beverages.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 