(206, NULL, 'Snovitra 10 (Vardenafil 10mg)', 'snovitra-10-vardenafil-10mg', 'YeuzveUiSK6TFGJ1JJXoICUTD4ZMYbTQqsKWTo5k.jpeg', 'Snovitra 10 (Vardenafil 10mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Snovitra 10mg</strong> is a Medicine that is used to treat ED in men by making use of <strong>Vardenafil 10mg</strong> that improves libido and sexual function in the penis thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained. The Medicine is manufactured by <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The Medicine is used in treating ED in men by relaxing the blood vessels around the penis. By improving blood flow to the penis, an erection can be maintained throughout sexual intercourse with an improved libido.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Vardenafil 10mg</strong>, the active component in the Medicine, belongs to a group of PDE5 type 5 inhibitor enzymes. It helps in boosting the blood flow to the penis and improves sexual function and libido of the organ. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consume the dosage advised by the doctor with a low-fat meal and an hour before sensual activity. A high-fat meal can lower the efficacy of the Medicine. Avoid more than 1 dose within a 24-hours duration. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The Medicine should be avoided in the presence of past adverse reactions to vardenafil and does not have any use in preventing sexually transmitted diseases. Alcohol, grapes and tobacco must be avoided when taking the Medicine. In the presence of major health issues such as blood pressure issues and so on, consulting a doctor before consuming the Medicine is advisable.</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The common side effects are headache, dizziness, body pain, facial flushing, nausea or vomiting.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Snovitra 10mg</strong> must be consumed only under the advice of a doctor and not more than once a day. In the event of an overdose, adverse reactions may occur that would require instant medical attention.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 165%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 165%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using alcohol with this Medicine as it can cause adverse reactions. <strong>Verdenafil</strong> may react with grapefruit leading to unwanted results. Doctor recommendation is a must if using any other Medicine to treat impotence in men. Tobacco must also not be consumed while taking the Medicine as it may cause adverse reactions. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Take the Medicine portion as recommended by the doctor</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using the medication if adversely affected by Verdenafil in the pasT</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if experiencing a bleeding, neurological or heart issue.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">If suffering from a blood pressure issue, abstain from utilising the Medicine</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Keep the Medicine away from children.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-02-19 05:01:26', '2023-07-20 10:20:02', NULL, 'Buy Online Snovitra 10mg (Vardenafil 10mg) - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Snovitra 10mg,Vardenafil 10mg,RSM Multilink LLP, Health, Health, EDMedicine', 'Snovitra 10mg is a reliable medication offered by RSM Multilink LLP. It contains Vardenafil 10 mg, known for its effectiveness in treating impotence. Order Now!!!', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(207, 'dack6klIBbwfSCgNFHrmYtEjhiNSq4T6G8FgDhrE-new.webp', 'Labedra (Vardenafil 20mg)', 'labedra-vardenafil-20mg', 'dack6klIBbwfSCgNFHrmYtEjhiNSq4T6G8FgDhrE.jpeg', 'Labedra (Vardenafil 20mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\"><strong>Labedra 20mg</strong>&nbsp;helps to treat the chronic&nbsp;condition of ED in men. It contains the active substance of <strong>Vardenafil 20mg.</strong> It works by increasing the blood flow around the penis, enhancing sensual capability in men. This Medicine is manufactured for <strong>RSM Multilink LLP.</strong></span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\"><strong>Labedra 20mg</strong> helps in treating ED in men, which is an inability to maintain a firm erection for a longer duration. The oral element belongs to a group of Medicines called PDE5 inhibitors.</span></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\"><strong>Labedra 20 mg</strong> contains <strong>Vardenafil 20mg</strong>, which acts by hindering PDE-5 and enhancing cGMP levels in the penis. It boosts the overall sensual ability in men. It releases nitroglycerin in the body that increases the blood flow in the penis. It is one of the popular remedies for treating erection problems in men.</span></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Consume one dose of <strong>Labedra 20 mg</strong> one hour before the sensual activity. Avoid large or high-meal for the best outcome. Try not to break the tablet. Swallow with a glass of water.</span></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Consult your physician before taking this Medicine. Consult the doctor if you have heart issues, kidney or liver irregularities, cardiovascular issues, neurological disorders and hypertension.</span></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">The side effects of <strong>Labedra 20mg</strong>&nbsp;are headache, dizziness, facial flushing, and nausea.</span></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Taking an excess dosage or double dose can have harmful effects on the health, like a severe erection for a long time.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\"><strong>Labedra 20 mg</strong> interacts with any Medicine that contains nitrate ingredients, alpha-blockers, PDE5 inhibitors, and vasodilators.</span></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></h4>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; font-size: 14pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></h4>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Do not consume if you are allergic to <strong>Vardenafil 20mg</strong> or any active elements present in <strong>Labedra 20 mg.</strong></span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Ask your doctor if you have cardiovascular problems, hypertension, neurological problems, heart or liver problems.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Keep them out of sight from children.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Abstain consuming it with alcohol, tobacco and grapefruit beverages.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-weight: normal; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></h4>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2020-02-25 05:01:04', '2024-01-25 11:41:09', NULL, 'Buy Online Labedra (Vardenafil 20mg) Tablets - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Buy Labedra 20mg,Purchase Online Vardenafil 20mg,Vardenafil 20mg,Health,HealthCare,MensHealth,RSM Multilink LLP', 'Labedra (Vardenafil 20mg) helps to treat the condition of ED in men. It works by increasing the blood flow around the penis, enhancing sensual capability in men. This Medicine is manufactured for RSM Multilink LLP.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
