(212, 'b61Xid0WWZDMFkWDwZNblxNUGBaiyDncZcKzAnMv.webp', 'Sildigra 75mg (Sildenafil 75 mg)', 'sildigra-75', 'b61Xid0WWZDMFkWDwZNblxNUGBaiyDncZcKzAnMv.jpeg', 'Sildigra 75mg (Sildenafil 75 mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Sildigra 75mg</strong> is a generic oral Medicine, used majorly for treating ED in male patients. It has an active component, <strong>Sildenafil citrate 75mg</strong>, to enhance capability in men to sustain the desired erection for satisfactory sensuous activity. <strong>Sildigra 75mg</strong> helps in endurance by accomplishing adequate desire in men to participate in sensual activity. It also helps in improving pulmonary arterial hypertension. The manufacturing of <strong>Sildigra 75mg</strong> is done for <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Sildigra 75mg</strong> helps men to treat the signs and symptoms of ED in men. It is used to improve the ability of an adult individual to attain or maintain a firm erection.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Sildenafil citrate (75mg)</strong> is the main constituent of <strong>Sildigra 75mg</strong> Medicine, and it is useful in treating ED in men and other health disorders. It blocks the enzymes and increases the cGMP levels in the body. Sildenafil citrate relaxes the muscles and enhances the blood flow to improve the overall ability to sustain the erection. The enhanced blood flow helps the man keep an enlarged and firm state of the male organ during sensual activity.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Take the dosage of <strong>Sildigra 75mg</strong> as recommended by the doctor. For effective results, avoid taking a single dose with a high-fat meal. A high-fat meal may prolong the time before it starts working on the body. Utilize this Medicine 30-40 minutes before the act. Typically, the impact of this Medicine stays active for 3-4 hours. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><st