es\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Tadalis belongs to a group of Phosphodiesterase type 5 inhibitor enzymes. It helps in boosting the blood flow in the penile region to improve overall sensual functioning. Along with working on the desire to achieve a firm erection, this Medicine also promotes overall health in men.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Dosing information:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Tadalis should be taken with a plain glass of water&nbsp;an hour before sensual activity.&nbsp;It is advised to take once in 24 hours.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\"><strong>Treatment</strong>:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">It does not help protect one against sexually transmitted diseases. It helps in increasing blood flow in the male private organ and produces a firm erection for satisfactory results.&nbsp;Stimulation will be required to develop an erection.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNo