e course.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">This Medicine does not treat one to prevent any STDs.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Abstain from consuming this Medicine if an individual had a stroke&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-07-30 11:04:46', '2023-07-06 10:06:28', NULL, 'Buy Online Tadalis SX 20 (Tadalafil 20mg) Tablets - RSM Multilink LLP', 'TadalisSX20mg,Buy Tadalafil20mg,Health,HealthCare,MensHealth,RSMMultilinkLLP', 'Tadalis SX 20 (Tadalafil 20mg) helps in ED. Consuming this Medicine helps men to have a satisfying sensual lovemaking session with an erection that lasts longer.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(219, NULL, 'Apcalis SX Jelly (Tadalafil 20mg)', 'apcalis-sx-jelly-tadalafil-20mg', '6yeyl6n2f1MGmvmp2oBQh82juyUAA0CB8OPi4WhD.jpeg', 'Apcalis SX Jelly (Tadalafil 20mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Apcalis Sx Jelly</strong> is useful Medicine in treating ED in men. It comes with an active substance, <strong>Tadalafil</strong>, to keep an erection for a continued period. <strong>Tadalafil</strong> belongs to a group of medications called PDE5 inhibitors. Its manufacturing is done for <strong>Ajanta Pharma Ltd</strong>.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Apcalis Sx Jelly</strong> works in treating the stamina of impotence in men by maintaining the hardness by supplying a sufficient amount of blood to the pelvic region. It increases the blood flow to the penis during sexual penetration. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Apcalis Sx Jelly</strong> contains an active component, <strong>Tadalafil 20mg</strong>, enhancing the hardness of the male sexual organ during sensual stimulation. It starts to act about 20 minutes after applying the jelly and lasts for up to 36 hours. It allows the user to choose the right time to enjoy the act with a high-quality and stable erection.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Each sachet of <strong>Apcalis Sx Jelly</strong> has to be taken 30 minutes before the sexual act. It works best if the man is sexually excited, which works as a catalyst for the jelly.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">One should consult the doctor if they are allergic to the active substance <strong>Tadalafil</strong> as it contains inactive ingredients, which can cause allergic reactions in the body. Seek your doctor\'s help if you have any medical history of chest pain, high or low blood pressure, heart problem, or any other severe health issues in the last six months. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Some of the side effects of <strong>Apcalis Oral Jelly 20mg</strong> are headache, flushing of the face and cheeks, nausea, and irritation of the eyes. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">An overdose of <strong>Apcalis Oral Jelly</strong> can trigger reactions like Rash on the skin, itching, urticaria, weakness, chest pain, respiratory diseases, fever, dizziness, etc. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Tadalafil can cause a drop in blood pressure if consumed with nitrates. Do not consume this jelly with Medicines used to treat chest pain, such as isosorbide or Medicines containing amyl. Some of the Medicines that can remove the effect of Tadalafil are azole antifungals, HIV protease inhibitors, and Hepatitis C protease inhibitors. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consult your doctor if you are allergic to Tadalafil. &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid driving any vehicles as it causes sleepiness. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if you have any heart disease.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Inform your doctor if you are using any kind of medication for the past six months. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Limit beverages that contain alcohol as it will make you feel dizzy.</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-07-30 11:31:18', '2023-07-07 10:32:59', NULL, 'Buy Online Apcalis SX Jelly (Tadalafil 20mg) Online Cheap Price - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Apcalis SX Jelly, Tadalafil Oral Jelly, Generic Cialis Jelly, Health, HealthCare, Mens Health, ED Medicine, RSM Multilink LLP', 'Apcalis Sx Jelly is useful Medicine in treating ED in men. It comes with an active substance, Tadalafil, to keep an erection for a continued period. Order Now!!', 0, 0, NULL, '');
