(222, '--', 'Herbal Penon Cream', 'herbal-penon-cream', 'fmOrLPjO04QsX3GIbd3tXkvid9kXOIhmeuYPuJiy.png', 'Herbal Penon cream is an effective and advanced solution to help resolve the problem of erectile difficulties in an adult individual. The cream is easy to use and powerful that comes with herbal components. The manufacturing of the cream is done for Sunrise Remedies Pvt Ltd.', '<p><strong>Herbal Penon Cream: A Natural Solution for Erectile Wellness</strong></p><p><strong>Herbal Penon Cream</strong> is an innovative herbal formula designed to address erectile difficulties in adult men. Developed by Sunrise Remedies Pvt. Ltd., this easy-to-use cream features powerful herbal ingredients to promote male organ enhancement and effectively manage erectile dysfunction. With its ability to support firm erections, the cream offers a path to satisfying intimate experiences.</p><p><strong>Benefits of Herbal Penon Cream:</strong></p><p>The cream provides a comprehensive solution for improving penile strength and enhancing overall sensual performance:</p><p><strong>Enhanced Blood Flow:</strong> Promotes relaxation of blood vessels, improving circulation to the male organ.</p><p><strong>Erection Sustainability: </strong>Helps achieve and maintain firm erections for improved intimacy.</p><p><strong>Improved Sensual Drive</strong>: Revitalizes lost sensual energy and performance.</p><p><strong>Effective for Early Ejaculation</strong>: Supports longer-lasting results by addressing poor erections or premature ejaculation.</p><p><strong>How to Use Herbal Penon Cream?</strong></p><p><strong>Proper application ensures maximum benefits:</strong></p><p><strong>Preparation</strong>: Clean the genital area thoroughly with lukewarm water and mild soap. Pat dry completely.</p><p><strong>Application</strong>: Apply a pea-sized amount of cream to the male organ.</p><p><strong>Frequency</strong>: Use twice daily, maintaining a 24-hour interval between applications.</p><p><strong>Consistency</strong>: Regular use ensures strong, long-lasting results.</p><p><strong>Precautions for Herbal Penon Cream:</strong></p><p>To ensure safe and effective use, follow these precautions:</p><p><strong>Allergy Awareness</strong>: Avoid using the cream if you are allergic to any of its ingredients.</p><p><strong>Irritation</strong>: Discontinue use and seek medical advice if redness, irritation, or inflammation occurs.</p><p><strong>Missed Application</strong>: Skip the missed application if it’s close to the next scheduled use.</p><p><strong>Avoid Supplements</strong>: Do not combine with other supplements or products unless recommended by a healthcare provider.</p><p><strong>Possible Side Effects of Herbal Penon Cream:</strong></p><p>Overuse or improper application may lead to:</p><ul><li>Redness or irritation</li><li>Skin inflammation or rashes</li><li>Dryness around the application area</li></ul><p><strong>If side effects persist or worsen, consult a healthcare professional promptly.</strong></p><p><strong>Why Choose Herbal Penon Cream?</strong></p><p>Herbal Formulation: Natural and safe ingredients for effective results.</p><p>Convenient Application: Easy-to-use cream designed for external application.</p><p>Enhanced Sensual Wellness: Supports improved erections and overall intimate satisfaction.</p><p>Rediscover confidence and intimacy with <strong>Herbal Penon Cream</strong>, a trusted choice for natural male enhancement and erectile support.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-08-01 09:23:59', '2024-12-12 14:11:57', NULL, 'Buy Online HERBAL PENON CREAM with Uses & Dosage', 'HERBAL PENON CREAM', 'For effective results in ED issues, buy online herbal Penon cream at low price. The cream promotes satisfying results. Visit rsmmultilink.com now!!', 0, 0, 'Herbal Penon Cream', ''),
(223, '--', 'Herbal Neron Cream', 'herbal-neron-cream', 'oZPtUdeLYKnS4vyQ4CjKGywuF2VXsgVgmO6r61II.png', 'Herbal Neron cream is an ultimate vaginal shrinking or tightening cream. The cream is effective for adult women and comes with herbal components. The manufacturing of the medicine is done for Sunrise Remedies Pvt. Ltd.', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p>Herbal Neron cream is an ultimate vaginal shrinking or tightening cream. The cream is effective for adult women and comes with herbal components. The manufacturing of the medicine is done for Sunrise Remedies Pvt. Ltd. For higher efficacy in improving low satisfaction levels during intercourse, the cream is useful. It helps promote the blood circulation and cell regeneration to prevent female flaccid private parts.</p><p><strong>Use of Herbal cream</strong></p><p>The herbal cream is effective to restore the muscle elasticity and nerve sensitivity of the reproductive organ. By promoting enhancement in sensual pleasure and sensual intercourse life, the cream works. Providing female reproductive organ with secondary development and postpone at aging and menopause, the cream is beneficial.</p><p><strong>How to use cream</strong></p><p>Apply a small amount of cream in the vagina as far as applicable. The cream needs to be applied in a small amount inside the organ and on the outer lining of the vagina to promote effective results. Do not use the cream in an excessive amount. A pea sized amount of cream is enough to be used in the vaginal walls. Use light movements giving some time to the cream to easily penetrate.</p><p><strong>Precautionary measures</strong></p><p>It is a prescription cream and thereby requires proper medical attention before use. One needs to seek medical attention if one has some health effects. The herbal cream works best for an adult individual and is not intended for pregnant women and also children.</p><p><strong>Side effects of using cream</strong></p><p>Headache, redness on the area, burning sensation or rashes might occur due to an excessive use of cream.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-08-01 09:27:28', '2024-12-13 17:23:46', NULL, 'Buy Online HERBAL NERON CREAM with Uses & Dosage', 'HERBAL NERON CREAM', 'Buy online herbal Neron cream for flaccid women’s reproductive organ. It helps boost satisfaction with quality results. Visit rsmmultilink.com now!!', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(224, '--', 'Careprost 0.03 (Bimatprost 0.03%)', 'careprost-0-03-bimatprost-0-03', 'Q4v8cOfZbPa5pNPW5oqOideMa5CFMxnA2OFtoOKF.png', 'Careprost 0.03 is an eye solution that works to control the progression of Glaucoma. It comes with an active component of Bimatprost 0.03%. The manufacturing of the medicine is done for Sun Pharma Laboratories Ltd.', '<p><strong>Careprost 0.03% Eye Solution: An Effective Treatment for Glaucoma and Eyelash Growth</strong></p><p>Careprost 0.03% is a widely used eye solution designed to manage and control the progression of glaucoma. Formulated with Bimatoprost 0.03%, this medication is manufactured by Sun Pharma Laboratories Ltd. It effectively lowers intraocular pressure (IOP) by promoting the outflow of fluid from the eyes. Additionally, Careprost is known for enhancing eyelash growth, making it a dual-purpose solution for both medical and cosmetic benefits.</p><p><strong>Key Features of Bimatoprost 0.03%:</strong></p><p>The active ingredient, Bimatoprost 0.03%, is specifically designed to alleviate increased eye pressure. It is particularly beneficial for individuals with open-angle glaucoma and works efficiently either as a standalone treatment or in combination with other medications. Regular use of this solution reduces IOP by improving fluid drainage, while also supporting the natural growth of thicker, longer, and darker eyelashes.</p><p><strong>Proper Usage of Careprost 0.03%:</strong></p><p>The dosage and application of Careprost 0.03% should be strictly followed as prescribed by a healthcare professional. Ensure your hands are clean before using the eye solution. Remove any contact lenses before applying the drops and wait at least 15 minutes before reinserting them. Apply the recommended amount of solution, wiping off any excess liquid carefully. Remember that this product is only designed for exterior use.</p><p><strong>Who Should Avoid Using Careprost?</strong></p><p>Individuals allergic to Bimatoprost or any other components of the medication should refrain from using Careprost. Though generally safe, it is important to consult a doctor before use, especially if you have pre-existing health conditions. Caution is advised for those performing tasks requiring precision, such as operating machinery, as the medication may temporarily affect vision.</p><p><strong>Precautions Before Using Careprost:</strong></p><ul><li>Do not exceed the recommended dose, as an overdose may lead to adverse effects.</li><li>Pregnant and breastfeeding women should avoid using the solution unless specifically advised by a healthcare provider.</li><li>Seek medical attention immediately if any symptoms or side effects persist.</li></ul><p><strong>Potential Side Effects of Careprost 0.03%</strong></p><p>While most people tolerate Careprost well, a few may encounter minor side effects like:</p><ul><li>Itching</li><li>Eye redness</li><li>Watery eyes</li><li>Cough</li><li>Eyelash growth</li></ul><p><strong>If these effects continue or worsen, discontinue use and consult a healthcare professional.</strong></p><p>Careprost 0.03% offers a trusted solution for managing glaucoma and promoting eyelash growth, making it a popular choice for those seeking an effective and reliable treatment. Always use it under medical supervision for optimal results and safety.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-08-03 14:13:30', '2024-12-13 17:19:24', NULL, 'Buy Online BIMATPROST 0.03% (CAREPROST 0.03)', 'BIMATPROST 0.03%, CAREPROST 0.03', 'Buy online Careprost (Bimatprost 0.03%) 0.03 from rsmmultilink.com to help promote eyelash growth in an individual. For guaranteed outcomes visit store!!', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(225, '--', 'Bimat 3ml (Bimatprost Opthalmic Solution)', 'bimat-3ml-bimatprost-opthalmic-solution', '8ChOQCAFO8tUglUPWRaBReMMglHaGIoQCC4aaIAN.png', 'Bimat 3 ml is an eye drop that helps in treating increased pressure in the eye. It contains Bimatoprost which belongs to a class of medication called prostanoids. .', '<h2><strong>Description</strong></h2><p>Bimat 3 ml is an eye drop that helps in treating increased pressure in the eye. It contains Bimatoprost which belongs to a class of medication called prostanoids. It is used to treat a condition in adults called glaucoma. It is a condition where the optic nerve is damaged. The manufacturing is done for Ajanta Pharma.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></h2><p>Bimat eye drop is used in the management of ocular hypertension. It is used for external use only.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></h2><p>The eyes contain clear water that feeds inside of the eye. The liquid is frequently drained and replaced with a new one. If not, it builds up stress inside the eye. Bimatoprost works by increasing the fluid in the eye and reducing pressure. If the pressure is too high, it can lead to loss of sight. Put Bimat eye drops 3 ml in the infected eye and avoid contact with the normal one.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Dosing Information</strong></h2><p>Wash your hands well before using these eye drops. Remove your contact lenses (if using) before using Bimat eye drops 3 ml. Avoid applying it if you are allergic to beta-blockers, sulphonamides, or severe kidney or liver issues.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Treatment</strong></h2><p>Consult your doctor if you are allergic to any ingredients of Bimat T. Tell your doctor if you have ailments like asthma, low heart rate, poor blood circulation, diabetes, liver or kidney problems.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></h2><p>Bimat can cause side effects like many other Medicines. Some of them are burning, itching, sensitivity to the light, sticky eyes, pain in the eye, growing hair around the eye, darkening of the eyelids, longer eyelashes, watery eyes, and reduced vision.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Overdose</strong></h2><p>Seek immediate medical treatment in case of an overdose. Sometimes, an overdose of BIMAT 3ml can lead to blurred vision.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></h2><p>BIMAT eye drop 3ml interacts moderately with Latanoprost and Travoprost. It is advisable to avoid consuming this Medicine if suffering from Macular oedema, Uveitis, Renal Diseases, and Liver disease.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Precautions</strong></h2><p>●&nbsp;It is not recommended for use in pregnant and breastfeeding women.</p><p>●&nbsp;Avoid using an ophthalmic form of this Medicine if you are using contact lenses.</p><p>●&nbsp;Do not use it if this Medicine is contaminated. It can lead to an infection of the cornea.</p><p>●&nbsp;It is strictly not advisable for use in patients below 16 years.</p><p>Do not drive after applying BIMAT eye drop 3ml as it can cause blurry vision.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-08-03 14:16:11', '2024-12-13 17:20:17', NULL, 'Buy Online BIMAT 3ML with Uses & Dosage', 'BIMAT 3ML', 'Buy online Bimat 3ml at rsmmultilink.com to treat Glaucoma in an individual. Bimat 3ml uses are effective to improve eyelash growth. Visit store!!', 0, 0, NULL, '');
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `alt_img`, `title`, `slug`, `image`, `excerpt`, `description`, `views`, `user_id`, `is_active`, `allow_comments`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_description`, `new_launches`, `hot_offers`, `tags`, `thumbnail`) VALUES
(226, NULL, 'Bimato Pro – Bimatoprost', 'bimato-pro-bimatoprost', 'bIbCU5xvhAaQgonC19GbTfIlRuec7oOkX99YJQlA.png', 'Bimato Pro is an effective tropical solution to help resolve the problem of hypotrichosis. It comes with an active substance of Bimatoprost Opthalmic Solution that helps treat glaucoma by treating intraocular pressure.', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Bimato Pro is an effective tropical solution to help resolve the problem of hypotrichosis. It comes with an active substance of Bimatoprost Opthalmic Solution that helps treat glaucoma by treating intraocular pressure. It belongs to a group of drugs called prostamides and is an ophthalmic solution that comes with an ability to reduce ocular hypertension, proving effective in such conditions. The solution is also useful to treat hypotrichosis and eyelash growth. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">How to use Bimatoprost</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">The active substance of the solution helps to mildly stimulate aqueous humor outflow, relieving elevated intraocular pressure and thereby decreasing intraocular pressure within the eyes. It works to decrease the risk of optic nerve damage causing an increase in outflow of aqueous humor. By decreasing tonographic resistance aqueous humor outflow, the solution works best. The solution also works to promote eye lash growth. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Use of solution</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Apply this solution in the eyes usually once in the day or in the evening as prescribed by the healthcare physician. Do not use bimato pro often as it will not provide additional benefits. Avoid touching the dropper tip or let it touch eyes while using. Try not to use the solution in an inadequate amount. After application, wash hands thoroughly. Do not wear contact lenses for 15minutes. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Precautionary measures</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Prevent use of eye drops if allergic to the active substance of the eye drops. If allergic to the active substance, the eye drops needs to be treated with prescription from healthcare. If one develops eye injury or surgery, one needs to start using a new bottle for the use. Do not use solution on contact lenses. Seek medical advice if an inadequate amount of use is done. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Side effects of the solution</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Burning </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Stinging</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Irritation</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Redness</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Watery eyes</span></p>\r\n<p><!-- [if gte mso 9]><xml>\r\n <w:WordDocument>\r\n  <w:View>Normal</w:View>\r\n  <w:Zoom>0</w:Zoom>\r\n  <w:TrackMoves/>\r\n  <w:TrackFormatting/>\r\n  <w:PunctuationKerning/>\r\n  <w:ValidateAgainstSchemas/>\r\n  <w:SaveIfXMLInvalid>false</w:SaveIfXMLInvalid>\r\n  <w:IgnoreMixedContent>false</w:IgnoreMixedContent>\r\n  <w:AlwaysShowPlaceholderText>false</w:AlwaysShowPlaceholderText>\r\n  <w:DoNotPromoteQF/>\r\n  <w:LidThemeOther>EN-US</w:LidThemeOther>\r\n  <w:LidThemeAsian>X-NONE</w:LidThemeAsian>\r\n  <w:LidThemeComplexScript>X-NON