spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Keep it out of reach from kids. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Take the proper prescription from start to end from the doctor for the usage.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-10-28 14:07:04', '2023-06-08 12:51:16', NULL, 'Buy Sildigra 250mg (Sildenafil Citrate 250mg) Tablets - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Sildigra 250mg,Sildenafil 250mg,Health,HealthCare,MensHealth,RSM Multilink LLP,Generic Viagra 250', 'Buy Sildigra 250 (Sildenafil 250mg) Tablets Online to help resolve the problem of erectile difficulties in men. For uses and price info, visit rsmmultilink.com', 1, 0, NULL, '');
