(231, NULL, 'Sildigra Black Force (Sildenafil Citrate 200mg)', 'sildigra-black-force', 'Jq5JgB7iLGV7ku6FkvqwRvIssOaW9TyuWroWMeNG.jpeg', 'Sildigra Black Force (Sildenafil Citrate 200mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Sildigra Black Force 200mg</strong> is a pharmaceutical remedy for ED that allows them to induce an erection and sustain it by making use of Sildenafil Citrate 200 mg to improve sexual performance and libido in men. <strong>Sildigra Black Force 200mg</strong> is manufactured by <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">The Medicine is used to treat ED in males by boosting blood flow to the penis, thus allowing for an erection to be induced for sexual and sensual activities.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">The active ingredient in <strong>Sildigra Black Force 200mg</strong>, <strong>Sildenafil Citrate 200mg</strong> takes action by simply relaxing the blood vessels of the penis to allow blood to flow more readily, thus allowing a firm erection to be induced that can be sustained.</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Sildigra Black Force 200mg</strong> must be ideally taken about 1 hour before engaging in sexual activity or as late as 30 minutes before sexual intercourse and never more than 4 hours before sex. The Medicine must be taken with a low-fat meal and without alcohol and tobacco.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Sildigra Black Force 200mg</strong> must be avoided if sensitive to the active substance <strong>Sildenafil</strong>. It does not help protect one against sexually transmitted diseases. Seek doctor\'s advice if suffering from a bleeding disorder, cardiovascular disease, uncontrolled hypertension, kidney or liver disease. Avoid consuming the Medicine with alcohol and grapefruit beverages.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Some of the side effects of <strong>Sildigra Black Force 200mg</strong> are headache, dizziness, body pain, facial flushing, nausea or vomiting.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">In single-dose volunteer studies of doses up to 200 mg, resulting in adverse reactions like headache, flushing, dizziness, dyspepsia, nasal congestion and altered vision.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Avoid consuming alcohol with this Medicine to avoid side effects. Sildenafil may react with grapefruit and lead to adverse reactions. A doctor&rsquo;s recommendation is advisable if using any other Medicine to treat impotence in men.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-indent: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; margin: 5.0000pt 0.0000pt 5.0000pt 0.0000pt;\" align=\"justify\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Take the Medicine portion as recommended by the doctor.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Avoid using the medication if adversely affected by sildenafil in the past.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Do not consume if experiencing a bleeding issue.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">If suffering from a blood pressure issue, abstain from utilising the Medicine.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">Keep the Medicine far away from kids around.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-11-24 11:02:21', '2023-06-10 10:41:06', NULL, 'Buy Sildigra Black Force (Sildenafil Citrate 200mg) - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Sildigra Black Force,Sildenafil 200mg,Sildenafil Citrate,Health,HealthCare,MensHealth,RSM Mutlilink LLP', 'Sildigra Black Force (Sildenafil Citrate 200mg) is a potent medicine that works efficiently to enhance improvement in erectile dysfunction. Visit us for more info!!', 1, 0, NULL, ''),
(232, NULL, 'Sildalist Strong (Sildenafil 100mg + Tadalafil 40mg)', 'sildalist-strong', 'qCDaCPxLhJUD5ltNCqrZc5mYbItLtuNewD2dhyQC.jpeg', 'Sildalist Strong (Sildenafil 100mg + Tadalafil 40mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Sildalist strong</strong> is a potent Medicine that helps in treating ED in men. It contains the active substance of <strong>Sildenafil Citrate 100mg</strong> and <strong>Tadalafil 40mg</strong>, used to treat sexual disorders in men. This Medicine is manufactured for <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Sildalist strong</strong> helps men to treat the signs and symptoms of ED (impotence) in men. It is used to improve the ability of an adult individual to attain or sustain a firm erection.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Sildalist strong</strong> helps to smooth the penile muscles and increases the flow of blood around the penis. The erection occurs by increasing bloodstream levels in the male reproductive organs. <strong>Sildenafil</strong> and <strong>tadalafil</strong> belong to the group of PDE5 inhibitors that helps in strong blood flow, and works to reverse erectile difficulty in a short duration. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Take one pill with one glass of water with a low-fat meal. Utilise this Medicine 20 minutes to one hour before the sensual activity. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consult your doctor before taking Sildalist strong 140mg if you are allergic or hypersensitive to the active substances. Ask your physician if you have arterial blockage, uncontrolled hypertension, and blood vessel problems.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The side effects of Sildalist strong 140 mg are headache, facial flushing, nausea, blurred vision and dizziness. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Instantly seek your doctor\'s help in case of an overdose. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Inform your physician if you are on vitamins or herbal supplements. Sildalist strong 140mg interacts with the following Medicines:</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.00