li>\r\n<li><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Fish Oil</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if you are allergic to Sildenafil Citrate 100mg and Tadalafil 40mg in Sildalist strong 140mg. </span></li>\r\n<li><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Ask your doctor if you have a heart condition or any other health condition.</span></li>\r\n<li><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Keep them out of sight from children.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2020-11-24 12:19:15', '2023-07-12 12:41:33', NULL, 'Buy Sildalist Strong (Sildenafil  100mg+ Tadalafil 40mg) - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Buy Online Sildalist Strong Tablet, Sildenafil 100mg,Tadalafil 40mg', 'Sildalist Strong (Sildenafil  100mg+ Tadalafil 40mg) is a potent Medicine that helps in treating ED in men. The oral medication helps promote sensual capability. Order Now!!!', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(233, NULL, 'test', 'test', 'wEh7dKKE1K324LBKospT96OJ15ANzSpN1UOFiPM3.jpeg', 'test', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p>test</p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2021-04-01 13:05:40', '2021-04-01 13:08:37', '2021-04-01 13:08:37', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'thumbnail/1617282340.jpg'),
(234, NULL, 'Super Eroxib', 'test-1', 'LIjAXsyPuYW7eZ5Cp69wxljU4Xv9t9MCPVuTGl3Y.jpeg', 'tfhfgfhbn', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p>Description</p>\r\n<p>Super Eroxib is an exemption medicine that works to resolve the problem of erectile dysfunction and premature ejaculation in an adult individual. The medicine comes with an active component of Tadalafil 20mg and Dapoxetine 60mg. The manufacturing of the medicine is done for RSM Multilink LLP by EU GMP Approved Plant. Tadalafil USP 20mg serves as its active component that helps to treat Erectile Dysfunction in men. The key ingredient Tadalafil USP (The United States Pharmacopeia) is a higher grade of Tadalafil IP(Indian Pharmacopeia) ensuring a better quality of raw material used in production and hence differentiating Super Eroxib from other similar products in the market.</p>\r\n<p>Benefits</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Oral medicine is also used in some rare pulmonary cases like hypertension for those who used to live in high altitudes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; With significant self-confidence issues, oral medication helps treat mental health by deliberating sensual health to an extreme.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Boosting sensual health helps decrease the amount of negativity in men by promoting desirable and attractive outcomes.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; The oral medication is effective to treat the annoying erectile health difficulty in men known as ED.</p>\r\n<p>Dosage</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; The dosage and duration of the medicine are advised by the doctor itself.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; One can consume the medicine with a glass of water an hour before sensual activity.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Try not to skip or miss the dosage. Do not split or break the tablet.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Consumption of an inadequate amount of medicine needs to be avoided.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Avoid the use of high-fat meal, oily food with the consumption of medication.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; The dosage of the medicine requires an hour for satisfactory results and lasts for more than hours.</p>\r\n<p>Precautions</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Avoid the use of grapefruit beverages, alcohol as well as tobacco when on medication.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; The medicine is intended only for the male purpose.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; The medicine does not help prevent an individual from sensually transmitting disease such as HIV.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Avoid an inadequate amount of medicine use as it can lead to a visit to a healthcare physician.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Consultation with a healthcare physician is required before consuming medication if an individual is suffering from dehydration, heart irregularities, high or low blood pressure, diabetes and bleeding disorder or any other health issues.</p>\r\n<p>Side Effects</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Headache</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Nausea</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Dizziness</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Facial flushing</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Body pain</p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2021-04-01 13:06:52', '2021-04-02 04:54:12', '2021-04-02 04:54:12', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(235, NULL, 'Super Eroxib (Tadalafil 20mg + Dapoxetine 60mg)', 'super-eroxib', '4zqEkk70W9YdkLoXbDYY8jnmHSGoT4V9jnxDshMl.jpeg', 'Super Eroxib (Tadalafil 20mg + Dapoxetine 60mg)', '<p><strong>Super Eroxib </strong>is an oral medicine used primarily for the treatment of impotence and rapid ejaculation in male patients. It contains two active ingredients, <strong>Tadalafil 20mg</strong> and <strong>Dapoxetine 60mg</strong>, which work together to enhance sensual performance and prolong the duration of sensual activity. The manufacturing of <strong>Super Eroxib 80mg</strong> is done for <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicine Usage:</strong></p><p><strong>Super Eroxib 80mg</strong> is used to improve the ability of an adult individual to achieve and maintain a firm erection, as well as to control rapid ejaculation, allowing for a more satisfying sensual experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Mechanism of Action:</strong></p><p><strong>Tadalafil</strong>, a phosphodiesterase type 5 (PDE5) inhibitor, helps relax the smooth muscles in the blood vessels of the penis, increasing blood flow and facilitating the achievement and maintenance of an erection. <strong>Dapoxetine</strong>, a selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor (SSRI), works by delaying the ejaculation process, thereby improving control over ejaculation and prolonging the time to climax.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Dosing Information:</strong></p><p>It is important to follow the dosage instructions provided by the healthcare specialist. <strong>Super Eroxib 80mg</strong> should be taken orally with water, approximately 1-3 hours before anticipated sensual activity. Avoid consuming alcohol or grapefruit juice while taking this medicine. The effects of <strong>Super Eroxib 80mg</strong> can last for up to 36 hours.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Treatment:</strong></p><p>Before taking <strong>Super Eroxib 80mg</strong>, it is recommended to consult your doctor, especially if you have any known allergies or hypersensitivity to the active ingredients. Inform your doctor about any existing medical conditions, such as heart problems, liver or kidney disease, high or low blood pressure, or any bleeding disorders.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicine Side Effects:</strong></p><p>The side effects of <strong>Super Eroxib 80mg</strong> may vary from person to person. Common side effects may include:</p><ul><li>Headache</li><li>Dizziness</li><li>Flushing</li><li>Upset stomach</li><li>Nasal congestion</li><li>Back pain</li></ul><p>It’s crucial to visit a doctor if any of these adverse effects linger or get worse. Additionally, there may be rare but more serious side effects that require immediate medical assistance.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Overdose:</strong></p><p>Without consulting a doctor, never take more medication than is advised.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicine Interactions:</strong></p><p><strong>Super Eroxib 80mg</strong> may interact with certain medications, such as nitrates, alpha-blockers, other PDE5 inhibitors, and certain antidepressants. It is important to inform your doctor about all the medications you are currently taking to avoid potential interactions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Precautions:</strong></p><ul><li>If you are allergic to tadalafil, dapoxetine, or any other active ingredients, it is advisable not to use this medicine.</li><li>Consultation with a healthcare professional is necessary if you have a history of heart irregularities, kidney or liver disease, high or low blood pressure, or other bleeding disorders.</li><li>Avoid using this medicine in combination with nitrates or recreational drugs (such as “poppers”) as it may cause a sudden and severe drop in blood pressure.</li><li><strong>Super Eroxib 80mg</strong> does not protect against sensually transmitted diseases. Practice safe sensual measures.</li><li>It is important to follow the prescribed dosage and duration as instructed by the doctor.</li></ul>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2021-04-02 05:36:02', '2024-04-05 11:57:17', NULL, 'Buy Online Super Eroxib (Tadalafil  20mg + Dapoxetine 60mg) Tablets Best Price - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Super Eroxib 80mg,Buy Super Eroxib Tablets,Health,HealthCare,Tadalafil 20mg,Dapoxetine 60mg,RSM Multilink LLP', 'Order Cheap Price Super Eroxib (Tadalafil 20mg + Dapoxetine 60mg) tablet works to improve ED and PE issues with satisfying outcomes. Today Order Now', 1, 0, NULL, ''),
(236, NULL, 'Bluemen Prof (Sildenafil Professional 100mg)', 'bluemen-prof-sildenafil-professional-100mg', 'uBz1C25ZlkAZ196qI4s6qA7RF4G9tW2Hlgt5zYq0.jpeg', 'Bluemen Prof is an oral remedy effective to enhance improvement in erectile difficulties majorly known as Erectile Dysfunction. It comes with a key ingredient of Sildenafil Professional 100mg.', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Bluemen Prof is an oral remedy effective to enhance improvement in erectile difficulties majorly known as Erectile Dysfunction. It comes with a key ingredient of Sildenafil Professional 100mg. It is a sublingual tablet and the manufacturing of the medicine is done for RSM Multilink LLP. The medicine works to promote improvement in health factor where a person is unable to attain the firm erection required for the climax. It promotes firm and stiff erection essential to promote lovemaking session. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">What is Sildenafil Professional (Bluemen Prof)?</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Sildenafil Professional belongs to a PDE5 inhibitor enzyme class that helps to enhance the flow of blood in the penile region. The medicine helps to manage and improve chronic health condition thereby reversing the lack of inability to attain the desired erection. By enhancing sensual potency and virility, the medicine promotes energy level and also stamina to endure overall health.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Guidance to take Sildenafil Professional (Bluemen Prof)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Gulp a single tablet once a day with a glass of water or low-fat meal. Try not to skip or miss the dosage. One needs to avoid the use of grapefruit beverages, alcoholic consumption and also a high-fat meal. Consume the medicine an hour before lovemaking as it works with sensual stimulation.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Who should not take Sildenafil Professional (Bluemen Prof)?</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">An individual sensitive or allergic to the active substance needs to avoid its use. An individual suffering from chronic health issues such as arterial blockage, neurological disorder, kidney or liver disorder, uncontrolled hypertension or any other adverse health effect needs to avoid its use. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Cautions before taking Sildenafil Professional (Bluemen Prof)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Bluemen Prof is a recommended medicine and it requires proper medical attention before consuming the medicine. Do not take an inadequate amount of medicine. The medicine does not help prevent one from sexually transmitting disease such as HIV. Do not start or end the medicine usage without consultation.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Some side effects of Sildenafil Professional (Bluemen Prof)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Headache, nausea, dizziness, facial flushing or body pain are some of the health deflects that might occur in an individual due to an inadequate amount of medicine.</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2021-04-05 09:20:47', '2024-01-25 11:41:57', NULL, 'Buy Online Bluemen Prof (Sildenafil Professional 100mg) Tablet', NULL, 'Bluemen Prof with Sildenafil 100mg helps to enhance improvement in men suffering from ED. It promotes stamina to attain an erection for satisfying outcomes.', 0, 0, NULL, 'thumbnail/1646384628.jpeg'),
