(241, NULL, 'Cenforce 120 mg', 'cenforce-120-mg', 'zs59uQ6K6UcNGeRBBrnqQBuBzGPixmWyEAccktlv.jpeg', 'Cenforce 120 mg is an oral pill to treat impotence or ED in men.', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Description</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Cenforce 120 mg is an oral pill to treat impotence or ED in men. It is an inability to have a stiff erection. It comes with an active substance, Sildenafil Citrate, to attain a harder erection for a longer continuance. &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Cenforce 120 mg works in treating male sexual function problems by relaxing the blood vessels. It is also known as Sildenafil Citrate Cenforce-120 as it contains Sildenafil Citrate as its major active ingredient. It helps in achieving satisfying erection by increasing blood flow in the penile region. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Cenforce 120 mg contains an active element, Sildenafil citrate, that belongs to a group of Phosphodiesterase type 5 inhibitor enzymes. It enhances the blood supply by hindering the PDE5 enzymes in the body. It is a perfect medication that functions to provide an ultimate result for powerful physical intimacy. Cenforce 120 mg treats the overall penile region with satisfactory erection. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">It is advisable to take the usual dose under your physician\'s supervision. Consume the Cenforce 120 mg with a low-fat meal and a cup of water without skipping the next dose. For the best result, use this Medicine 30 minutes or one hour before the physical contact but not more than 4 hours. Avoid taking the next dose within the 24-hours duration. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">One should avoid Cenforce 120 mg if allergic to the active element Sildenafil Citrate. This Medicine does not guard against sexually transmitted diseases like HIV. Seek your physician\'s help if suffering from severe health issues. Extreme consumption of alcohol with the medication can show a negative impact with Sildenafil Citrate.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Some of the side effects of Cenforce 120 mg are dizziness, headache, and blurred vision, sleep disorders, muscle pain, and indigestion.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">An overdose of Cenforce 120 mg can cause reactions like low blood pressure, dizziness, hearing problems, indigestion, and chest pain. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using Medicines that contain nitrates. Cenforce 120 mg interacts with Medicines like amlodipine, aspirin, Cialis (Tadalafil), and other PDE5 inhibitors etc.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if you are allergic to any Medicine that contains Sildenafil Citrate.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Refrain from utilising this Medicine with another Medicine to treat hypertension, blood pressure or chest pain.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Before taking Cenforce 120 mg, consult your doctor if you have cardiovascular complications or bleeding disorder.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Keep this Medicine away from children.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consult the doctor if the erection is prolonged for more than 4 hours as it can cause immense pain.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 12:06:38', '2023-05-19 10:29:26', NULL, NULL, 'Cenforce 120 mg is an oral pill to treat impotence or ED in men.', 'Cenforce 120 mg is an oral pill to treat impotence or ED in men.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(242, '--', 'Cenforce 200 mg', 'cenforce-200-mg', 'vrijWxPdPGaJrrOa7hTES0MGe84F8j0QcFAbmGf8.jpeg', 'Cenforce 200 mg is an oral pill to treat ED in men. It is an inability to have a stiffer erection.', '<p><strong>Description</strong></p><p>Cenforce 200 mg is an oral pill to treat ED in men. It is an inability to have a stiffer erection. It comes with an active substance, Sildenafil Citrate, to attain a more stimulating erection for a longer period.</p><p><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></p><p>Cenforce 200 mg works in treating male sexual function problems by increasing blood through the penis.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></p><p>Sildenafil citrate is the main ingredient in Cenforce 200 mg that belongs to a group of PDE5 inhibitor enzymes. It enhances the blood flow by preventing the PDE5 enzymes in the body. It also helps in treating Pulmonary arterial hypertension.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Dosing Information</strong></p><p>Consult your doctor before taking this Medicine. Consume the Cenforce 200 mg with a low-fat meal and a cup of water for the prescribed period without skipping the next dose. For the best result, use this Medicine 30 minutes or one hour before the physical contact but not more than 4 hours. Do not take the second dose within 24-hours time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Treatment</strong></p><p>One should avoid Cenforce 200 mg if allergic to the active component Sildenafil Citrate. Seek your physician\'s help if suffering from severe health issues like heart-related &amp; cardiovascular diseases.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></p><p>Some of the side effects of Cenforce 200 mg are headache, blurred vision, back pain, nausea, rashes, and dizziness.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Overdose</strong></p><p>An overdose of Cenforce 200 mg can cause a longer erection for more than 4 hours with extensive pain. It can also cause reactions like low blood pressure, dizziness, hearing problems, indigestion, and chest pain.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></p><p>Avoid using Medicines that contain nitrates. Cenforce 200 mg interacts with Medicines like ritonavir, isosorbide, doxazosin, tamsulosin, itraconazole, ketoconazole and HIV prostate inhibitors.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Precautions</strong></p><p>●&nbsp;Before taking Cenforce 200 mg, consult your doctor if you are allergic to active elements present in it.</p><p>●&nbsp;Refrain from utilising this Medicine if having a life-threatening irregular heartbeat in the last six months.</p><p>●&nbsp;Before taking Cenforce 200 mg, consult your doctor if having cardiovascular complications, kidney or liver disease or bleeding disorder.</p><p>●&nbsp;Do not indulge in driving or any activities that require alertness, as this Medicine makes you sleepy.&nbsp;</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 12:11:14', '2024-10-23 10:58:11', NULL, 'Get the Cenforce 200 mg (Sildenafil citrate) in Best price', 'Cenforce 200 mg,ED pills,Men health,male sexual treatment', 'Discover the best prices on Cenforce 200 mg (Sildenafil citrate) for effective erectile dysfunction treatment. Shop now for high-quality medication and fast shipping!', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(243, NULL, 'Cenforce 25mg', 'cenforce-25mg', 'ynAvlLKrn7NvPpo1ijZLq5SYLwTMbxdTQv8HFeZs.jpeg', 'Cenforce 25 mg is an oral pill to treat impotence or ED in men.', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Description</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Cenforce 25 mg is an oral pill to treat impotence or ED in men. It is a failure to have a strong erection. It comes with an active element, Sildenafil Citrate, to attain a stronger erection for a longer duration. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Cenforce 25 mg works to treat the inability to have a satisfying erection in men problems by relaxing the blood vessels. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Cenforce 25 mg contains an active element, Sildenafil citrate, that belongs to a class of Phosphodiesterase type 5 inhibitor enzymes. It blocks the PDE5 inhibitors by increasing blood flow in the penis. It does not protect one from STDs like HIV or unwanted pregnancy. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Read your physician\'s directions to use this Medicine carefully. Consuming the Cenforce 25 mg with a low-fat meal as a high-fat meal can delay the effect. Take this Medicine with a cup of water without skipping the subsequent dose. For the best event, use this Medicine 30 minutes or one hour before the sensual activity. Avoid taking the next dose within the 24-hours duration. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">One should avoid Cenforce 25 mg if allergic to the active component Sildenafil Citrate. Seek your doctor\'s help if suffering from severe health issues. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Some of the side effects of Cenforce 25mg are chest pain, dizziness, headache, fainting, loss of vision, muscle pain, and flushing.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Seek immediate help from your doctor in case of an overdose. An overdose of Cenforce 25 mg can cause severe reactions like low blood pressure, dizziness, hearing problems, indigestion, and chest pain. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using this medication that contains nitrates. Cenforce 25 mg interacts with Medicines like Amyl Nitrite, Amprenavir, Atazanavir, Indinavir, Ritonavir, Riociguat and Fosamprenavir.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if you are allergic to any Medicine that contains ingredients of Cenforce 25 mg.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Refrain from utilising this Medicine with another Medicine to treat hypertension, kidney or liver diseases, leukaemia, blood pressure or chest pain.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not do anything that needs attentiveness or clear vision until you can do it carefully. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 12:13:55', '2023-05-19 10:30:20', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(244, '--', 'Cenforce 50mg', 'cenforce-50mg', 'KaxAlDxoZvq70mTHupZA0ozhZgtYRm62h7qDdu4d.jpeg', 'Cenforce 50 mg is used in the treatment of ED in men.', '<p><strong>Description</strong></p><p>Cenforce 50 mg is used in the treatment of ED in men. It comes with an active element, Sildenafil Citrate, to attain a stronger erection for a longer duration. It is manufactured by Centurion Laboratories. Cenforce 50 mg is a PDE-5 inhibitor.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></p><p>Cenforce 50 mg works by relaxing the penile soft muscles and by increasing the blood flow to the penis.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></p><p>Cenforce 50 mg contains an active composition, Sildenafil citrate, that belongs to a family of Phosphodiesterase type 5 inhibitor enzymes. It helps in achieving and maintaining an erection during sensual activity. Cenforce 50 mg consists of sildenafil citrate chemical, which increases cGMP level into the body. It takes 15-20 minutes to react in the body.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Dosing Information</strong></p><p>It is advisable to consume this Medicine under a doctor\'s supervision. Consume Cenforce 50 mg 30 minutes or one hour before the sensual action. Do not take the second dose immediately after the first dose. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Treatment</strong></p><p>One should avoid Cenforce 50 mg if allergic to the active component Sildenafil Citrate. Seek your doctor\'s help if suffering from severe health concerns.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></p><p>Some of the side effects of Cenforce 50mg are chest pain, dizziness, headache, vomiting, fainting, loss of vision, blocked nose, muscle pain, and facial flushing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Overdose</strong></p><p>Seek medical help in case of an overdose. An overdose of Cenforce 50 mg can cause severe reactions like low blood pressure, dizziness, hearing problems, indigestion, and chest pain.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></p><p>Cenforce 50 mg interacts with Ketoconazole, Itraconazole, Warfarin, Heparin, Saquinavir, Isosorbide mononitrate and Isosorbide dinitrate.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Precautions</strong></p><p>●&nbsp;Do not consume if you are allergic to any Medicine that contains ingredients of Cenforce 50 mg.</p><p>●&nbsp;Refrain from utilising this Medicine with another Medicine like PDE type-5 inhibitor as it may cause Medicine interaction.</p><p>●&nbsp;Do not do anything that needs alertness as it can cause blurry vision.</p><p>●&nbsp;Do not consume alcohol or grapefruit beverages while taking this Medicine.&nbsp;</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 12:16:16', '2024-12-14 12:04:57', NULL, 'Cenforce 50mg (Sildenafil Citrate) - Effective ED Treatment | Buy Online', 'Cenforce 50mg(Sildenafil citrate Tablet)', 'Cenforce 50mg tablets, containing Sildenafil Citrate, provide a reliable solution for erectile dysfunction (ED). Enhance performance and confidence. Buy Cenforce 50mg online at affordable prices.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(245, '--', 'Cenforce Professional 100 mg', 'cenforce-professional-100-mg', 'hjQKxnio8sLt5nS5vgPwPcE0zC5tZlLSHtXyGjuM.jpeg', 'Cenforce Professional 100 mg Medicine helps in treating ED by blocking PDES enzymes in the body.', '<h2><strong>Description</strong></h2><p>Cenforce Professional 100 mg Medicine helps in treating ED by blocking PDES enzymes in the body. Its active composition, Sildenafil Citrate, prompts cGMP levels that help in supplying the blood in the male reproductive organ.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></h2><p>Cenforce Professional 100 mg helps in relaxing the muscles around the penile region and enhances the erection to perform physical activity. It also helps in treating pulmonary arterial hypertension.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></h2><p>Cenforce Professional 100 mg restrains the PDE5 enzymes, responsible for degrading the cGMP levels around the penis. cGMP levels are in charge of controlling the blood flow in the vein. As a result, it improves blood circulation giving a firm erection.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Dosing Information</strong></h2><p>The dosage of this Medicine is 100 mg, directed by the physician. The reaction is different as per individual and their ailments. Do not skip the following dosages without your doctor\'s consultation. Consume a single dose 15 or 30 minutes before physical activity or as required.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Treatment</strong></h2><p>Do not utilise Cenforce Professional 100 mg if you are allergic to it. Inform your doctor about all your existing diseases and regular food habits. Consult your specialist in case of a heart attack or high blood pressure in the past six months.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></h2><p>Side effects of Cenforce Professional 100 mg are blurred vision, dry eyes, dry mouth, bleeding of the eyes, nervousness, muscle pain and swollen joints.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Overdose</strong></h2><p>In case of an overdose, immediately seek your doctor\'s help for flushing or sleeping disorders.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></h2><p>Cenforce Professional 100 mg may interact with Riociguat when combined. It can cause a decrease in blood pressure which can cause dizziness or fainting. Cenforce Professional 100 mg interacts with the Medicines used for treating Alpha-blockers, Antihypertensives, Strong CYP3A4 Inhibitors or HIV Protease inhibitors.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Precautions</strong></h2><p>●&nbsp;Keep this Medicine away from children.</p><p>●&nbsp;Do not consume this Medicine with Antihypertensives.</p><p>●&nbsp;Avoid utilising the Medicine with alcohol as it will reduce the effect.</p><p>●&nbsp;Consult your doctor if you have a genital deformity.</p><p>●&nbsp;Share your therapeutic records with your doctor for regular treatment.</p><p>●&nbsp;It is not advisable to use this Medicine in between dental treatments.</p><p>●&nbsp;It does not guard against sexually transmitted diseases like HIV.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 12:18:43', '2024-12-14 12:06:10', NULL, 'Cenforce Professional 100mg (Sildenafil Citrate) - Fast-Acting ED Treatment', 'Cenforce Professional 100 mg(Sildenafil Citrate Sublingual Tablets)', 'Cenforce Professional 100mg sublingual tablets with Sildenafil Citrate offer quick and effective relief from erectile dysfunction (ED). Dissolves easily for rapid results. Buy online at the best prices.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(246, '--', 'Cenforce Soft 100 mg', 'cenforce-soft-100-mg', 'spBYC4eCiuuPCwX1aKhsjIxsmYEDvC0V7FwBBrgX.jpeg', 'Cenforce Soft 100 mg Medicine is used for treating ED in men.', '<h2><strong>Description</strong></h2><p>Cenforce Soft 100 mg Medicine is used for treating ED in men. Its active component, Sildenafil Citrate, increases the blood flow around the penile area by relaxing the corpus cavernosum muscles in men. The manufacturing for Cenforce Soft 100 mg is done for Centurion Laboratories.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></h2><p>Cenforce Soft 100 mg helps in enhancing the erection in men to perform the satisfying sensual activity. It works on PDE5 enzymes present in the penis, preventing it from being excited instantly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></h2><p>Cenforce Soft 100 mg restrains the PDE5 enzymes, responsible for no activity in the penis. Sildenafil Citrate, an active component in the Medicine, increases the flow of blood in the penis to attain a firm erection.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Dosing Information</strong></h2><p>Follow your doctor\'s instructions to consume this Medicine. Take this Medicine with a low-fat meal as a high-fat meal can degrade the performance. Eat one tablet per day and an hour before the sensual activity.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Treatment</strong></h2><p>Do not utilise Cenforce Soft 100 mg if you are allergic to the ingredients present in this Medicine. Familiarise your doctor about all your current diseases and regular food habits. Consult your specialist in case of a stroke, low blood pressure or have any medical therapies.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></h2><p>Side effects of Cenforce Soft 100 mg are sleeplessness, dizziness, diarrhoea, indigestion, flushing, blurry vision, and painful erection.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Overdose</strong></h2><p>In case of an overdose, immediately see your doctor for flushing or sleeping disorders.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></h2><p>Cenforce Soft 100 mg may interact with other Medicines hurting your health. Inform your doctor if you are on Vitamins or Minerals supplements. It interacts with Amlodipine, Carbamazepine, Clarithromycin, Dexamethasone, Ketoconazole, Atazanavir, and Nitroglycerin.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Precautions</strong></h2><p>●&nbsp;Abstain using this Medicine with Antihypertensives.</p><p>●&nbsp;It is not for use for women and children.</p><p>●&nbsp;Prevent consuming Cenforce Soft 100 mg with other Medicines that contain Sildenafil Citrate.</p><p>●&nbsp;Consult your doctor if you are suffering from hypertension or any medical history of heart disease.&nbsp;</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 12:20:58', '2024-12-14 12:07:21', NULL, 'Cenforce Soft 100mg (Sildenafil Citrate) - Chewable ED Tablets | Fast Relief', 'Cenforce Soft 100 mg (Sildenafil Citrate Chewable Tablets)', 'Cenforce Soft 100mg chewable tablets with Sildenafil Citrate provide a convenient and fast-acting solution for erectile dysfunction (ED). Easy to use with quick results. Buy online at affordable prices.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(247, '--', 'Malegra 100 mg', 'malegra-100-mg', 'HfB9MA0ILTNuE8Nk3dmGkQTuo4WJVp5oZ5G07eCj.jpeg', 'Malegra 100 mg helps to enhance sensual desire in men.', '<h2><strong>Description</strong></h2><p>Malegra 100 mg helps to enhance sensual desire in men. It contains the active substance of Sildenafil Citrate 100 mg. It helps in paramount blood flow that helps in treating ED.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></h2><p>Malegra 100 mg helps in intenseifying&nbsp;and satisfying sensual capability in men. The active component Sildenafil Citrate works for intensified pleasure during sexual communication in men by having a firm erection.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></h2><p>Sildenafil Citrate, an active component in Malegra 100 mg, relaxes the blood vessels around the penis by promoting sexual desire in men. The Medicine is effective in a firm erection during sensual activity. Medicine increases the blood flow in response to sexual stimulation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Dosing Information</strong></h2><p>The recommended dosage is 100 mg. Swallow one dose of Malegra 100 mg one hour before the sensual activity. Do not consume alcohol or tobacco with this Medicine. Try not to overdose on it. Do not crush the tablet. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Treatment</strong></h2><p>Consult your physician if you are allergic to the active substance Sildenafil Citrate. Ask the physician if you are suffering from abnormal heartbeat, high or low blood pressure, or have had a stroke in the last six months.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></h2><p>The possible side effects of Malegra 100 mg are headache, dizziness, drowsiness, chest pain, and nausea. Cconsult your doctor in case you feel any from of discomfort</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Overdose</strong></h2><p>Do not overdose on it as it can have an adverse effect on health. It can also result in dizziness and distress.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></h2><p>Malegra 100 mg may &nbsp;interacts with aspirin, apixaban, tamsulosin, pregabalin, metoprolol, ubiquinone, and atorvastatin.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Precautions</strong></h2><p>●&nbsp;Do not consume if you are allergic to Sildenafil Citrate or any active elements present in Malegra 100 mg.</p><p>●&nbsp;Ask your physician if you have a kidney or liver disease.</p><p>●&nbsp;Keep them out of view from children.</p><p>●&nbsp;Do not take this Medicine if you are taking Nitrate in any form.</p><p>●&nbsp;Avoid consuming it with liquor, tobacco and grapefruit beverages.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 12:23:26', '2024-12-14 12:08:35', NULL, 'Malegra 100mg - Sildenafil Citrate | Effective ED Solution', 'Malegra 100 mg (Sildenafil Citrate 100 mg)', 'Malegra 100mg with Sildenafil Citrate treats erectile dysfunction effectively. Regain confidence and performance. Buy Malegra 100mg online at affordable prices.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(248, '--', 'Poxet 90 mg', 'poxet-90-mg', '3rRlgbyZHazLAodSmdTGgMCbpzJ7Jm6jViTEQi0z.jpeg', 'Poxet 90 mg is a powerful Medicine that helps in treating PE.', '<h2><strong>Description</strong></h2><p>Poxet 90 mg is a powerful Medicine that helps in treating PE. It contains the active substance of Dapoxetine 90 mg that helps in paramount blood flow required for satisfying sensual activity. This Medicine is manufactured for Sunrise Remedies.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></h2><p>Poxet 90 mg helps men with physical disorders related to sensual desire and derive pleasure from their sensual experiences. The active component, Dapoxetine 90 mg, works to improve PE.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></h2><p>Poxet 90 mg works by inhibiting neuronal reuptake of serotonin and subsequent potentiation of serotonin activity. Dapoxetine 30 mg promotes the ejaculation setback by restraining the ejaculation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Dosing Information</strong></h2><p>The recommended dose is 90 mg. Swallow one portion of Poxet 90mg at any time before the sensual activity. Take this Medicine with a glassful of water. Avoid heavy-fat meals as they can decrease the effectiveness of the Medicine on the body.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Treatment</strong></h2><p>Consult your doctor before taking Poxet 90 mg if you are allergic or hypersensitive to the active substance Dapoxetine. Ask your doctor if you have heart-related or blood pressure problems.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></h2><p>The side effects of Poxet 90 mg are nervousness, headache, diarrhoea, nausea, blurred vision and insomnia.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Overdose</strong></h2><p>Immediately seek your doctor\'s help in case of an overdose and symptoms like nervousness, upper respiratory tract infection, insomnia, rhinitis, dyspepsia, dizziness, etc.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></h2><p>Inform your doctor if you are on vitamins or herbal supplements. Poxet 90 mg interacts with the following Medicines:</p><p>●&nbsp;Aceclofenac</p><p>●&nbsp;Acetylsalicylic acid</p><p>●&nbsp;Amitriptyline</p><p>●&nbsp;Atenolol</p><p>●&nbsp;Barbiturates</p><p>●&nbsp;Alcohol</p><p>●&nbsp;Doxazosin</p><p>●&nbsp;Enalapril</p><p>●&nbsp;Fluoxetine</p><p>●&nbsp;Thioridazine</p><p>●&nbsp;Warfarin</p><p>●&nbsp;Verapamil</p><p>●&nbsp;Tramadol</p><p>●&nbsp;Chlorothiazide</p><p>●&nbsp;Carbamazepine</p><p>●&nbsp;Erythromycin</p><p>●&nbsp;Disease interaction:</p><p>●&nbsp;Glaucoma</p><p>●&nbsp;Bipolar mania or depression</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Precautions</strong></h2><p>●&nbsp;Do not consume if you are allergic to the active elements present in Poxet 90mg.</p><p>●&nbsp;Ask your doctor if you have bipolar disorder, liver disease or bleeding problems.</p><p>Keep them out of sight from children.&nbsp;</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 12:26:20', '2024-12-17 12:50:49', NULL, 'Poxet 90mg - Dapoxetine Tablets | Treat Premature Ejaculation', 'Poxet 90 mg( Depoxetine HCL Tablets 90mg)', 'Poxet 90mg with Dapoxetine HCL effectively treats premature ejaculation. Improve control and performance. Buy Poxet 90mg tablets online at the best prices.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(249, '--', 'P Force Fort 150 mg', 'p-force-fort-150-mg', 'uUIsXwWq7VCw53moTPoLCMZLhIvXSEiqKr3O8xN6.jpeg', 'P Force Fort 150 mg helps to work on ED in men.', '<h2><strong>Description</strong></h2><p>P Force Fort 150 mg helps to work on ED in men. It contains the active substance of Sildenafil Citrate that helps in paramount blood flow that helps in penile erection. This Medicine is manufactured for Sunrise Remedies.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></h2><p>P Force Fort 150 mg helps in intense erection during sensual activity. The active component, Sildenafil citrate, works for enhanced pleasure during physical activity in men by having a firm erection.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></h2><p>This Medicine belongs to a group of PDE5 inhibitors. Sildenafil Citrate, an active component in P Force Fort 150 mg, releases the cGMP level in the blood vessels around the penis by promoting sexual desire in men. Medicine is useful in achieving a firm erection for satisfying performance.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Dosing Information</strong></h2><p>The recommended dose is 150 mg. Swallow one portion of P Force Fort 150 mg one hour before the sensual activity. Do not consume alcohol or grapefruit beverages with this Medicine to raise an adequate erection. Do not crush or break the tablet.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Treatment</strong></h2><p>Consult your doctor before taking P Force Fort 150 mg if you are allergic to the active substance Sildenafil Citrate. Ask the physician if you had heart stroke, hypertension, kidney or liver ailment, and low blood pressure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></h2><p>The side effects of P Force Fort 150 mg are diarrhoea, headache, dizziness, drowsiness, chest pain, and nausea.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Overdose</strong></h2><p>Do not overdose on it as it can damage the penis permanently. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></h2><p>P Force Fort 150 mg interacts with Medicine that contains nitrates like amyl nitrite, isosorbide dinitrate, and isosorbide mononitrate. It also interacts with Medicines used to treat HIV infection, fungal infection, vision problems, heart stroke, kidney or liver diseases.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Precautions</strong></h2><p>●&nbsp;Do not consume if you are allergic to Sildenafil Citrate or any active elements present in P Force Fort 150 mg.</p><p>●&nbsp;Ask your doctor if you have a kidney or liver disorder.</p><p>●&nbsp;Keep them safe from children.</p><p>●&nbsp;It does not prevent one from sexually transmitted diseases.</p><p>Do not take this Medicine if you are taking Nitrate in any form.&nbsp;</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 12:28:55', '2024-12-14 12:11:07', NULL, 'P Force Fort 150mg - Sildenafil Citrate | Powerful ED Solution', 'P Force Fort 150 mg (Sildenafil Citrate)', 'P Force Fort 150mg with Sildenafil Citrate provides a strong and reliable treatment for erectile dysfunction. Enhance performance and confidence. Buy online now.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(250, NULL, 'Sildalist 120mg', 'sildalist-120mg', 'rczYhROMcVU2vbBYuZ4de2WoykgdTHd4qXepfBGT.jpeg', 'Sildalist 120 mg is a powerful Medicine that helps in treating ED in men.', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p><strong>Description</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sildalist 120 mg is a powerful Medicine that helps in treating ED in men. It contains the active substance of Sildenafil Citrate 100mg and Tadalafil 20mg, used to treat sexual dysfunction in men. This Medicine is manufactured for RSM Enterprises.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sildalist 120 mg helps men to treat the signs and symptoms of ED(impotence) men. It is used to improve the sensual functioning of the penile area and provide a firm erection.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sildalist 120 mg helps to smooth the penile muscles and increases the flow of blood around the penis. It works effectively to treat other sensual disorders in men. The erection occurs by increasing bloodstream levels in the genitals. Sildenafil and tadalafil belong to the group of PDE5 inhibitors that helps in strong blood flow, causing the man to achieve a hard erection.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dosing Information</strong></p>\r\n<p>Take one tablet with one glass of water with a low-fat meal. Consume this Medicine 20 minutes to one hour before the sensual activity.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Treatment</strong></p>\r\n<p>Consult your doctor before taking Sildalist 120 mg if you are allergic or hypersensitive to the active substances. Ask your doctor if you have heart-related or blood pressure problems.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></p>\r\n<p>The side effects of Sildalist 120 mg are headache, diarrhoea, nausea, blurred vision and dizziness.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Overdose</strong></p>\r\n<p>Immediately seek your doctor\'s help in case of an overdose.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></p>\r\n<p>Inform your physician if you are on vitamins or herbal supplements. Sildalist 120 mg interacts with Medicines that contain active elements Sildenafil Citrate 100mg and Tadalafil 20mg.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Precautions</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Do not consume if you are allergic to Sildenafil Citrate 100mg and Tadalafil 20mg in Sildalist 120 mg.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Ask your doctor if you have a heart condition.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Keep them out of sight from children.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2022-05-13 12:31:10', '2023-05-16 11:16:55', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'thumbnail/1652445070.jpg');
INSERT INTO `products` (`id`, `alt_img`, `title`, `slug`, `image`, `excerpt`, `description`, `views`, `user_id`, `is_active`, `allow_comments`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `deleted_at`, `meta_title`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_description`, `new_launches`, `hot_offers`, `tags`, `thumbnail`) VALUES
(251, NULL, 'Sildigra Super Active Capsule', 'sildigra-super-active-capsule', 'ZYN3kM5In81B9IDAzgYyJe63OACmOBGHPAVIxx1T.jpeg', 'Sildigra Super Active Capsule is a Medicine that is used to treat ED in men by making use of Sildenafil Citrate that relaxes the blood vessels in the penis thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained.', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 137%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Description</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Sildigra Super Active Capsule is a Medicine that is used to treat ED in men by making use of Sildenafil Citrate that relaxes the blood vessels in the penis thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained. However, some athletes make use of this Medicine too due to its actions of relaxing blood vessels therefore promoting blood circulation in the body. The Medicine is manufactured by RSM Enterprises. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 137%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The Medicine is used in treating ED in men by relaxing the blood vessels around the penis. By improving blood flow to the penis, an erection can be maintained throughout sexual intercourse.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 137%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Sildenafil citrate, the active component in the Medicine, belongs to a group of PDE5 type 5 inhibitor enzymes. It helps in boosting the blood flow to the penis and improves sexual function and libido of the organ. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 137%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consume the dosage advised by the doctor with a low-fat meal and an hour before sensual activity. A high-fat meal can lower the efficacy of the Medicine. Avoid more than 1 dose within a 24-hours duration. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 137%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The Medicine should be avoided in the presence of past adverse reactions to sildenafil and does not have any use in preventing sexually transmitted diseases. Alcohol, grapes and tobacco must be avoided when taking the Medicine. In the presence of major health issues such as blood pressure issues and so on, consulting a doctor before consuming the Medicine is advisable.</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 137%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 137%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The common side effects are headache, dizziness, body pain, facial flushing, nausea or vomiting.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 137%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">In single-dose volunteer studies of doses up to 200 mg, resulting in adverse reactions like headache, flushing, dizziness, dyspepsia, nasal congestion and altered vision. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 137%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 165%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 165%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using alcohol with this Medicine as it can cause adverse reactions. Sildenafil may react with grapefruit leading to unwanted results. Doctor recommendation is a must if using any other Medicine to treat impotence in men. Tobacco must also not be consumed while taking the Medicine as it may cause adverse reactions. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0.0000pt; margin-bottom: 0.0000pt; mso-pagination: none; line-height: 137%;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Take the Medicine portion as recommended by the doctor.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Avoid using the medication if adversely affected by sildenafil in the past. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Do not consume if experiencing a bleeding issue.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">If suffering from a blood pressure issue, abstain from utilising the Medicine.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Keep the Medicine away from children.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2022-05-13 12:37:18', '2023-05-19 12:14:44', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(252, NULL, 'Sildigra Super Power', 'sildigra-super-power', 'AYluE91HEexvHUn3sb8jhPIU0wDkrN6PKARcDFXb.jpeg', 'Sildigra Super Power is a Medicine that is used to treat ED in men by making use of Sildenafil Citrate 100 mg that relaxes the blood vessels in the penis thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained.', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p><strong>Description</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sildigra Super Power is a Medicine that is used to treat ED in men by making use of Sildenafil Citrate 100 mg that relaxes the blood vessels in the penis thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained. The Medicine is manufactured by RSM Enterprises.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></p>\r\n<p>The Medicine is used in treating ED in men by relaxing the blood vessels around the penis. By improving blood flow to the penis, an erection can be maintained throughout sexual intercourse.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></p>\r\n<p>Sildenafil citrate 100 mg, the active component in the Medicine, belongs to a group of PDE5 type 5 inhibitor enzymes. It helps in boosting the blood flow to the penis and improves sexual function and libido of the organ.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dosing Information</strong></p>\r\n<p>Consume the dosage advised by the doctor with a low-fat meal and an hour before sensual activity. A high-fat meal can lower the efficacy of the Medicine. Avoid more than 1 dose within a 24-hours duration.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Treatment</strong></p>\r\n<p>The Medicine should be avoided in the presence of past adverse reactions to sildenafil and does not have any use in preventing sexually transmitted diseases. Alcohol, grapes and tobacco must be avoided when taking the Medicine. In the presence of major health issues such as blood pressure issues and so on, consulting a doctor before consuming the Medicine is advisable.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></p>\r\n<p>The common side effects are headache, dizziness, body pain, facial flushing, nausea or vomiting.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Overdose</strong></p>\r\n<p>In single-dose volunteer studies of doses up to 200 mg, resulting in adverse reactions like headache, flushing, dizziness, dyspepsia, nasal congestion and altered vision.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></p>\r\n<p>Avoid using alcohol with this Medicine as it can cause adverse reactions. Sildenafil may react with grapefruit leading to unwanted results. Doctor recommendation is a must if using any other Medicine to treat impotence in men. Tobacco must also not be consumed while taking the Medicine as it may cause adverse reactions.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Precautions</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Take the Medicine portion as recommended by the doctor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Avoid using the medication if adversely affected by sildenafil in the past.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Do not consume if experiencing a bleeding issue.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; If suffering from a blood pressure issue, abstain from utilising the Medicine.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Keep the Medicine away from children.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2022-05-13 12:39:54', '2023-05-13 10:56:54', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'thumbnail/1652445594.jpg'),
(253, NULL, 'Super P Force Oral Jelly(Sildenafil 100mg + Dapoxetine 60mg)', 'super-p-force-oral-jelly ', 'kR9feqW4Yzbv7pKKTNmbV79ot5fjTlLTPshatXeE.png', 'Super P Force Oral Jelly (Sildenafil 100mg + Dapoxetine 60mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Super Force Oral Jelly</strong> is a chewable Medicine that is used to treat ED and PE in men by making use of <strong>Sildenafil Citrate 100mg</strong> with <strong>Dapoxetine 60mg</strong> and creating a Jelly that improves libido and sexual function in the penis thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained and PE and ED can be avoided. The Medicine is manufactured by Samok Overseas. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The Medicine is used in treating ED in men by relaxing the blood vessels around the penis. By improving blood flow to the penis, an erection can be maintained throughout sexual intercourse with an improved libido.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><strong>Sildenafil Citrate 100mg</strong> in combination with <strong>Dapoxetine 60mg</strong>, the active component in the Medicine, belongs to a group of PDE5 type 5 inhibitor enzymes. It helps in boosting the blood flow to the penis and improves sexual function and libido of the organ along with delaying PE and addressing ED issues. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Consume the dosage advised by the doctor with a low-fat meal and an hour before sensual activity. A high-fat meal can lower the efficacy of the Medicine. Avoid more than 1 dose within a 24-hours duration.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The Medicine should be avoided in the presence of past adverse reactions to <strong>sildenafil</strong> or <strong>dapoxetine</strong> and does not have any use in preventing sexually transmitted diseases. Alcohol, grapes and tobacco must be avoided when taking the Medicine. In the presence of major health issues such as blood pressure issues and so on, consulting a doctor before consuming the Medicine is advisable.</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Medicines Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The common side effects are headache, dizziness, body pain, facial flushing, nausea or vomiting.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 137%; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; line-height: 137%; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=