(255, '--', 'Tadaga 20 mg', 'tadaga-20-mg', 'ZmRLWTcf7r98Fn3H8Htjgm51jGPeVtZJVK0afAhJ.jpeg', 'Tadaga 20 mg is a potent Medicine that is used to treat ED in men by making use of Tadalafil 20 mg and creating a Medicine that improves libido and sexual function in the penis thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained and impotency can be effectively treated.', '<h2><strong>Description</strong></h2><p>Tadaga 20 mg is a potent Medicine that is used to treat ED in men by making use of Tadalafil 20 mg and creating a Medicine that improves libido and sexual function in the penis thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained and impotency can be effectively treated. The Medicine is manufactured by RSM Enterprises</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></h2><p>The Medicine is used in treating ED in men by relaxing the blood vessels around the penis. By improving blood flow to the penis, an erection can be maintained throughout sexual intercourse with an improved libido.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></h2><p>Tadalafil, the active component in the Medicine, helps in boosting the blood flow to the penis and improves sexual function by tackling PDE5 inhibitor issues.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Dosing Information</strong></h2><p>Consume the dosage advised by the doctor with a low-fat meal and an hour before sensual activity. A high-fat meal can lower the efficacy of the Medicine. Avoid more than 1 dose within a 24-hours duration.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Treatment</strong></h2><p>The Medicine should be avoided in the presence of past adverse reactions to it and does not have any use in preventing sexually transmitted diseases. Alcohol, grapes and tobacco must be avoided when taking the Medicine. In the presence of major health issues such as blood pressure issues and so on, consulting a doctor before consuming the Medicine is advisable.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></h2><p>The common side effects are headache, dizziness, body pain, facial flushing, diarrhea, nausea or vomiting.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Overdose</strong></h2><p>Tadalafil 20 mg must be consumed only under the advice of a doctor and not more than once a day. In the event of an overdose, adverse reactions may occur that would require instant medical attention.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></h2><p>Avoid using alcohol with this Medicine as it can cause adverse reactions. Doctor recommendation and prescription is a must if using any other Medicine to treat impotence in men. Tobacco must also not be consumed while taking the Medicine as it may cause adverse reactions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Precautions</strong></h2><p>●&nbsp;Take the Medicine portion as recommended by the doctor.</p><p>●&nbsp;Avoid using the medication if adversely affected by sildenafil in the past.</p><p>●&nbsp;Do not consume if experiencing a bleeding, neurological or heart issue.</p><p>●&nbsp;If suffering from a blood pressure issue, abstain from utilising the Medicine.</p><p>●&nbsp;Keep the Medicine away from children.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 12:53:09', '2024-12-14 12:12:07', NULL, 'Tadaga 20mg - Tadalafil | Effective ED Treatment Solution', 'Tadaga 20 mg(Tadalafil 20 mg)', 'Tadaga 20mg tablets with Tadalafil provide a long-lasting solution for erectile dysfunction. Enjoy enhanced performance. Buy Tadaga 20mg online at great prices', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(256, '--', 'Tadaga Oral Jelly 20 mg', 'tadaga-oral-jelly-20-mg', 'cAuk4t3sj6j7fvnojYzTuCxl7CFOtw69xGnh8cmV.jpeg', 'Tadaga Oral Jelly is a potent Medicine that is used to treat ED and in men by making use of Tadalafil 20 mg and creating a Medicine that improves libido and sexual function in the penis thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained and impotency can be effectively treate', '<h2><strong>Description</strong></h2><p>Tadaga Oral Jelly is a potent Medicine that is used to treat ED and in men by making use of Tadalafil 20 mg and creating a Medicine that improves libido and sexual function in the penis thereby promoting firm erections that can be sustained and impotency can be effectively treated. The Medicine is manufactured by RSM Enterprises</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></h2><p>The Medicine is used in treating ED in men by relaxing the blood vessels around the penis. By improving blood flow to the penis, an erection can be maintained throughout sexual intercourse with an improved libido and PE can be delayed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></h2><p>Tadalafil, the active component in the Medicine, helps in boosting the blood flow to the penis and improves sexual function by tackling PDE5 inhibitor issues, and libido of the organ along with delaying PE.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Dosing Information</strong></h2><p>Consume the dosage advised by the doctor with a low-fat meal and an hour before sensual activity. A high-fat meal can lower the efficacy of the Medicine. Avoid more than 1 dose within a 24-hours duration.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Treatment</strong></h2><p>The Medicine should be avoided in the presence of past adverse reactions to it and does not have any use in preventing sexually transmitted diseases. Alcohol, grapes and tobacco must be avoided when taking the Medicine. In the presence of major health issues such as blood pressure issues and so on, consulting a doctor before consuming the Medicine is advisable.</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></h2><p>The common side effects are headache, dizziness, body pain, facial flushing, diarrhea, nausea or vomiting and sometimes, insomnia.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Overdose</strong></h2><p>Tadalafil 20 mg must be consumed only under the advice of a doctor and not more than once a day. In the event of an overdose, adverse reactions may occur that would require instant medical attention.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></h2><p>Avoid using alcohol with this Medicine as it can cause adverse reactions. Doctor recommendation and prescription is a must if using any other Medicine to treat impotence in men. Tobacco must also not be consumed while taking the Medicine as it may cause adverse reactions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>Precautions</strong></h2><p>●&nbsp;Take the Medicine portion as recommended by the doctor.</p><p>●&nbsp;Avoid using the medication if adversely affected by sildenafil in the past.</p><p>●&nbsp;Do not consume if experiencing a bleeding, neurological or heart issue.</p><p>●&nbsp;If suffering from a blood pressure issue, abstain from utilising the Medicine.</p><p>●&nbsp;Keep the Medicine away from children.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 12:55:31', '2024-12-14 12:13:10', NULL, 'Tadaga Oral Jelly 20mg - Tadalafil for ED | Fast-Acting', 'Tadaga Oral Jelly 20 mg (Tadalafil 20 mg)', 'Tadaga Oral Jelly 20mg with Tadalafil offers a fast-acting solution for erectile dysfunction. Enjoy improved performance and convenience. Buy online at great prices.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(257, NULL, 'Super eroxib 80 mg', 'super-eroxib-80-mg', 'T7BEVeJJX0By9BZx71geQhVkQoyFy8BlHP4ANLyx.jpeg', 'Super eroxib 80mg is an effective Medicine used in reducing pain and swelling in joints and muscles for conditions such as osteoarthritis, rheumatoid arthritis, ankylosing spondylitis', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p><strong>Description</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>Super eroxib 80mg is an effective Medicine used in reducing pain and swelling in joints and muscles for conditions such as osteoarthritis, rheumatoid arthritis, ankylosing spondylitis and gout for people above 16 years of age.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicine Usage:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; Super orexin 80mg contains &lsquo;etoricoxib&rsquo; that blocks the release of a chemical messenger called prostaglandin, produced by COX-2, which is responsible for pain, swelling and inflammation.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></p>\r\n<p>This enzyme helps to make other chemicals, called prostaglandins, in the body. Some prostaglandins are produced at sites of injury or damage and cause pain and inflammation. By blocking the effect of COX-2 enzymes, fewer prostaglandins are produced, which means pain and inflammation are eased.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dosing information:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Always take the dose recommended by your doctor</p>\r\n<p><strong>Treatment</strong></p>\r\n<p>Consult your doctor before taking Super Eroxib if you are allergic or hypersensitive to the Tadalafil 20mg. Ask your surgeon if you have kidney or liver issues.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></p>\r\n<p>The side effects of Sildigra 50 mg are headache, stomach upset, stuffy nose, nausea, diarrhoea, blurred vision and dizziness.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Overdose</strong></p>\r\n<p>Immediately seek your doctor\'s help in case of an overdose.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></p>\r\n<p>Inform your physician if you are on vitamins or herbal supplements. Super Eroxib interacts with Medicines that contain active elements Tadalafil 20mg.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Precautions</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Do not consume if you are allergic to Super Eroxib in Tadalafil 20 mg.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Keep them away from children.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; It does not prevent one from sexually transmitted diseases.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Abstain using this Medicine if you have health illnesses related to kidney or liver must avoid the medication</p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2022-05-13 12:59:09', '2023-05-19 11:29:41', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'thumbnail/1652446749.jpeg'),
(258, '--', 'Zhewitra 40', 'zhewitra-40', 'bQrXkYvxBRNvtgEUVzXFBOQP1naLgmgU21CsYR74.jpeg', 'Zhewitra 40 is taken by men to cure erectile malfunction. This Medicine helps men to enhance their power to have a firm sexual life', '<p><strong>Description:</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Zhewitra 40 is taken by men to cure erectile malfunction. This Medicine helps men to enhance their power to have a firm sexual life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>Medicine usage:</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Zhewitra 40 mg works by hindering the action of PDE-5 blocker that aids to lessen the blood vessels and recovers the proper movement of blood to the man reproductive system and accomplishes the desire of <a href=\"https://strapcart.com/erectile-dysfunction/i-want-a-stronger-sexual-life-but-how/\">sexual</a>&nbsp;intercourse.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Mechanism</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Zhewitra 40 mg stops the activity of this enzyme and improves the blood flow to the penis which makes it firm and erect. Also, the blood vessels carrying blood away from the penis decrease in size and decrease the removal of blood from the penis.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Dosing information:</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Swallow the tablet with a glass of water. Take exactly as directed. A well balanced diet is essential while consuming this medication. Consumed within an hour of planned intercourse and in most cases it aids impotent men to get an erection in just 30 minutes of intake.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Treatment:</strong></p><p>Seek your doctor’s help if you have liver or kidney disease,seizures, blood cell disorder, stomach ulcer, hearing or vision problem, if prescribed to avoid sexual intercourse or physical deformity of penis. In all above mentioned cases it is required to consult your doctor before starting with this medication.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicine side effects:</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Some of the side effects are dizziness, stuffy nose, nausea, headache, chest pain, loss of vision, hearing loss.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Overdose:</strong></p><p>Overdose should be strictly avoided.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicine interactions:</strong></p><p>You are not allergic to Vardenafil, do not take alcohol, you have told your doctor about your medical history like pre-existing disease, Food Habits, herbal supplements, medications, vitamins, etc.</p><p><strong>Precautions:</strong></p><p>●&nbsp;Do not take vardenafil if you also take riociguat (Adempas) or a nitrate Medicine such as nitroglycerin.</p><p>●&nbsp;Seek medical attention if your erection is painful or lasts longer than 4 hours.</p><p>●&nbsp;Get medical help if you have sudden vision loss.&nbsp;</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 13:01:12', '2024-12-14 12:14:05', NULL, 'Zhewitra 40mg - Vardenafil Tablets for ED Treatment', 'Zhewitra 40,vardenafil Tablets 40mg', 'Zhewitra 40mg with Vardenafil effectively treats erectile dysfunction. Enhance performance and confidence. Buy Zhewitra 40mg tablets online at affordable prices.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
