<p>Some of the side effects are Pain in the muscles, Bleeding nose, Diarrhoea, Difficulty in breathing, Flushing, Headache, Sneezing, Redness on skin, Difficulty in sleeping, Pain in the eyes.</p><p><strong>Overdose:</strong></p><p>Overdose is strictly prohibited. It can cause dizziness, fainting, or painful/prolonged erection.</p><p><strong>Medicine interactions:</strong></p><p>Some of the Medicines Vidalista 40 interact with are Amyl Nitrite, Amprenavir, Atazanavir, Boceprevir, Cobicistat, Darunavir, Erythrityl Tetranitrate, Indinavir</p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Precautions:</strong></p><p>●&nbsp;Do not consume Vidalista 40 if you are allergic to Tadalafil.</p><p>●&nbsp;Consult the doctor if the erection lasts for more than 4 hours.</p><p>●&nbsp;Do not take any other Medicine without consulting the doctor.</p><p>●&nbsp;Do not take any other Medicine containing tadalafil or any other ED pill, such as Viagra, Vardenafil, Cialis, etc. with Vidalista 40..</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 13:13:17', '2024-12-14 12:21:11', NULL, 'Vidalista 40mg - Tadalafil Tablets for ED Treatment', NULL, 'Vidalista 40mg with Tadalafil offers effective relief for erectile dysfunction. Improve performance and confidence. Buy Vidalista 40mg tablets online at great prices.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
