(266, NULL, 'Victor jelly 20', 'victor-jelly-20', 'D5bDLppGfLmWcJRPVvfbq5JgEQZgVH48ZqiBlHmd.jpeg', 'Victor Jelly 20 mg is an effective Medicine for men having the issue of ED.This jelly has vardenafil in it which is a PDE5 inhibitor that helps attain an erection.', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p><strong>Description</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>Victor Jelly 20 mg is an effective Medicine for men having the issue of ED.This jelly has vardenafil in it which is a PDE5 inhibitor that helps attain an erection. It treats impotence and diseases related with PDE5 inhibitors.The manufacturing of the Medicine is done for Samok Overseas.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicine usage:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Victor Jelly 20mg contains an essential agent vardenafil which leads to smooth muscles and widening blood vessels in penis. Victor\'s jelly helps men to maintain their erection for a longer time and provides them more satisfaction.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Mechanism</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>Victor jelly is easy to swallow.&nbsp; It is available in various flavours. The jellys consists of vardenafil which helps to hold erection for longer duration widening blood vessels in penis. The erectile malfunction in men can be eased by victor jelly 20.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dosing Information:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>Take Victor jelly before 15-30 mins of sexual intercourse. It is easy to swallow and is more helpful for older men.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Treatment:</strong></p>\r\n<p>A person with problems like diseases of the liver, kidney, vision problems, bleeding cells, physical deformity of penis must inform all these concerns before hand to their doctor. This Medicine will not protect from sexually transmitted diseases.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicine side effects:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Some of the side effects of taking this medication is shortness of breath, dizziness, headache, visionary problems, seizure.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Overdose:</strong></p>\r\n<p>The dose of Medicine should only be taken as per recommended by the doctor. Overdose can lead to different problems.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicine interactions:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; This Medicine can interact with Medicines like Nitrate Medicines like nitroglycerin, Prostate disorders Medicines like alfuzosin, Terazosin, Doxazosin, tamsulosin etc</p>\r\n<p><strong>Precautions</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; This Medicine should only be taken if prescribed by a doctor.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; This Medicine is not preferable with Medicines containing nitrates.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; LIght meal is preferable while taking this Medicine for more effect.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2022-05-13 13:17:38', '2023-05-19 11:34:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'thumbnail/1652447858.jpeg'),
(267, '--', 'Tadarise 40', 'tadarise-40', 'wzlOwnZmHLAZLH9k7Hmot1npL0ljwKpllubsLLTd.jpeg', 'Tadarise 40 is a potent Medicine to treat ED in men. Tadarise 40 Mg contains an active agent Tadalafil, which is used for EDing treatment in men.', '<p><strong>Description:</strong></p><p>Tadarise 40 is a potent Medicine to treat ED in men. Tadarise 40 Mg contains an active agent Tadalafil, which is used for EDing treatment in men. The manufacturing of the Medicine is done for Sunrise Remedies.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicine usage:</strong></p><p>Tadarise contains an effective and active agent tadalafil which relaxes the muscles in penile vessels and in turn increases the blood flow providing men a satisfactory experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Mechanism:</strong></p><p>The tadalafil ingredient in Tadarise 40 relaxes the smooth flow and paves the way for smooth blood flow. This helps men to have a satisfactory sexual stimulation and can hold their erection for longer duration.</p><p><strong>Dosing information:</strong></p><p>Tadarise is meant for oral consumption. It is better to have it around 40 minutes before the love making session. Swallow it, do not break it. It is recommended not to take more than one dose a day as its effects remain for longer duration.</p><p><strong>&nbsp;Treatment:</strong></p><p>Tadarise 40 cannot protect from sexually transmitted diseases. It is meant for the treatment of ED. It has an active agent called tadalafil which smoothens the muscles and increases the blood flow which enables to have a fulfilled experience.</p><p>&nbsp;<strong>Medicine side effects:</strong></p><p>Some of the side effects are increased thirst, light-headedness, flushing, nasal congestion, headaches, back and muscle pain, and temporary rashes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Overdose:</strong></p><p>The dose should be taken according to the doctor\'s recommendation and overdose is strictly avoided. These Medicines\' effects last longer and overdose can lead to adverse effects.</p><p><br><strong>Medicine interactions:</strong></p><p>This Medicine has interactions with Medicines that include nitrate Medicines like Glyceryl Trinitrate, Erythromycin, Rifampicin, and Itraconazole.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Precautions:</p><p>●&nbsp;Keep out of reach and sight of the children</p><p>●&nbsp;Consult your doctor regarding the dosing information and the route of administration of the medication.</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 13:19:36', '2024-12-14 12:23:14', NULL, 'Tadarise 40mg - Tadalafil Tablets for ED Treatment', 'Tadarise 40 (Tadalafil Tablets)', 'Tadarise 40mg with Tadalafil effectively treats erectile dysfunction. Boost performance and confidence. Buy Tadarise 40mg tablets online at affordable prices.', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(268, '--', 'Tadarise 20', 'tadarise-20', 'xXfZ5NCSBrh70WzxrWlLP95XTd9G0lNiBqqCU8kY.jpeg', 'Tadarise 20 is a potent Medicine to treat ED in men. Tadarise 20 Mg contains an active agent Tadalafil, which is used for EDing treatment in men.', '<p><strong>Description:</strong></p><p>Tadarise 20 is a potent Medicine to treat ED in men. Tadarise 20 Mg contains an active agent Tadalafil, which is used for EDing treatment in men. The manufacturing of the Medicine is done for Sunrise Remedies.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicine usage:</strong></p><p>Tadarise contains an effective and active agent tadalafil which relaxes the muscles in penile vessels and in turn increases the blood flow providing men a satisfactory experience.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Mechanism:</strong></p><p>The tadalafil ingredient in Tadarise 20 relaxes the smooth flow and paves the way for smooth blood flow. This helps men to have a satisfactory sexual stimulation and can hold their erection for longer duration.</p><p><strong>Dosing information:</strong></p><p>Tadarise is meant for oral consumption. It is better to have it around 20 minutes before the love making session. Swallow it, do not break it. It is recommended not to take more than one dose a day as its effects remain for longer duration.</p><p><strong>&nbsp;Treatment:</strong></p><p>Tadarise 20 cannot protect from sexually transmitted diseases. It is meant for the treatment of ED. It has an active agent called tadalafil which smoothens the muscles and increases the blood flow which enables to have a fulfilled experience.</p><p>&nbsp;<strong>Medicine side effects:</strong></p><p>Some of the side effects are increased thirst, light-headedness, flushing, nasal congestion, headaches, back and muscle pain, and temporary rashes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Overdose:</strong></p><p>The dose should be taken according to the doctor\'s recommendation and overdose is strictly avoided. These Medicines\' effects last longer and overdose can lead to adverse