(269, NULL, 'Tadapox', 'tadapox', 'E3iaSwg8Y7R7E6y1cq8yWIKlFIa3nb59IckPoL0T.jpeg', 'Tadapox is a dual purpose medication used for ED and PE. It ensures more considerable blood flow to help with the firm erection.', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt; background: #fafafa; mso-shading: #fafafa;\">Description:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.0000pt; background: #fafafa; mso-shading: #fafafa;\">Tadapox is a dual purpose medication used for ED and PE.</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #071d35; font-size: 11pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 14pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">It ensures more considerable blood flow to help with the firm erection.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">The manufacturing of the Medicine is done for RSM Enterprises</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\