-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Avoid taking a second dose within the 24-hours duration.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt;\">Treatment:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Tadapox won&rsquo;t protect against sexually transmitted diseases.</span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">Excessive consumption of alcohol with the Medicine can hinder the normal functioning of the body. It should be taken after proper recommendation from the doctor.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Verdana; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 15.0000pt;\">Medicine side effects:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Some of the common side effects caused due to tadapox are nausea, headache, dizziness, blurry vision, diarrhea.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Overdose:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Overdose is not recommended. It can show adverse effects and symptoms like dizziness, headache, erection for prolonged periods.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 33pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Medicine interactions:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Interactions with Medicines having nitrates as it can cause a drop in blood pressure. As a result, it leads to dizziness, fainting and stroke in rare cases. Avoid consuming this Medicine with other Medicines to treat high blood pressure and chest pain.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt;\">Precautions:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-font-weight: bold; font-size: 16.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Women shouldn\'t consume this Medicine.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Avoid consuming the Medicine with alcohol. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0000pt; text-indent: -18.0000pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Consult in case of genital deformity.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" align=\"justify\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">●&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Arial; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt;\">Avoid taking the double dosage.</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2022-05-13 13:24:08', '2023-06-20 09:26:26', '2023-06-20 09:26:26', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(270, NULL, 'Tadagra super active capsule', 'tadagra-super-active-capsule', '7OGsOVLgfpH87UNMx6nUZPuLOrgmo2A9K5tNwBFG.jpeg', 'Tadagra super active capsule is useful for improving ED in men effortlessly. It is a powerful medication, helps to attain a firm erection for satisfying sensual activity.', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p><strong>Description</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>Tadagra super active capsule is useful for improving ED in men effortlessly. It is a powerful medication, helps to attain a firm erection for satisfying sensual activity. The manufacturing of Tadagra super active capsule is done for RSM Enterprises.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicine usage:</strong></p>\r\n<p>It helps in&nbsp; relaxing the blood vessels providing a proper amount of blood flow to the penile region. The Medicine belongs to PDE5 inhibitor enzymes which increases the concentration of cGMP in the body. This ensures firm erection.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Mechanism</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>Tadagra super active capsule comprises Tadalafil&nbsp; as an active agent to treat ED efficiently. It belongs to a class of PDE5 inhibitors, that helps promote the cGMP levels in the blood vessels. The increased blood flow works to increase the sensual functioning in the body.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Dosing information:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Take the accurate dosage of Tadagra super active capsule once in a day as per doctor\'s recommendation. For the sensual arousal, take the dosage with no meal or a low-fat meal with a glass of water.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Treatment</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>Tadagra super active capsule won&rsquo;t protect against sexually transmitted diseases.Excessive consumption of alcohol with the Medicine can hinder the normal functioning of the body. It should be taken after proper recommendation from the doctor.</p>\r\n<p>Medicine side effects:</p>\r\n<p>Side effects of Tadagra super active capsule are Headache, Dizziness, Facial Flushing, Nausea, Diarrhea, Vomiting, and Insomnia.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Overdose</strong>:</p>\r\n<p>Overdose is strictly prohibited. It can cause dizziness, fainting, or painful/prolonged erection.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Medicine interactions:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Tadagra super active capsule can cause a drop in blood pressure if consumed with nitrates.&nbsp; Some of the Medicines that can remove the effect of Tadalafil are azole antifungals, HIV protease inhibitors, and Hepatitis C protease inhibitors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Precautions:</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; Tadagra Super Active is a prescription Medicine and should not be consumed if one is allergic to the active component of tadalafil.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; &middot; Do not try to consume the Medicine with nitrates or nitrites.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &bull; &middot; The Medicine is to be adjusted for a person with liver or kidney disease.</p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 0, 1, '2022-05-13 13:26:39', '2023-05-19 11:58:34', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, ''),
