(285, 'DHUrrdLU0q3H3qrRagqRk0cjgw2STxLvswVU3ihF.webp', 'Extra Super M Force (Sildenafil 100(USP) + Dapoxetine 100mg)', 'extra-super-m-force-sildenafil-100-usp-dapoxetine-100mg', 'DHUrrdLU0q3H3qrRagqRk0cjgw2STxLvswVU3ihF.png', 'Extra Super M Force (Sildenafil 100(USP) + Dapoxetine 100mg)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><strong>Extra Super M Force</strong> medication is valuable in the treatment of sensual ailments. It has a fundamental combinational component of <strong>Sildenafil Citrate 100mg</strong> and <strong>Dapoxetine 100mg</strong>. It is powerful for treating Erectile Dysfunction and Premature Ejaculation in men. The medication is manufactured for <strong>RSM Multilink LLP.</strong> The pill contains a PDE-5 inhibitor with SSRI for treating exotic ailments. It works by expanding the progression of blood in the penile region by loosening up the veins.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">The medication is safe and endorsed, offering a rigid and robust erection with penetration. <strong>Extra Super M Force</strong> is likewise helpful to redo the gone desire for sensual coupling in men. The medication\'s impact begins in about one hour of use and lasts 4 hours. It is prudent not to take medicines with similar remedies for treating ED or PE. Medication utilization doesn\'t help prevent or safeguard an individual from transmitting illnesses.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Medicine Usage</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><strong>Extra Super M Force</strong> treats erectile dysfunction and premature ejaculation in adult men, providing a comprehensive solution to sensual performance issues and restoring confidence in the bedroom.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Mechanism of Action</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><strong>Extra Super M Force</strong> works by inhibiting the enzyme phosphodiesterase-5 (PDE5) and increasing the levels of nitric oxide in the body. It helps relax the smooth muscles of the blood vessels in the genital part, improving blood flow and a stronger erection. It also regulates serotonin levels, delaying ejaculation and prolonging sensual activity.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Dosing Information</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Ingest the medication according to the specialist\'s endorsement. Gulp down the pill as an entire without breaking or pounding it. Take medication routinely simultaneously daily. Try not to take a deficient measure of medicines without a specialist\'s solution. Try not to overlook or double the dose. Overdosing medication can bring about unfavorable well-being impacts. Take the pill an hour prior sensual act.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Treatment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Consult your doctor before taking <strong>Extra Super M Force</strong> if you are allergic or hypersensitive to active substances. Ask your physician if you have liver or heart-related problems.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Medicine Side Effects</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Side effects of ingesting this pill may differ from person to person. Some of the common side effects of consuming <strong>Extra Super M Force</strong> are:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Headache</span></li>\r\n<li><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Touchiness</span></li>\r\n<li><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Vomiting</span></li>\r\n<li><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Lethargy</span></li>\r\n<li><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Nausea</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Overdose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Do not surpass the suggested dosage of this prescription. Overdosing may lead to serious side effects. Consult a healthcare professional immediately if overdose symptoms occur.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Medicine Interactions</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">The medicine that may interact with this pill is riociguat, nitroglycerin, isosorbide, doxazosin, tamsulosin, itraconazole, ketoconazole, ritonavir, and saquinavir.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Calibri; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14pt;\">Precautions</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\"><strong>Extra Super M Force</strong> is a physician-recommended medication and should be avoided without speaking with a specialist.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Before taking the medication, it is critical to note if you are not oversensitive to <strong>Sildenafil citrate</strong>, <strong>Dapoxetine</strong>, or other parts of the medicine.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Inform the specialist about the clinical sickness if you have any, like cardiovascular infection, diabetes, bleeding turmoil, kidney or liver sickness.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">The medication is just for adult men\'s utilization. Keep away from it from ladies and youngsters.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Avoid using the medication with natural nitrates or nitrites and recreational pills.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"mso-spacerun: \'yes\'; font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #0e101a; font-size: 14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt;\">Stay away from liquor, smoke, and grapefruit with medication.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2023-05-17 13:09:28', '2023-05-17 13:17:57', NULL, 'Extra Super M Force (Sildenafil 100mg + Dapoxetine 100mg) - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Buy Extra Super M Force,Buy Sildenafil 100mg,Buy Dapoxetine 100mg,RSM Multilink LLP,Purchase Extra Super M Force, Extra Super P Force', 'Extra Super M Force (Sildenafil 100mg + Dapoxetine 100mg) is an eminent medicine that works to heal Erectile Dysfunction and Premature Ejaculation in men.', 1, 0, NULL, ''),
(286, '--', 'Female UP (Tadalafil 20mg)', 'female-up-tadalafil-20mg', '5sMK4X21LyufoaBWwEKNw8kS1v4BfK9g9U3t3ijd.png', 'Female UP (Tadalafil 20mg)', '<p><strong>Female Up 20mg</strong> is an effective Medicine, helps in treating sensual dysfunction in women. The active component of this Medicine is <strong>Tadalafil 20mg</strong>. This Medicine is manufactured for <strong>RSM Multilink LLP</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicine Usage</strong></p><p><strong>Female Up 20mg</strong> help dilate internal pudendal arteries by improving physical health disorders in women. It provides enhanced functioning in women by improving blood flow in private parts, thereby satisfying sensual capability. It also helps in treating pulmonary arterial hypertension to improve stamina.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Mechanism of Action</strong></p><p><strong>Female Up 20mg</strong> relaxes the muscles and boosts stamina during the sensual act. It carries blood from the right side of the heart to the lungs.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Dosing Information</strong></p><p>Consume a single Medicine of <strong>Female Up 20mg</strong> with a full glass of water. Try not to chew or break it. Do not skip the second dose or repeat the dosage without consultation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Treatment</strong></p><p>Consume <strong>Female Up 20mg</strong> as prescribed by your physician. Consider the allergic reactions to Medicine that contain <strong>Tadalafil 20mg</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicines Side Effects</strong></p><p>Side effects of <strong>Female Up 20mg</strong> are sleeping disorders, dizziness, dry mouth, low blood pressure, Indigestion, and Nausea.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Overdose</strong></p><p>Call your physician immediately in case of an overdose, as it can have adverse effects on the body.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Medicine Interactions</strong></p><p>The interaction may occur if two Medicines are combined. <strong>Female Up 20mg</strong> interacts with the following Medicines:</p><p>●&nbsp;Amyl Nitrite</p><p>●&nbsp;Erythrityl Tetranitrate</p><p>●&nbsp;Isosorbide Dinitrate</p><p>●&nbsp;Isosorbide Mononitrate</p><p>●&nbsp;Propatyl Nitrate</p><p>●&nbsp;Riociguat</p><p>●&nbsp;Telaprevir</p><p>●&nbsp;Boceprevir</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Precautions</strong></p><ul><li>Do not consume if you are sensitive to <strong>Tadalafil 20mg</strong> or any ingredients from this Medicine.</li><li>Keep it safe and out of sight from children.</li><li>Do not take this Medicine if you have diabetes, bleeding disorder, heart or any other health issues.</li><li>Do not consume Grapefruit beverages and alcohol with <strong>Female Up 20</strong>.</li></ul>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2023-05-19 10:37:27', '2024-12-13 16:08:23', NULL, 'Buy Female Up (Tadalafil 20mg) Tablets for Women - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Female UP (Tadalafil 20mg)', 'Buy Female Up (Tadalafil 20mg) Tablets for Women at RSM Multilink LLP store to improve sensual desire. Visit store now for discounts!!', 0, 0, NULL, ''),
(287, NULL, 'test product', 'test-product', 'CxUxaJiJQfYSngLJ0hG4x5WXno4P7ZVPAOa515TX.jpeg', 'test test test', '<p>test test test test &nbsp;test testttttttt test&nbsp;</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2024-03-26 10:18:22', '2024-03-26 10:18:56', '2024-03-26 10:18:56', 'qqqqqq', 'dqdwqfd', 'dqdqdwq', 0, 0, 'test', 'thumbnail/1711448302.jpg'),
(288, 'qKbEWkjoOmzNRbuAnQMGxSX3gfu005QFzNQrwkFb.webp', 'Maxgun Sublingual Spray (Sildenafil Sublingual Spray)', 'maxgun-sublingual-spray-sildenafil-sublingual-spray', 'qKbEWkjoOmzNRbuAnQMGxSX3gfu005QFzNQrwkFb.jpeg', 'Maxgun Sublingual Spray (Sildenafil Sublingual Spray)', '<p><strong>Maxgun Sublingual Spray (Sildenafil Sublingual Spray)</strong> is a typical groundbreaking product designed to ensure confidence, alleviate a problem and improve overall male vitality discreetly and reliably. Much research has been dedicated to formulating this top product, which comes in a spray and uses <strong>sildenafil citrate</strong> to support men with performance and confidence issues in their intimate encounters. Crafted to ensure fast action and effectiveness, <strong>Maxgun Sublingual Spray </strong>follows discreet and painless ways of revitalizing male strength.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Benefits</strong></p><p>• <strong>Maxgun Sublingual Spray</strong> would be more appealing if it had sildenafil citrate. This advanced medication helps increase blood flow to the human genitalia during sensual intercourse, therefore enhancing performance and stamina.</p><p>• One of the principal distinguishing features of <strong>Sildenafil Sublingual Spray</strong> is its rapid effect. That is, this product will help a man to be self-assured and satisfied with his actions, resulting in the mutual pleasure of both partners.</p><p>• The sublingual spray forms the core of this delivery system and guarantees an inconspicuous and user-friendly mode of administration. Fast absorption and rapid onset of actions are achieved without taking water or swallowing pills.</p><p>• <strong>Maxgun Sublingual Spray</strong> signifies longevity, which helps the users enjoy the activity for a long duration without encountering premature performance until the end.</p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Dosage</strong></p><p><strong>Usage Instructions:</strong>&nbsp;Remember to shake the container before every use. You need to spray 1-3 shots or 1-3 sprays under the tongue apart from sublingual absorption. Wait a few seconds for the spray to be inhaled before taking your beverage or food. For the best experience, try using the product about 15-30 minutes before foreplay.</p><p><strong>Recommended Dosage:</strong>&nbsp;Start with the lower dose (1 spray), and after familiarizing yourself with the effect, add more spray if necessary, as you have yet to feel the impact. Sticking to a maximum of three sprays inside a 24 period is advisable.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Precautions</strong></p><p>• Before using it, individuals with pre-existing medical conditions (for example, cardiovascular problems and hypertension) should meet with their healthcare professionals and ask for compatibility information regarding the tablets’ ingredients.</p><p>• The use of <strong>Sildenafil Sublingual Spray</strong>, along with alcohol, brings possible adverse reactions like dizziness or lightheadedness, which may get aggravated. Thus, it is suggested to keep the intake of alcohol to a minimum or altogether avoid it.</p><p>• <strong>Sildenafil Sublingual Spray</strong> targets adult males specifically and is intended for users aged 18 and above or females. Keep this product away from children.</p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Side Effects</strong></p><p>·&nbsp;Headache</p><p>·&nbsp;Facial Flushing</p><p>·&nbsp;Nasal Congestion</p><p>· Dizziness</p>', 1, 4, 1, 1, '2024-03-26 11:23:15', '2024-04-08 05:50:31', NULL, 'Buy Maxgun Sublingual Spray | Buy Sildenafil Sublingual Spray - RSM Multilink LLP', 'Maxgun Sublingual Spray, Buy Sildenafil Citrate Sublingual Spray,Purchase Online Maxgun Sublingual Spray,buy Sildenafil Citrate Tablets', 'Buy online Sildenafil Sublingual Spray  (Maxgun Sublingual Spray)-EU GMP Certified product. It helps to enhance male stamina by improving the quality of life of a person.', 1, 0, NULL, 'thumbnail/1712555431.jpeg'),
