(8, 'Nil', 'modafinil-134', 4, '2020-01-22 23:36:30', '2025-05-02 17:03:59', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'c4GgiifMKekyOE91bhEyQT2Dzspnor8UQVHiwaOJ.jpeg', '32', '{{{<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">RSM Enetrprises brings Modafinil to clients which includes Modalert, Modafresh and Modvigil. Many people buy Modafinil online generally because the fact that this medication has memory enhancing, temperament lighting up properties that stress vigilance and alertness in the users. Modafinil is known to be a wakefulness promoting agent and despite the fact that there is no bad-to-the-bone medicinal confirmation to demonstrate how precisely the medication functions, it is accepted that the medication meets expectations by keeping the regular chemicals in the cerebrum caution at all times.</span></p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1),
